    .string "And it came to pass on the day that\n"
    .string "Moses had fully set up the\l"
    .string "tabernacle, and had anointed it, and\l"
    .string "sanctified it, and all the\l"
    .string "instruments thereof, both the altar\l"
    .string "and all the vessels thereof, and\l"
    .string "had anointed them, and sanctified\l"
    .string "them;"
Bible_Text_Numbers_7_2::
    .string "That the princes of Israel, heads\n"
    .string "of the house of their fathers, who\l"
    .string "were the princes of the tribes, and\l"
    .string "were over them that were numbered,\l"
    .string "offered:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_7_3::
    .string "And they brought their offering\n"
    .string "before the LORD, six covered wagons,\l"
    .string "and twelve oxen; a wagon for two of\l"
    .string "the princes, and for each one an ox:\l"
    .string "and they brought them before the\l"
    .string "tabernacle$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_7_4::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_7_5::
    .string "Take it of them, that they may be to\n"
    .string "do the service of the tabernacle of\l"
    .string "the congregation; and thou shalt\l"
    .string "give them unto the Levites, to every\l"
    .string "man according to his service$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_7_6::
    .string "And Moses took the wagons and the\n"
    .string "oxen, and gave them unto the Levites.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_7_7::
    .string "Two wagons and four oxen he gave\n"
    .string "unto the sons of Gershon, according\l"
    .string "to their service:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_7_8::
