    .string "sanctuary belonging unto them was\l"
    .string "that they should bear upon their\l"
    .string "shoulders.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_7_10::
    .string "And the princes offered for\n"
    .string "dedicating of the altar in the day\l"
    .string "that it was anointed, even the\l"
    .string "princes offered their offering\l"
    .string "before the altar.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_7_11::
    .string "And the LORD said unto Moses, They\n"
    .string "shall offer their offering, each\l"
    .string "prince on his day, for the dedicating\l"
    .string "of the altar.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_7_12::
    .string "And he that offered his offering the\n"
    .string "first day was Nahshon the son of\l"
    .string "Amminadab, of the tribe of Judah:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_7_13::
    .string "And his offering was one silver\n"
