    .string "offering:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_7_77::
    .string "And for a sacrifice of peace\n"
    .string "offerings, two oxen, five rams, five\l"
    .string "he goats, five lambs of the first\l"
    .string "year: this was the offering of\l"
    .string "Pagiel the son of Ocran$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_7_78::
    .string "On the twelfth day Ahira the son of\n"
    .string "Enan, prince of the children of\l"
    .string "Naphtali, offered:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_7_79::
    .string "His offering was one silver\n"
    .string "charger, the weight whereof was an\l"
    .string "hundred and thirty shekels, one\l"
    .string "silver bowl of seventy shekels,\l"
    .string "after the shekel of the sanctuary;\l"
    .string "both of them full of fine flour\l"
    .string "mingled with oil for a meat\l"
    .string "offering:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_7_80::
    .string "One golden spoon of ten shekels,\n"
    .string "full of incense:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_7_81::
    .string "One young bullock, one ram, one\n"
    .string "lamb of the first year, for a burnt\l"
    .string "offering:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_7_82::
