    .string "offering:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_7_83::
    .string "And for a sacrifice of peace\n"
    .string "offerings, two oxen, five rams, five\l"
    .string "he goats, five lambs of the first\l"
    .string "year: this was the offering of Ahira\l"
    .string "the son of Enan$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_7_84::
    .string "This was the dedication of the\n"
    .string "altar, in the day when it was\l"
    .string "anointed, by the princes of Israel:\l"
    .string "twelve chargers of silver, twelve\l"
    .string "silver bowls, twelve spoons of\l"
    .string "gold:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_7_85::
    .string "Each charger of silver weighing an\n"
    .string "hundred and thirty shekels, each\l"
    .string "bowl seventy: all the silver\l"
    .string "vessels weighed two thousand and\l"
    .string "four hundred shekels, after the\l"
    .string "shekel of the sanctuary:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_7_86::
    .string "The golden spoons were twelve,\n"
    .string "full of incense, weighing ten\l"
    .string "shekels apiece, after the shekel of\l"
    .string "the sanctuary: all the gold of the\l"
    .string "spoons was an hundred and twenty\l"
    .string "shekels$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_7_87::
    .string "All the oxen for the burnt\n"
    .string "offering were twelve bullocks, the\l"
    .string "rams twelve, the lambs of the first\l"
    .string "year twelve, with their meat\l"
    .string "offering: and the kids of the goats\l"
    .string "for sin offering twelve.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_7_88::
    .string "And all the oxen for the sacrifice\n"
    .string "of the peace offerings were twenty\l"
    .string "and four bullocks, the rams sixty,\l"
    .string "the he goats sixty, the lambs of the\l"
    .string "first year sixty. This was the\l"
    .string "dedication of the altar, after that\l"
    .string "it was anointed.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_7_89::
    .string "And when Moses was gone into the\n"
    .string "tabernacle of the congregation to\l"
    .string "speak with him, then he heard the\l"
    .string "voice of one speaking unto him from\l"
    .string "off the mercy seat that was upon the\l"
    .string "ark of testimony, from between the\l"
    .string "two cherubims: and he spake unto him.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_8_1::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_8_2::
    .string "Speak unto Aaron and say unto him,\n"
    .string "When thou lightest the lamps, the\l"
    .string "seven lamps shall give light over\l"
    .string "against the candlestick$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_8_3::
    .string "And Aaron did so; he lighted the\n"
    .string "lamps thereof over against the\l"
    .string "candlestick, as the LORD commanded\l"
    .string "Moses.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_8_4::
    .string "And this work of the candlestick\n"
    .string "was of beaten gold, unto the shaft\l"
    .string "thereof, unto the flowers thereof,\l"
    .string "was beaten work: according unto the\l"
    .string "pattern which the LORD had shewed\l"
    .string "Moses, so he made the candlestick.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_8_5::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_8_6::
    .string "Take the Levites from among the\n"
    .string "children of Israel, and cleanse\l"
    .string "them$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_8_7::
    .string "And thus shalt thou do unto them, to\n"
    .string "cleanse them: Sprinkle water of\l"
    .string "purifying upon them, and let them\l"
    .string "shave all their flesh, and let\l"
    .string "them wash their clothes, and so make\l"
    .string "themselves clean.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_8_8::
    .string "Then let them take a young bullock\n"
    .string "with his meat offering, even fine\l"
    .string "flour mingled with oil, and another\l"
    .string "young bullock shalt thou take for a\l"
    .string "sin offering.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_8_9::
    .string "And thou shalt bring the Levites\n"
    .string "before the tabernacle of the\l"
    .string "congregation: and thou shalt gather\l"
    .string "the whole assembly of the children\l"
    .string "of Israel together:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_8_10::
    .string "And thou shalt bring the Levites\n"
    .string "before the LORD: and the children of\l"
    .string "Israel shall put their hands upon\l"
    .string "the Levites:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_8_11::
    .string "And Aaron shall offer the Levites\n"
    .string "before the LORD for an offering of\l"
    .string "the children of Israel, that they\l"
    .string "may execute the service of the LORD$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_8_12::
    .string "And the Levites shall lay their\n"
    .string "hands upon the heads of the\l"
    .string "bullocks: and thou shalt offer the\l"
    .string "one for a sin offering, and the other\l"
    .string "for a burnt offering, unto the LORD,\l"
    .string "to make an atonement for the Levites.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_8_13::
    .string "And thou shalt set the Levites\n"
    .string "before Aaron, and before his sons,\l"
    .string "and offer them for an offering unto\l"
    .string "the LORD.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_8_14::
    .string "Thus shalt thou separate the\n"
    .string "Levites from among the children of\l"
    .string "Israel: and the Levites shall be\l"
    .string "mine.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_8_15::
    .string "And after that shall the Levites\n"
    .string "go in to do the service of the\l"
    .string "tabernacle of the congregation: and\l"
    .string "thou shalt cleanse them, and offer\l"
    .string "them for an offering.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_8_16::
    .string "For they are wholly given unto me\n"
    .string "from among the children of Israel;\l"
    .string "instead of such as open every womb,\l"
    .string "even instead of the firstborn of\l"
    .string "all the children of Israel, have I\l"
    .string "taken them unto me.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_8_17::
    .string "For all the firstborn of the\n"
    .string "children of Israel are mine, both\l"
    .string "man and beast: on the day that I smote\l"
    .string "every firstborn in the land of\l"
    .string "Egypt I sanctified them for myself.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_8_18::
    .string "And I have taken the Levites for\n"
    .string "all the firstborn of the children\l"
    .string "of Israel.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_8_19::
    .string "And I have given the Levites as a\n"
    .string "gift to Aaron and to his sons from\l"
    .string "among the children of Israel, to do\l"
    .string "the service of the children of\l"
    .string "Israel in the tabernacle of the\l"
    .string "congregation, and to make an\l"
    .string "atonement for the children of\l"
    .string "Israel: that there be no plague\l"
    .string "among the children of Israel, when\l"
    .string "the children of Israel come nigh\l"
    .string "unto the sanctuary.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_8_20::
    .string "And Moses, and Aaron, and all the\n"
    .string "congregation of the children of\l"
    .string "Israel, did to the Levites according\l"
    .string "unto all that the LORD commanded\l"
    .string "Moses concerning the Levites, so did\l"
    .string "the children of Israel unto them.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_8_21::
    .string "And the Levites were purified, and\n"
    .string "they washed their clothes; and Aaron\l"
    .string "offered them as an offering before\l"
    .string "the LORD; and Aaron made an atonement\l"
    .string "for them to cleanse them.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_8_22::
    .string "And after that went the Levites in\n"
    .string "to do their service in the\l"
    .string "tabernacle of the congregation\l"
    .string "before Aaron, and before his sons: as\l"
    .string "the LORD had commanded Moses\l"
    .string "concerning the Levites, so did they\l"
    .string "unto them.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_8_23::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_8_24::
    .string "This is it that belongeth unto the\n"
    .string "Levites: from twenty and five years\l"
    .string "old and upward they shall go in to\l"
    .string "wait upon the service of the\l"
    .string "tabernacle of the congregation:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_8_25::
    .string "And from the age of fifty years they\n"
    .string "shall cease waiting upon the\l"
    .string "service thereof, and shall serve no\l"
    .string "more:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_8_26::
    .string "But shall minister with their\n"
    .string "brethren in the tabernacle of the\l"
    .string "congregation, to keep the charge,\l"
    .string "and shall do no service. Thus shalt\l"
    .string "thou do unto the Levites touching\l"
    .string "their charge$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_9_1::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses in\n"
    .string "the wilderness of Sinai, in the\l"
    .string "first month of the second year after\l"
    .string "they were come out of the land of\l"
    .string "Egypt, saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_9_2::
    .string "Let the children of Israel also\n"
    .string "keep the passover at his appointed\l"
    .string "season$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_9_3::
    .string "In the fourteenth day of this month,\n"
    .string "at even, ye shall keep it in his\l"
    .string "appointed season: according to all\l"
    .string "the rites of it, and according to\l"
    .string "all the ceremonies thereof, shall\l"
    .string "ye keep it.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_9_4::
    .string "And Moses spake unto the children\n"
    .string "of Israel, that they should keep\l"
    .string "the passover.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_9_5::
    .string "And they kept the passover on the\n"
    .string "fourteenth day of the first month at\l"
    .string "even in the wilderness of Sinai:\l"
    .string "according to all that the LORD\l"
    .string "commanded Moses, so did the children\l"
    .string "of Israel.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_9_6::
    .string "And there were certain men, who were\n"
    .string "defiled by the dead body of a man,\l"
    .string "that they could not keep the\l"
    .string "passover on that day: and they came\l"
    .string "before Moses and before Aaron on that\l"
    .string "day:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_9_7::
    .string "And those men said unto him, We are\n"
    .string "defiled by the dead body of a man:\l"
    .string "wherefore are we kept back, that we\l"
    .string "may not offer an offering of the LORD\l"
    .string "in his appointed season among the\l"
    .string "children of Israel?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_9_8::
    .string "And Moses said unto them, Stand\n"
    .string "still, and I will hear what the\l"
    .string "LORD will command concerning you$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_9_9::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_9_10::
    .string "Speak unto the children of Israel,\n"
    .string "saying, If any man of you or of your\l"
    .string "posterity shall be unclean by\l"
    .string "reason of a dead body, or be in a\l"
    .string "journey afar off, yet he shall keep\l"
    .string "the passover unto the LORD$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_9_11::
    .string "The fourteenth day of the second\n"
    .string "month at even they shall keep it,\l"
    .string "and eat it with unleavened bread and\l"
    .string "bitter herbs.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_9_12::
    .string "They shall leave none of it unto\n"
    .string "the morning, nor break any bone of\l"
    .string "it: according to all the ordinances\l"
    .string "of the passover they shall keep it.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_9_13::
    .string "But the man that is clean, and is\n"
    .string "not in a journey, and forbeareth to\l"
    .string "keep the passover, even the same\l"
    .string "soul shall be cut off from among\l"
    .string "his people: because he brought not\l"
    .string "the offering of the LORD in his\l"
    .string "appointed season, that man shall\l"
    .string "bear his sin.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_9_14::
    .string "And if a stranger shall sojourn\n"
    .string "among you, and will keep the\l"
    .string "passover unto the LORD; according to\l"
    .string "the ordinance of the passover, and\l"
    .string "according to the manner thereof, so\l"
    .string "shall he do: ye shall have one\l"
    .string "ordinance, both for the stranger, and\l"
    .string "for him that was born in the land.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_9_15::
    .string "And on the day that the tabernacle\n"
    .string "was reared up the cloud covered the\l"
    .string "tabernacle, namely, the tent of the\l"
    .string "testimony: and at even there was\l"
    .string "upon the tabernacle as it were the\l"
    .string "appearance of fire, until the\l"
    .string "morning.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_9_16::
    .string "So it was alway: the cloud covered\n"
    .string "it by day, and the appearance of\l"
    .string "fire by night.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_9_17::
    .string "And when the cloud was taken up\n"
    .string "from the tabernacle, then after that\l"
    .string "the children of Israel journeyed:\l"
    .string "and in the place where the cloud\l"
    .string "abode, there the children of Israel\l"
    .string "pitched their tents.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_9_18::
    .string "At the commandment of the LORD the\n"
    .string "children of Israel journeyed, and\l"
    .string "at the commandment of the LORD they\l"
    .string "pitched: as long as the cloud abode\l"
    .string "upon the tabernacle they rested in\l"
    .string "their tents.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_9_19::
    .string "And when the cloud tarried long\n"
    .string "upon the tabernacle many days, then\l"
    .string "the children of Israel kept the\l"
    .string "charge of the LORD, and journeyed not.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_9_20::
    .string "And so it was, when the cloud was a\n"
    .string "few days upon the tabernacle;\l"
    .string "according to the commandment of the\l"
    .string "LORD they abode in their tents, and\l"
    .string "according to the commandment of the\l"
    .string "LORD they journeyed.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_9_21::
    .string "And so it was, when the cloud abode\n"
    .string "from even unto the morning, and that\l"
    .string "the cloud was taken up in the\l"
    .string "morning, then they journeyed:\l"
    .string "whether it was by day or by night\l"
    .string "that the cloud was taken up, they\l"
    .string "journeyed.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_9_22::
    .string "Or whether it were two days, or a\n"
    .string "month, or a year, that the cloud\l"
    .string "tarried upon the tabernacle,\l"
    .string "remaining thereon, the children of\l"
    .string "Israel abode in their tents, and\l"
    .string "journeyed not: but when it was taken\l"
    .string "up, they journeyed.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_9_23::
    .string "At the commandment of the LORD they\n"
    .string "rested in the tents, and at the\l"
    .string "commandment of the LORD they\l"
    .string "journeyed: they kept the charge of\l"
    .string "the LORD, at the commandment of the\l"
    .string "LORD by the hand of Moses.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_1::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_2::
    .string "Make thee two trumpets of silver;\n"
    .string "of a whole piece shalt thou make\l"
    .string "them: that thou mayest use them for\l"
    .string "the calling of the assembly, and\l"
    .string "for the journeying of the camps$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_3::
    .string "And when they shall blow with\n"
    .string "them, all the assembly shall\l"
    .string "assemble themselves to thee at the\l"
    .string "door of the tabernacle of the\l"
    .string "congregation.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_4::
    .string "And if they blow but with one\n"
    .string "trumpet, then the princes, which\l"
    .string "are heads of the thousands of\l"
    .string "Israel, shall gather themselves\l"
    .string "unto thee.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_5::
    .string "When ye blow an alarm, then the\n"
    .string "camps that lie on the east parts\l"
    .string "shall go forward.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_6::
    .string "When ye blow an alarm the second\n"
    .string "time, then the camps that lie on the\l"
    .string "south side shall take their\l"
    .string "journey: they shall blow an alarm\l"
    .string "for their journeys.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_7::
    .string "But when the congregation is to be\n"
    .string "gathered together, ye shall blow,\l"
    .string "but ye shall not sound an alarm.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_8::
    .string "And the sons of Aaron, the priests,\n"
    .string "shall blow with the trumpets; and\l"
    .string "they shall be to you for an\l"
    .string "ordinance for ever throughout your\l"
    .string "generations.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_9::
    .string "And if ye go to war in your land\n"
    .string "against the enemy that oppresseth\l"
    .string "you, then ye shall blow an alarm\l"
    .string "with the trumpets; and ye shall be\l"
    .string "remembered before the LORD your God,\l"
    .string "and ye shall be saved from your\l"
    .string "enemies.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_10::
    .string "Also in the day of your gladness,\n"
    .string "and in your solemn days, and in the\l"
    .string "beginnings of your months, ye shall\l"
    .string "blow with the trumpets over your\l"
    .string "burnt offerings, and over the\l"
    .string "sacrifices of your peace offerings;\l"
    .string "that they may be to you for a\l"
    .string "memorial before your God: I am the\l"
    .string "LORD your God.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_11::
    .string "And it came to pass on the\n"
    .string "twentieth day of the second month, in\l"
    .string "the second year, that the cloud was\l"
    .string "taken up from off the tabernacle of\l"
    .string "the testimony.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_12::
    .string "And the children of Israel took\n"
    .string "their journeys out of the wilderness\l"
    .string "of Sinai; and the cloud rested in the\l"
    .string "wilderness of Paran.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_13::
    .string "And they first took their journey\n"
    .string "according to the commandment of the\l"
    .string "LORD by the hand of Moses.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_14::
    .string "In the first place went the\n"
    .string "standard of the camp of the\l"
    .string "children of Judah according to their\l"
    .string "armies: and over his host was Nahshon\l"
    .string "the son of Amminadab.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_15::
    .string "And over the host of the tribe of\n"
    .string "the children of Issachar was\l"
    .string "Nethaneel the son of Zuar.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_16::
    .string "And over the host of the tribe of\n"
    .string "the children of Zebulun was Eliab\l"
    .string "the son of Helon.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_17::
    .string "And the tabernacle was taken down;\n"
    .string "and the sons of Gershon and the sons\l"
    .string "of Merari set forward, bearing the\l"
    .string "tabernacle.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_18::
    .string "And the standard of the camp of\n"
    .string "Reuben set forward according to\l"
    .string "their armies: and over his host was\l"
    .string "Elizur the son of Shedeur.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_19::
    .string "And over the host of the tribe of\n"
    .string "the children of Simeon was\l"
    .string "Shelumiel the son of Zurishaddai.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_20::
    .string "And over the host of the tribe of\n"
    .string "the children of Gad was Eliasaph\l"
    .string "the son of Deuel.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_21::
    .string "And the Kohathites set forward,\n"
    .string "bearing the sanctuary: and the other\l"
    .string "did set up the tabernacle against\l"
    .string "they came.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_22::
    .string "And the standard of the camp of the\n"
    .string "children of Ephraim set forward\l"
    .string "according to their armies: and over\l"
    .string "his host was Elishama the son of\l"
    .string "Ammihud.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_23::
    .string "And over the host of the tribe of\n"
    .string "the children of Manasseh was\l"
    .string "Gamaliel the son of Pedahzur.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_24::
    .string "And over the host of the tribe of\n"
    .string "the children of Benjamin was Abidan\l"
    .string "the son of Gideoni.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_25::
    .string "And the standard of the camp of the\n"
    .string "children of Dan set forward, which\l"
    .string "was the rereward of all the camps\l"
    .string "throughout their hosts: and over his\l"
    .string "host was Ahiezer the son of\l"
    .string "Ammishaddai.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_26::
    .string "And over the host of the tribe of\n"
    .string "the children of Asher was Pagiel\l"
    .string "the son of Ocran.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_27::
    .string "And over the host of the tribe of\n"
    .string "the children of Naphtali was Ahira\l"
    .string "the son of Enan.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_28::
    .string "Thus were the journeyings of the\n"
    .string "children of Israel according to\l"
    .string "their armies, when they set forward.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_29::
    .string "And Moses said unto Hobab, the son\n"
    .string "of Raguel the Midianite, Moses’\l"
    .string "father in law, We are journeying\l"
    .string "unto the place of which the LORD\l"
    .string "said, I will give it you: come thou\l"
    .string "with us, and we will do thee good:\l"
    .string "for the LORD hath spoken good\l"
    .string "concerning Israel.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_30::
    .string "And he said unto him, I will not\n"
    .string "go; but I will depart to mine own\l"
    .string "land, and to my kindred.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_31::
    .string "And he said, Leave us not, I pray\n"
    .string "thee; forasmuch as thou knowest how\l"
    .string "we are to encamp in the wilderness,\l"
    .string "and thou mayest be to us instead of\l"
    .string "eyes.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_32::
    .string "And it shall be, if thou go with\n"
    .string "us, yea, it shall be, that what\l"
    .string "goodness the LORD shall do unto us,\l"
    .string "the same will we do unto thee.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_33::
    .string "And they departed from the mount of\n"
    .string "the LORD three days’ journey: and the\l"
    .string "ark of the covenant of the LORD went\l"
    .string "before them in the three days’\l"
    .string "journey, to search out a resting\l"
    .string "place for them.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_34::
    .string "And the cloud of the LORD was upon\n"
    .string "them by day, when they went out of the\l"
    .string "camp.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_35::
    .string "And it came to pass, when the ark\n"
    .string "set forward, that Moses said, Rise\l"
    .string "up, LORD, and let thine enemies be\l"
    .string "scattered; and let them that hate\l"
    .string "thee flee before thee.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_10_36::
    .string "And when it rested, he said, Return,\n"
    .string "O LORD, unto the many thousands of\l"
    .string "Israel.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_1::
    .string "And when the people complained,\n"
    .string "it displeased the LORD: and the LORD\l"
    .string "heard it; and his anger was kindled;\l"
    .string "and the fire of the LORD burnt among\l"
    .string "them, and consumed them that were in\l"
    .string "the uttermost parts of the camp.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_2::
    .string "And the people cried unto Moses;\n"
    .string "and when Moses prayed unto the LORD,\l"
    .string "the fire was quenched.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_3::
    .string "And he called the name of the\n"
    .string "place Taberah: because the fire of\l"
    .string "the LORD burnt among them.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_4::
    .string "And the mixt multitude that was\n"
    .string "among them fell a lusting: and the\l"
    .string "children of Israel also wept\l"
    .string "again, and said, Who shall give us\l"
    .string "flesh to eat?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_5::
    .string "We remember the fish, which we did\n"
    .string "eat in Egypt freely; the cucumbers,\l"
    .string "and the melons, and the leeks, and\l"
    .string "the onions, and the garlick:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_6::
    .string "But now our soul is dried away:\n"
    .string "there is nothing at all, beside this\l"
    .string "manna, before our eyes$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_7::
    .string "And the manna was as coriander seed,\n"
    .string "and the colour thereof as the\l"
    .string "colour of bdellium.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_8::
    .string "And the people went about, and\n"
    .string "gathered it, and ground it in mills,\l"
    .string "or beat it in a mortar, and baked it\l"
    .string "in pans, and made cakes of it: and\l"
    .string "the taste of it was as the taste of\l"
    .string "fresh oil.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_9::
    .string "And when the dew fell upon the\n"
    .string "camp in the night, the manna fell\l"
    .string "upon it.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_10::
    .string "Then Moses heard the people weep\n"
    .string "throughout their families, every man\l"
    .string "in the door of his tent: and the anger\l"
    .string "of the LORD was kindled greatly;\l"
    .string "Moses also was displeased.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_11::
    .string "And Moses said unto the LORD,\n"
    .string "Wherefore hast thou afflicted thy\l"
    .string "servant? and wherefore have I not\l"
    .string "found favour in thy sight, that thou\l"
    .string "layest the burden of all this\l"
    .string "people upon me?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_12::
    .string "Have I conceived all this\n"
    .string "people? have I begotten them, that\l"
    .string "thou shouldest say unto me, Carry\l"
    .string "them in thy bosom, as a nursing\l"
    .string "father beareth the sucking child,\l"
    .string "unto the land which thou swarest\l"
    .string "unto their fathers?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_13::
    .string "Whence should I have flesh to give\n"
    .string "unto all this people? for they\l"
    .string "weep unto me, saying, Give us flesh,\l"
    .string "that we may eat$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_14::
    .string "I am not able to bear all this\n"
    .string "people alone, because it is too\l"
    .string "heavy for me.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_15::
    .string "And if thou deal thus with me,\n"
    .string "kill me, I pray thee, out of hand,\l"
    .string "if I have found favour in thy sight;\l"
    .string "and let me not see my wretchedness.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_16::
    .string "And the LORD said unto Moses, Gather\n"
    .string "unto me seventy men of the elders of\l"
    .string "Israel, whom thou knowest to be the\l"
    .string "elders of the people, and officers\l"
    .string "over them; and bring them unto the\l"
    .string "tabernacle of the congregation, that\l"
    .string "they may stand there with thee.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_17::
    .string "And I will come down and talk with\n"
    .string "thee there: and I will take of the\l"
    .string "spirit which is upon thee, and\l"
    .string "will put it upon them; and they\l"
    .string "shall bear the burden of the\l"
    .string "people with thee, that thou bear it\l"
    .string "not thyself alone.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_18::
    .string "And say thou unto the people,\n"
    .string "Sanctify yourselves against to\l"
    .string "morrow, and ye shall eat flesh: for\l"
    .string "ye have wept in the ears of the LORD,\l"
    .string "saying, Who shall give us flesh to\l"
    .string "eat? for it was well with us in\l"
    .string "Egypt: therefore the LORD will give\l"
    .string "you flesh, and ye shall eat.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_19::
    .string "Ye shall not eat one day, nor two\n"
    .string "days, nor five days, neither ten\l"
    .string "days, nor twenty days;"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_20::
    .string "But even a whole month, until it\n"
    .string "come out at your nostrils, and it be\l"
    .string "loathsome unto you: because that ye\l"
    .string "have despised the LORD which is\l"
    .string "among you, and have wept before him,\l"
    .string "saying, Why came we forth out of\l"
    .string "Egypt?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_21::
    .string "And Moses said, The people, among\n"
    .string "whom I am, are six hundred thousand\l"
    .string "footmen; and thou hast said, I will\l"
    .string "give them flesh, that they may eat a\l"
    .string "whole month$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_22::
    .string "Shall the flocks and the herds be\n"
    .string "slain for them, to suffice them? or\l"
    .string "shall all the fish of the sea be\l"
    .string "gathered together for them, to\l"
    .string "suffice them?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_23::
    .string "And the LORD said unto Moses, Is the\n"
    .string "LORD’s hand waxed short? thou shalt\l"
    .string "see now whether my word shall come\l"
    .string "to pass unto thee or not$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_24::
    .string "And Moses went out, and told the\n"
    .string "people the words of the LORD, and\l"
    .string "gathered the seventy men of the\l"
    .string "elders of the people, and set them\l"
    .string "round about the tabernacle.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_25::
    .string "And the LORD came down in a cloud,\n"
    .string "and spake unto him, and took of the\l"
    .string "spirit that was upon him, and gave\l"
    .string "it unto the seventy elders: and it\l"
    .string "came to pass, that, when the spirit\l"
    .string "rested upon them, they prophesied,\l"
    .string "and did not cease.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_26::
    .string "But there remained two of the men in\n"
    .string "the camp, the name of the one was\l"
    .string "Eldad, and the name of the other\l"
    .string "Medad: and the spirit rested upon\l"
    .string "them; and they were of them that were\l"
    .string "written, but went not out unto the\l"
    .string "tabernacle: and they prophesied in\l"
    .string "the camp.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_27::
    .string "And there ran a young man, and told\n"
    .string "Moses, and said, Eldad and Medad do\l"
    .string "prophesy in the camp.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_28::
    .string "And Joshua the son of Nun, the\n"
    .string "servant of Moses, one of his young\l"
    .string "men, answered and said, My lord\l"
    .string "Moses, forbid them.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_29::
    .string "And Moses said unto him, Enviest\n"
    .string "thou for my sake? would God that\l"
    .string "all the LORD’s people were\l"
    .string "prophets, and that the LORD would\l"
    .string "put his spirit upon them!"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_30::
    .string "And Moses gat him into the camp, he\n"
    .string "and the elders of Israel$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_31::
    .string "And there went forth a wind from the\n"
    .string "LORD, and brought quails from the\l"
    .string "sea, and let them fall by the camp,\l"
    .string "as it were a day’s journey on this\l"
    .string "side, and as it were a day’s journey\l"
    .string "on the other side, round about the\l"
    .string "camp, and as it were two cubits high\l"
    .string "upon the face of the earth.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_32::
    .string "And the people stood up all that\n"
    .string "day, and all that night, and all\l"
    .string "the next day, and they gathered the\l"
    .string "quails: he that gathered least\l"
    .string "gathered ten homers: and they spread\l"
    .string "them all abroad for themselves\l"
    .string "round about the camp.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_33::
    .string "And while the flesh was yet\n"
    .string "between their teeth, ere it was\l"
    .string "chewed, the wrath of the LORD was\l"
    .string "kindled against the people, and\l"
    .string "the LORD smote the people with a\l"
    .string "very great plague.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_34::
    .string "And he called the name of that\n"
    .string "place Kibrothhattaavah: because\l"
    .string "there they buried the people that\l"
    .string "lusted.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_11_35::
    .string "And the people journeyed from\n"
    .string "Kibrothhattaavah unto Hazeroth; and\l"
    .string "abode at Hazeroth.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_12_1::
    .string "And Miriam and Aaron spake against\n"
    .string "Moses because of the Ethiopian woman\l"
    .string "whom he had married: for he had\l"
    .string "married an Ethiopian woman.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_12_2::
    .string "And they said, Hath the LORD indeed\n"
    .string "spoken only by Moses? hath he not\l"
    .string "spoken also by us? And the LORD\l"
    .string "heard it.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_12_3::
    .string "(Now the man Moses was very meek,\n"
    .string "above all the men which were upon\l"
    .string "the face of the earth.)"
Bible_Text_Numbers_12_4::
    .string "And the LORD spake suddenly unto\n"
    .string "Moses, and unto Aaron, and unto\l"
    .string "Miriam, Come out ye three unto the\l"
    .string "tabernacle of the congregation. And\l"
    .string "they three came out$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_12_5::
    .string "And the LORD came down in the\n"
    .string "pillar of the cloud, and stood in\l"
    .string "the door of the tabernacle, and\l"
    .string "called Aaron and Miriam: and they\l"
    .string "both came forth.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_12_6::
    .string "And he said, Hear now my words: If\n"
    .string "there be a prophet among you, I the\l"
    .string "LORD will make myself known unto\l"
    .string "him in a vision, and will speak\l"
    .string "unto him in a dream.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_12_7::
    .string "My servant Moses is not so, who is\n"
    .string "faithful in all mine house.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_12_8::
    .string "With him will I speak mouth to\n"
    .string "mouth, even apparently, and not in\l"
    .string "dark speeches; and the similitude\l"
    .string "of the LORD shall he behold:\l"
    .string "wherefore then were ye not afraid to\l"
    .string "speak against my servant Moses?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_12_9::
    .string "And the anger of the LORD was\n"
    .string "kindled against them; and he\l"
    .string "departed$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_12_10::
    .string "And the cloud departed from off\n"
    .string "the tabernacle; and, behold, Miriam\l"
    .string "became leprous, white as snow: and\l"
    .string "Aaron looked upon Miriam, and,\l"
    .string "behold, she was leprous.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_12_11::
    .string "And Aaron said unto Moses, Alas, my\n"
    .string "lord, I beseech thee, lay not the sin\l"
    .string "upon us, wherein we have done\l"
    .string "foolishly, and wherein we have\l"
    .string "sinned.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_12_12::
    .string "Let her not be as one dead, of whom\n"
    .string "the flesh is half consumed when he\l"
    .string "cometh out of his mother’s womb.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_12_13::
    .string "And Moses cried unto the LORD,\n"
    .string "saying, Heal her now, O God, I\l"
    .string "beseech thee.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_12_14::
    .string "And the LORD said unto Moses, If her\n"
    .string "father had but spit in her face,\l"
    .string "should she not be ashamed seven\l"
    .string "days? let her be shut out from the\l"
    .string "camp seven days, and after that let\l"
    .string "her be received in again.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_12_15::
    .string "And Miriam was shut out from the\n"
    .string "camp seven days: and the people\l"
    .string "journeyed not till Miriam was\l"
    .string "brought in again.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_12_16::
    .string "And afterward the people removed\n"
    .string "from Hazeroth, and pitched in the\l"
    .string "wilderness of Paran.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_1::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_2::
    .string "Send thou men, that they may search\n"
    .string "the land of Canaan, which I give unto\l"
    .string "the children of Israel: of every\l"
    .string "tribe of their fathers shall ye\l"
    .string "send a man, every one a ruler among\l"
    .string "them$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_3::
    .string "And Moses by the commandment of the\n"
    .string "LORD sent them from the wilderness\l"
    .string "of Paran: all those men were heads\l"
    .string "of the children of Israel.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_4::
    .string "And these were their names: of the\n"
    .string "tribe of Reuben, Shammua the son of\l"
    .string "Zaccur.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_5::
    .string "Of the tribe of Simeon, Shaphat the\n"
    .string "son of Hori.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_6::
    .string "Of the tribe of Judah, Caleb the son\n"
    .string "of Jephunneh.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_7::
    .string "Of the tribe of Issachar, Igal the\n"
    .string "son of Joseph.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_8::
    .string "Of the tribe of Ephraim, Oshea the\n"
    .string "son of Nun.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_9::
    .string "Of the tribe of Benjamin, Palti the\n"
    .string "son of Raphu.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_10::
    .string "Of the tribe of Zebulun, Gaddiel\n"
    .string "the son of Sodi.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_11::
    .string "Of the tribe of Joseph, namely, of\n"
    .string "the tribe of Manasseh, Gaddi the son\l"
    .string "of Susi.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_12::
    .string "Of the tribe of Dan, Ammiel the son\n"
    .string "of Gemalli.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_13::
    .string "Of the tribe of Asher, Sethur the\n"
    .string "son of Michael.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_14::
    .string "Of the tribe of Naphtali, Nahbi the\n"
    .string "son of Vophsi.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_15::
    .string "Of the tribe of Gad, Geuel the son\n"
    .string "of Machi.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_16::
    .string "These are the names of the men which\n"
    .string "Moses sent to spy out the land. And\l"
    .string "Moses called Oshea the son of Nun\l"
    .string "Jehoshua.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_17::
    .string "And Moses sent them to spy out the\n"
    .string "land of Canaan, and said unto them,\l"
    .string "Get you up this way southward, and go\l"
    .string "up into the mountain:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_18::
    .string "And see the land, what it is, and\n"
    .string "the people that dwelleth therein,\l"
    .string "whether they be strong or weak, few\l"
    .string "or many;"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_19::
    .string "And what the land is that they\n"
    .string "dwell in, whether it be good or bad;\l"
    .string "and what cities they be that they\l"
    .string "dwell in, whether in tents, or in\l"
    .string "strong holds;"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_20::
    .string "And what the land is, whether it be\n"
    .string "fat or lean, whether there be wood\l"
    .string "therein, or not. And be ye of good\l"
    .string "courage, and bring of the fruit of\l"
    .string "the land. Now the time was the time\l"
    .string "of the firstripe grapes$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_21::
    .string "So they went up, and searched the\n"
    .string "land from the wilderness of Zin unto\l"
    .string "Rehob, as men come to Hamath.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_22::
    .string "And they ascended by the south, and\n"
    .string "came unto Hebron; where Ahiman,\l"
    .string "Sheshai, and Talmai, the children\l"
    .string "of Anak, were. (Now Hebron was built\l"
    .string "seven years before Zoan in Egypt.)"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_23::
    .string "And they came unto the brook of\n"
    .string "Eshcol, and cut down from thence a\l"
    .string "branch with one cluster of grapes,\l"
    .string "and they bare it between two upon a\l"
    .string "staff; and they brought of the\l"
    .string "pomegranates, and of the figs$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_24::
    .string "The place was called the brook\n"
    .string "Eshcol, because of the cluster of\l"
    .string "grapes which the children of\l"
    .string "Israel cut down from thence.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_25::
    .string "And they returned from searching of\n"
    .string "the land after forty days.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_26::
    .string "And they went and came to Moses, and\n"
    .string "to Aaron, and to all the\l"
    .string "congregation of the children of\l"
    .string "Israel, unto the wilderness of\l"
    .string "Paran, to Kadesh; and brought back\l"
    .string "word unto them, and unto all the\l"
    .string "congregation, and shewed them the\l"
    .string "fruit of the land.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_27::
    .string "And they told him, and said, We came\n"
    .string "unto the land whither thou sentest\l"
    .string "us, and surely it floweth with milk\l"
    .string "and honey; and this is the fruit of\l"
    .string "it.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_28::
    .string "Nevertheless the people be\n"
    .string "strong that dwell in the land, and\l"
    .string "the cities are walled, and very\l"
    .string "great: and moreover we saw the\l"
    .string "children of Anak there.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_29::
    .string "The Amalekites dwell in the land\n"
    .string "of the south: and the Hittites, and\l"
    .string "the Jebusites, and the Amorites,\l"
    .string "dwell in the mountains: and the\l"
    .string "Canaanites dwell by the sea, and by\l"
    .string "the coast of Jordan.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_30::
    .string "And Caleb stilled the people\n"
    .string "before Moses, and said, Let us go up\l"
    .string "at once, and possess it; for we are\l"
    .string "well able to overcome it.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_31::
    .string "But the men that went up with him\n"
    .string "said, We be not able to go up\l"
    .string "against the people; for they are\l"
    .string "stronger than we.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_32::
    .string "And they brought up an evil report\n"
    .string "of the land which they had searched\l"
    .string "unto the children of Israel,\l"
    .string "saying, The land, through which we\l"
    .string "have gone to search it, is a land\l"
    .string "that eateth up the inhabitants\l"
    .string "thereof; and all the people that\l"
    .string "we saw in it are men of a great\l"
    .string "stature.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_13_33::
    .string "And there we saw the giants, the\n"
    .string "sons of Anak, which come of the\l"
    .string "giants: and we were in our own sight\l"
    .string "as grasshoppers, and so we were in\l"
    .string "their sight.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_1::
    .string "And all the congregation lifted\n"
    .string "up their voice, and cried; and the\l"
    .string "people wept that night.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_2::
    .string "And all the children of Israel\n"
    .string "murmured against Moses and against\l"
    .string "Aaron: and the whole congregation\l"
    .string "said unto them, Would God that we had\l"
    .string "died in the land of Egypt! or would\l"
    .string "God we had died in this wilderness!"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_3::
    .string "And wherefore hath the LORD brought\n"
    .string "us unto this land, to fall by the\l"
    .string "sword, that our wives and our\l"
    .string "children should be a prey? were it\l"
    .string "not better for us to return into\l"
    .string "Egypt?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_4::
    .string "And they said one to another, Let us\n"
    .string "make a captain, and let us return\l"
    .string "into Egypt$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_5::
    .string "Then Moses and Aaron fell on their\n"
    .string "faces before all the assembly of\l"
    .string "the congregation of the children of\l"
    .string "Israel.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_6::
    .string "And Joshua the son of Nun, and Caleb\n"
    .string "the son of Jephunneh, which were of\l"
    .string "them that searched the land, rent\l"
    .string "their clothes:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_7::
    .string "And they spake unto all the\n"
    .string "company of the children of Israel,\l"
    .string "saying, The land, which we passed\l"
    .string "through to search it, is an exceeding\l"
    .string "good land$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_8::
    .string "If the LORD delight in us, then he\n"
    .string "will bring us into this land, and\l"
    .string "give it us; a land which floweth\l"
    .string "with milk and honey.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_9::
    .string "Only rebel not ye against the LORD,\n"
    .string "neither fear ye the people of the\l"
    .string "land; for they are bread for us:\l"
    .string "their defence is departed from them,\l"
    .string "and the LORD is with us: fear them\l"
    .string "not.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_10::
    .string "But all the congregation bade\n"
    .string "stone them with stones. And the\l"
    .string "glory of the LORD appeared in the\l"
    .string "tabernacle of the congregation\l"
    .string "before all the children of Israel.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_11::
    .string "And the LORD said unto Moses, How\n"
    .string "long will this people provoke me?\l"
    .string "and how long will it be ere they\l"
    .string "believe me, for all the signs which\l"
    .string "I have shewed among them?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_12::
    .string "I will smite them with the\n"
    .string "pestilence, and disinherit them, and\l"
    .string "will make of thee a greater nation\l"
    .string "and mightier than they$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_13::
    .string "And Moses said unto the LORD, Then\n"
    .string "the Egyptians shall hear it, (for\l"
    .string "thou broughtest up this people in\l"
    .string "thy might from among them;)"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_14::
    .string "And they will tell it to the\n"
    .string "inhabitants of this land: for they\l"
    .string "have heard that thou LORD art among\l"
    .string "this people, that thou LORD art\l"
    .string "seen face to face, and that thy cloud\l"
    .string "standeth over them, and that thou\l"
    .string "goest before them, by day time in a\l"
    .string "pillar of a cloud, and in a\l"
    .string "pillar of fire by night$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_15::
    .string "Now if thou shalt kill all this\n"
    .string "people as one man, then the nations\l"
    .string "which have heard the fame of thee\l"
    .string "will speak, saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_16::
    .string "Because the LORD was not able to\n"
    .string "bring this people into the land\l"
    .string "which he sware unto them, therefore\l"
    .string "he hath slain them in the wilderness$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_17::
    .string "And now, I beseech thee, let the\n"
    .string "power of my LORD be great, according\l"
    .string "as thou hast spoken, saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_18::
    .string "The LORD is longsuffering, and of\n"
    .string "great mercy, forgiving iniquity and\l"
    .string "transgression, and by no means\l"
    .string "clearing the guilty, visiting the\l"
    .string "iniquity of the fathers upon the\l"
    .string "children unto the third and fourth\l"
    .string "generation$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_19::
    .string "Pardon, I beseech thee, the iniquity\n"
    .string "of this people according unto the\l"
    .string "greatness of thy mercy, and as thou\l"
    .string "hast forgiven this people, from\l"
    .string "Egypt even until now.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_20::
    .string "And the LORD said, I have pardoned\n"
    .string "according to thy word:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_21::
    .string "But as truly as I live, all the\n"
    .string "earth shall be filled with the\l"
    .string "glory of the LORD$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_22::
    .string "Because all those men which have\n"
    .string "seen my glory, and my miracles,\l"
    .string "which I did in Egypt and in the\l"
    .string "wilderness, and have tempted me now\l"
    .string "these ten times, and have not\l"
    .string "hearkened to my voice;"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_23::
    .string "Surely they shall not see the\n"
    .string "land which I sware unto their\l"
    .string "fathers, neither shall any of them\l"
    .string "that provoked me see it:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_24::
    .string "But my servant Caleb, because he\n"
    .string "had another spirit with him, and\l"
    .string "hath followed me fully, him will\l"
    .string "I bring into the land whereinto he\l"
    .string "went; and his seed shall possess it$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_25::
    .string "(Now the Amalekites and the\n"
    .string "Canaanites dwelt in the valley.)\l"
    .string "Tomorrow turn you, and get you into\l"
    .string "the wilderness by the way of the Red\l"
    .string "sea.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_26::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses and\n"
    .string "unto Aaron, saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_27::
    .string "How long shall I bear with this\n"
    .string "evil congregation, which murmur\l"
    .string "against me? I have heard the\l"
    .string "murmurings of the children of\l"
    .string "Israel, which they murmur against me$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_28::
    .string "Say unto them, As truly as I live,\n"
    .string "saith the LORD, as ye have spoken in\l"
    .string "mine ears, so will I do to you:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_29::
    .string "Your carcases shall fall in this\n"
    .string "wilderness; and all that were\l"
    .string "numbered of you, according to your\l"
    .string "whole number, from twenty years old\l"
    .string "and upward which have murmured\l"
    .string "against me$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_30::
    .string "Doubtless ye shall not come into\n"
    .string "the land, concerning which I sware\l"
    .string "to make you dwell therein, save\l"
    .string "Caleb the son of Jephunneh, and\l"
    .string "Joshua the son of Nun.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_31::
    .string "But your little ones, which ye said\n"
    .string "should be a prey, them will I bring\l"
    .string "in, and they shall know the land\l"
    .string "which ye have despised.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_32::
    .string "But as for you, your carcases, they\n"
    .string "shall fall in this wilderness.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_33::
    .string "And your children shall wander in\n"
    .string "the wilderness forty years, and bear\l"
    .string "your whoredoms, until your carcases\l"
    .string "be wasted in the wilderness.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_34::
    .string "After the number of the days in\n"
    .string "which ye searched the land, even\l"
    .string "forty days, each day for a year,\l"
    .string "shall ye bear your iniquities, even\l"
    .string "forty years, and ye shall know my\l"
    .string "breach of promise.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_35::
    .string "I the LORD have said, I will\n"
    .string "surely do it unto all this evil\l"
    .string "congregation, that are gathered\l"
    .string "together against me: in this\l"
    .string "wilderness they shall be consumed,\l"
    .string "and there they shall die.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_36::
    .string "And the men, which Moses sent to\n"
    .string "search the land, who returned, and\l"
    .string "made all the congregation to murmur\l"
    .string "against him, by bringing up a\l"
    .string "slander upon the land,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_37::
    .string "Even those men that did bring up\n"
    .string "the evil report upon the land,\l"
    .string "died by the plague before the LORD$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_38::
    .string "But Joshua the son of Nun, and Caleb\n"
    .string "the son of Jephunneh, which were of\l"
    .string "the men that went to search the land,\l"
    .string "lived still.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_39::
    .string "And Moses told these sayings unto\n"
    .string "all the children of Israel: and\l"
    .string "the people mourned greatly.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_40::
    .string "And they rose up early in the\n"
    .string "morning, and gat them up into the\l"
    .string "top of the mountain, saying, Lo, we\l"
    .string "be here, and will go up unto the\l"
    .string "place which the LORD hath promised:\l"
    .string "for we have sinned.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_41::
    .string "And Moses said, Wherefore now do ye\n"
    .string "transgress the commandment of the\l"
    .string "LORD? but it shall not prosper.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_42::
    .string "Go not up, for the LORD is not among\n"
    .string "you; that ye be not smitten before\l"
    .string "your enemies.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_43::
    .string "For the Amalekites and the\n"
    .string "Canaanites are there before you, and\l"
    .string "ye shall fall by the sword:\l"
    .string "because ye are turned away from the\l"
    .string "LORD, therefore the LORD will not be\l"
    .string "with you.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_44::
    .string "But they presumed to go up unto the\n"
    .string "hill top: nevertheless the ark of\l"
    .string "the covenant of the LORD, and Moses,\l"
    .string "departed not out of the camp.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_14_45::
    .string "Then the Amalekites came down, and\n"
    .string "the Canaanites which dwelt in that\l"
    .string "hill, and smote them, and\l"
    .string "discomfited them, even unto Hormah.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_1::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_2::
    .string "Speak unto the children of Israel,\n"
    .string "and say unto them, When ye be come\l"
    .string "into the land of your habitations,\l"
    .string "which I give unto you,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_3::
    .string "And will make an offering by fire\n"
    .string "unto the LORD, a burnt offering, or a\l"
    .string "sacrifice in performing a vow, or in\l"
    .string "a freewill offering, or in your\l"
    .string "solemn feasts, to make a sweet\l"
    .string "savour unto the LORD, of the herd or\l"
    .string "of the flock:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_4::
    .string "Then shall he that offereth his\n"
    .string "offering unto the LORD bring a meat\l"
    .string "offering of a tenth deal of flour\l"
    .string "mingled with the fourth part of an\l"
    .string "hin of oil$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_5::
    .string "And the fourth part of an hin of\n"
    .string "wine for a drink offering shalt thou\l"
    .string "prepare with the burnt offering or\l"
    .string "sacrifice, for one lamb.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_6::
    .string "Or for a ram, thou shalt prepare\n"
    .string "for a meat offering two tenth deals\l"
    .string "of flour mingled with the third\l"
    .string "part of an hin of oil.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_7::
    .string "And for a drink offering thou shalt\n"
    .string "offer the third part of an hin of\l"
    .string "wine, for a sweet savour unto the\l"
    .string "LORD.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_8::
    .string "And when thou preparest a bullock\n"
    .string "for a burnt offering, or for a\l"
    .string "sacrifice in performing a vow, or\l"
    .string "peace offerings unto the LORD:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_9::
    .string "Then shall he bring with a\n"
    .string "bullock a meat offering of three\l"
    .string "tenth deals of flour mingled with\l"
    .string "half an hin of oil$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_10::
    .string "And thou shalt bring for a drink\n"
    .string "offering half an hin of wine, for an\l"
    .string "offering made by fire, of a sweet\l"
    .string "savour unto the LORD.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_11::
    .string "Thus shall it be done for one\n"
    .string "bullock, or for one ram, or for a\l"
    .string "lamb, or a kid.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_12::
    .string "According to the number that ye\n"
    .string "shall prepare, so shall ye do to\l"
    .string "every one according to their number.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_13::
    .string "All that are born of the country\n"
    .string "shall do these things after this\l"
    .string "manner, in offering an offering made\l"
    .string "by fire, of a sweet savour unto the\l"
    .string "LORD.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_14::
    .string "And if a stranger sojourn with you,\n"
    .string "or whosoever be among you in your\l"
    .string "generations, and will offer an\l"
    .string "offering made by fire, of a sweet\l"
    .string "savour unto the LORD; as ye do, so he\l"
    .string "shall do.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_15::
    .string "One ordinance shall be both for\n"
    .string "you of the congregation, and also\l"
    .string "for the stranger that sojourneth\l"
    .string "with you, an ordinance for ever in\l"
    .string "your generations: as ye are, so\l"
    .string "shall the stranger be before the\l"
    .string "LORD.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_16::
    .string "One law and one manner shall be\n"
    .string "for you, and for the stranger that\l"
    .string "sojourneth with you.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_17::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_18::
    .string "Speak unto the children of Israel,\n"
    .string "and say unto them, When ye come into\l"
    .string "the land whither I bring you,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_19::
    .string "Then it shall be, that, when ye eat\n"
    .string "of the bread of the land, ye shall\l"
    .string "offer up an heave offering unto the\l"
    .string "LORD$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_20::
    .string "Ye shall offer up a cake of the\n"
    .string "first of your dough for an heave\l"
    .string "offering: as ye do the heave offering\l"
    .string "of the threshingfloor, so shall ye\l"
    .string "heave it.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_21::
    .string "Of the first of your dough ye shall\n"
    .string "give unto the LORD an heave offering\l"
    .string "in your generations.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_22::
    .string "And if ye have erred, and not\n"
    .string "observed all these commandments,\l"
    .string "which the LORD hath spoken unto\l"
    .string "Moses,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_23::
    .string "Even all that the LORD hath\n"
    .string "commanded you by the hand of Moses,\l"
    .string "from the day that the LORD commanded\l"
    .string "Moses, and henceforward among your\l"
    .string "generations;"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_24::
    .string "Then it shall be, if ought be\n"
    .string "committed by ignorance without the\l"
    .string "knowledge of the congregation, that\l"
    .string "all the congregation shall offer\l"
    .string "one young bullock for a burnt\l"
    .string "offering, for a sweet savour unto the\l"
    .string "LORD, with his meat offering, and his\l"
    .string "drink offering, according to the\l"
    .string "manner, and one kid of the goats for a\l"
    .string "sin offering$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_25::
    .string "And the priest shall make an\n"
    .string "atonement for all the congregation\l"
    .string "of the children of Israel, and it\l"
    .string "shall be forgiven them; for it is\l"
    .string "ignorance: and they shall bring\l"
    .string "their offering, a sacrifice made by\l"
    .string "fire unto the LORD, and their sin\l"
    .string "offering before the LORD, for their\l"
    .string "ignorance:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_26::
    .string "And it shall be forgiven all the\n"
    .string "congregation of the children of\l"
    .string "Israel, and the stranger that\l"
    .string "sojourneth among them; seeing all\l"
    .string "the people were in ignorance$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_27::
    .string "And if any soul sin through\n"
    .string "ignorance, then he shall bring a she\l"
    .string "goat of the first year for a sin\l"
    .string "offering.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_28::
    .string "And the priest shall make an\n"
    .string "atonement for the soul that sinneth\l"
    .string "ignorantly, when he sinneth by\l"
    .string "ignorance before the LORD, to make an\l"
    .string "atonement for him; and it shall be\l"
    .string "forgiven him.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_29::
    .string "Ye shall have one law for him that\n"
    .string "sinneth through ignorance, both for\l"
    .string "him that is born among the children\l"
    .string "of Israel, and for the stranger that\l"
    .string "sojourneth among them.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_30::
    .string "But the soul that doeth ought\n"
    .string "presumptuously, whether he be born\l"
    .string "in the land, or a stranger, the same\l"
    .string "reproacheth the LORD; and that soul\l"
    .string "shall be cut off from among his\l"
    .string "people.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_31::
    .string "Because he hath despised the word\n"
    .string "of the LORD, and hath broken his\l"
    .string "commandment, that soul shall\l"
    .string "utterly be cut off; his iniquity\l"
    .string "shall be upon him.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_32::
    .string "And while the children of Israel\n"
    .string "were in the wilderness, they found a\l"
    .string "man that gathered sticks upon the\l"
    .string "sabbath day.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_33::
    .string "And they that found him gathering\n"
    .string "sticks brought him unto Moses and\l"
    .string "Aaron, and unto all the\l"
    .string "congregation.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_34::
    .string "And they put him in ward, because it\n"
    .string "was not declared what should be\l"
    .string "done to him.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_35::
    .string "And the LORD said unto Moses, The\n"
    .string "man shall be surely put to death:\l"
    .string "all the congregation shall stone\l"
    .string "him with stones without the camp.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_36::
    .string "And all the congregation brought\n"
    .string "him without the camp, and stoned him\l"
    .string "with stones, and he died; as the LORD\l"
    .string "commanded Moses.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_37::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_38::
    .string "Speak unto the children of Israel,\n"
    .string "and bid them that they make them\l"
    .string "fringes in the borders of their\l"
    .string "garments throughout their\l"
    .string "generations, and that they put upon\l"
    .string "the fringe of the borders a ribband\l"
    .string "of blue:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_39::
    .string "And it shall be unto you for a\n"
    .string "fringe, that ye may look upon it,\l"
    .string "and remember all the commandments\l"
    .string "of the LORD, and do them; and that ye\l"
    .string "seek not after your own heart and\l"
    .string "your own eyes, after which ye use to\l"
    .string "go a whoring:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_40::
    .string "That ye may remember, and do all my\n"
    .string "commandments, and be holy unto your\l"
    .string "God$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_15_41::
    .string "I am the LORD your God, which\n"
    .string "brought you out of the land of\l"
    .string "Egypt, to be your God: I am the LORD\l"
    .string "your God.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_1::
    .string "Now Korah, the son of Izhar, the son\n"
    .string "of Kohath, the son of Levi, and\l"
    .string "Dathan and Abiram, the sons of\l"
    .string "Eliab, and On, the son of Peleth,\l"
    .string "sons of Reuben, took men:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_2::
    .string "And they rose up before Moses, with\n"
    .string "certain of the children of Israel,\l"
    .string "two hundred and fifty princes of the\l"
    .string "assembly, famous in the\l"
    .string "congregation, men of renown:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_3::
    .string "And they gathered themselves\n"
    .string "together against Moses and against\l"
    .string "Aaron, and said unto them, Ye take\l"
    .string "too much upon you, seeing all the\l"
    .string "congregation are holy, every one of\l"
    .string "them, and the LORD is among them:\l"
    .string "wherefore then lift ye up\l"
    .string "yourselves above the congregation\l"
    .string "of the LORD?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_4::
    .string "And when Moses heard it, he fell\n"
    .string "upon his face:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_5::
    .string "And he spake unto Korah and unto\n"
    .string "all his company, saying, Even to\l"
    .string "morrow the LORD will shew who are\l"
    .string "his, and who is holy; and will\l"
    .string "cause him to come near unto him: even\l"
    .string "him whom he hath chosen will he\l"
    .string "cause to come near unto him$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_6::
    .string "This do; Take you censers, Korah,\n"
    .string "and all his company;"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_7::
    .string "And put fire therein, and put\n"
    .string "incense in them before the LORD to\l"
    .string "morrow: and it shall be that the man\l"
    .string "whom the LORD doth choose, he shall\l"
    .string "be holy: ye take too much upon you,\l"
    .string "ye sons of Levi$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_8::
    .string "And Moses said unto Korah, Hear, I\n"
    .string "pray you, ye sons of Levi:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_9::
    .string "Seemeth it but a small thing unto\n"
    .string "you, that the God of Israel hath\l"
    .string "separated you from the congregation\l"
    .string "of Israel, to bring you near to\l"
    .string "himself to do the service of the\l"
    .string "tabernacle of the LORD, and to stand\l"
    .string "before the congregation to minister\l"
    .string "unto them?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_10::
    .string "And he hath brought thee near to\n"
    .string "him, and all thy brethren the sons\l"
    .string "of Levi with thee: and seek ye the\l"
    .string "priesthood also?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_11::
    .string "For which cause both thou and all\n"
    .string "thy company are gathered together\l"
    .string "against the LORD: and what is Aaron,\l"
    .string "that ye murmur against him?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_12::
    .string "And Moses sent to call Dathan and\n"
    .string "Abiram, the sons of Eliab: which\l"
    .string "said, We will not come up:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_13::
    .string "Is it a small thing that thou hast\n"
    .string "brought us up out of a land that\l"
    .string "floweth with milk and honey, to\l"
    .string "kill us in the wilderness, except\l"
    .string "thou make thyself altogether a\l"
    .string "prince over us?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_14::
    .string "Moreover thou hast not brought us\n"
    .string "into a land that floweth with milk\l"
    .string "and honey, or given us inheritance of\l"
    .string "fields and vineyards: wilt thou put\l"
    .string "out the eyes of these men? we will\l"
    .string "not come up$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_15::
    .string "And Moses was very wroth, and said\n"
    .string "unto the LORD, Respect not thou\l"
    .string "their offering: I have not taken one\l"
    .string "ass from them, neither have I hurt\l"
    .string "one of them.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_16::
    .string "And Moses said unto Korah, Be thou\n"
    .string "and all thy company before the\l"
    .string "LORD, thou, and they, and Aaron, to\l"
    .string "morrow:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_17::
    .string "And take every man his censer, and\n"
    .string "put incense in them, and bring ye\l"
    .string "before the LORD every man his censer,\l"
    .string "two hundred and fifty censers; thou\l"
    .string "also, and Aaron, each of you his\l"
    .string "censer$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_18::
    .string "And they took every man his censer,\n"
    .string "and put fire in them, and laid\l"
    .string "incense thereon, and stood in the\l"
    .string "door of the tabernacle of the\l"
    .string "congregation with Moses and Aaron.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_19::
    .string "And Korah gathered all the\n"
    .string "congregation against them unto the\l"
    .string "door of the tabernacle of the\l"
    .string "congregation: and the glory of the\l"
    .string "LORD appeared unto all the\l"
    .string "congregation.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_20::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses and\n"
    .string "unto Aaron, saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_21::
    .string "Separate yourselves from among\n"
    .string "this congregation, that I may consume\l"
    .string "them in a moment$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_22::
    .string "And they fell upon their faces,\n"
    .string "and said, O God, the God of the\l"
    .string "spirits of all flesh, shall one\l"
    .string "man sin, and wilt thou be wroth with\l"
    .string "all the congregation?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_23::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_24::
    .string "Speak unto the congregation,\n"
    .string "saying, Get you up from about the\l"
    .string "tabernacle of Korah, Dathan, and\l"
    .string "Abiram$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_25::
    .string "And Moses rose up and went unto\n"
    .string "Dathan and Abiram; and the elders of\l"
    .string "Israel followed him.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_26::
    .string "And he spake unto the congregation,\n"
    .string "saying, Depart, I pray you, from the\l"
    .string "tents of these wicked men, and touch\l"
    .string "nothing of theirs, lest ye be\l"
    .string "consumed in all their sins.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_27::
    .string "So they gat up from the tabernacle\n"
    .string "of Korah, Dathan, and Abiram, on\l"
    .string "every side: and Dathan and Abiram\l"
    .string "came out, and stood in the door of\l"
    .string "their tents, and their wives, and\l"
    .string "their sons, and their little\l"
    .string "children.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_28::
    .string "And Moses said, Hereby ye shall\n"
    .string "know that the LORD hath sent me to do\l"
    .string "all these works; for I have not done\l"
    .string "them of mine own mind.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_29::
    .string "If these men die the common death of\n"
    .string "all men, or if they be visited after\l"
    .string "the visitation of all men; then the\l"
    .string "LORD hath not sent me.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_30::
    .string "But if the LORD make a new thing, and\n"
    .string "the earth open her mouth, and\l"
    .string "swallow them up, with all that\l"
    .string "appertain unto them, and they go\l"
    .string "down quick into the pit; then ye\l"
    .string "shall understand that these men\l"
    .string "have provoked the LORD.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_31::
    .string "And it came to pass, as he had made\n"
    .string "an end of speaking all these words,\l"
    .string "that the ground clave asunder that\l"
    .string "was under them:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_32::
    .string "And the earth opened her mouth, and\n"
    .string "swallowed them up, and their\l"
    .string "houses, and all the men that\l"
    .string "appertained unto Korah, and all\l"
    .string "their goods$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_33::
    .string "They, and all that appertained to\n"
    .string "them, went down alive into the pit,\l"
    .string "and the earth closed upon them: and\l"
    .string "they perished from among the\l"
    .string "congregation.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_34::
    .string "And all Israel that were round\n"
    .string "about them fled at the cry of them:\l"
    .string "for they said, Lest the earth\l"
    .string "swallow us up also.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_35::
    .string "And there came out a fire from the\n"
    .string "LORD, and consumed the two hundred\l"
    .string "and fifty men that offered incense.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_36::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_37::
    .string "Speak unto Eleazar the son of\n"
    .string "Aaron the priest, that he take up\l"
    .string "the censers out of the burning, and\l"
    .string "scatter thou the fire yonder; for\l"
    .string "they are hallowed$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_38::
    .string "The censers of these sinners\n"
    .string "against their own souls, let them\l"
    .string "make them broad plates for a\l"
    .string "covering of the altar: for they\l"
    .string "offered them before the LORD,\l"
    .string "therefore they are hallowed: and\l"
    .string "they shall be a sign unto the\l"
    .string "children of Israel.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_39::
    .string "And Eleazar the priest took the\n"
    .string "brasen censers, wherewith they that\l"
    .string "were burnt had offered; and they were\l"
    .string "made broad plates for a covering of\l"
    .string "the altar:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_40::
    .string "To be a memorial unto the children\n"
    .string "of Israel, that no stranger, which\l"
    .string "is not of the seed of Aaron, come near\l"
    .string "to offer incense before the LORD;\l"
    .string "that he be not as Korah, and as his\l"
    .string "company: as the LORD said to him by\l"
    .string "the hand of Moses$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_41::
    .string "But on the morrow all the\n"
    .string "congregation of the children of\l"
    .string "Israel murmured against Moses and\l"
    .string "against Aaron, saying, Ye have\l"
    .string "killed the people of the LORD.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_42::
    .string "And it came to pass, when the\n"
    .string "congregation was gathered against\l"
    .string "Moses and against Aaron, that they\l"
    .string "looked toward the tabernacle of the\l"
    .string "congregation: and, behold, the\l"
    .string "cloud covered it, and the glory of\l"
    .string "the LORD appeared.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_43::
    .string "And Moses and Aaron came before the\n"
    .string "tabernacle of the congregation.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_44::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_45::
    .string "Get you up from among this\n"
    .string "congregation, that I may consume them\l"
    .string "as in a moment. And they fell upon\l"
    .string "their faces$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_46::
    .string "And Moses said unto Aaron, Take a\n"
    .string "censer, and put fire therein from\l"
    .string "off the altar, and put on incense,\l"
    .string "and go quickly unto the\l"
    .string "congregation, and make an atonement\l"
    .string "for them: for there is wrath gone out\l"
    .string "from the LORD; the plague is begun.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_47::
    .string "And Aaron took as Moses commanded,\n"
    .string "and ran into the midst of the\l"
    .string "congregation; and, behold, the\l"
    .string "plague was begun among the people:\l"
    .string "and he put on incense, and made an\l"
    .string "atonement for the people.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_48::
    .string "And he stood between the dead and\n"
    .string "the living; and the plague was\l"
    .string "stayed.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_49::
    .string "Now they that died in the plague\n"
    .string "were fourteen thousand and seven\l"
    .string "hundred, beside them that died about\l"
    .string "the matter of Korah.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_16_50::
    .string "And Aaron returned unto Moses unto\n"
    .string "the door of the tabernacle of the\l"
    .string "congregation: and the plague was\l"
    .string "stayed.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_17_1::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_17_2::
    .string "Speak unto the children of Israel,\n"
    .string "and take of every one of them a rod\l"
    .string "according to the house of their\l"
    .string "fathers, of all their princes\l"
    .string "according to the house of their\l"
    .string "fathers twelve rods: write thou\l"
    .string "every man’s name upon his rod$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_17_3::
    .string "And thou shalt write Aaron’s name\n"
    .string "upon the rod of Levi: for one rod\l"
    .string "shall be for the head of the house\l"
    .string "of their fathers.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_17_4::
    .string "And thou shalt lay them up in the\n"
    .string "tabernacle of the congregation\l"
    .string "before the testimony, where I will\l"
    .string "meet with you.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_17_5::
    .string "And it shall come to pass, that\n"
    .string "the man’s rod, whom I shall choose,\l"
    .string "shall blossom: and I will make to\l"
    .string "cease from me the murmurings of the\l"
    .string "children of Israel, whereby they\l"
    .string "murmur against you.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_17_6::
    .string "And Moses spake unto the children\n"
    .string "of Israel, and every one of their\l"
    .string "princes gave him a rod apiece, for\l"
    .string "each prince one, according to their\l"
    .string "fathers’ houses, even twelve rods:\l"
    .string "and the rod of Aaron was among their\l"
    .string "rods.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_17_7::
    .string "And Moses laid up the rods before\n"
    .string "the LORD in the tabernacle of\l"
    .string "witness.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_17_8::
    .string "And it came to pass, that on the\n"
    .string "morrow Moses went into the\l"
    .string "tabernacle of witness; and, behold,\l"
    .string "the rod of Aaron for the house of\l"
    .string "Levi was budded, and brought forth\l"
    .string "buds, and bloomed blossoms, and\l"
    .string "yielded almonds.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_17_9::
    .string "And Moses brought out all the rods\n"
    .string "from before the LORD unto all the\l"
    .string "children of Israel: and they\l"
    .string "looked, and took every man his rod.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_17_10::
    .string "And the LORD said unto Moses, Bring\n"
    .string "Aaron’s rod again before the\l"
    .string "testimony, to be kept for a token\l"
    .string "against the rebels; and thou shalt\l"
    .string "quite take away their murmurings\l"
    .string "from me, that they die not.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_17_11::
    .string "And Moses did so: as the LORD\n"
    .string "commanded him, so did he.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_17_12::
    .string "And the children of Israel spake\n"
    .string "unto Moses, saying, Behold, we die,\l"
    .string "we perish, we all perish.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_17_13::
    .string "Whosoever cometh any thing near\n"
    .string "unto the tabernacle of the LORD\l"
    .string "shall die: shall we be consumed\l"
    .string "with dying?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_1::
    .string "And the LORD said unto Aaron, Thou\n"
    .string "and thy sons and thy father’s house\l"
    .string "with thee shall bear the iniquity\l"
    .string "of the sanctuary: and thou and thy\l"
    .string "sons with thee shall bear the\l"
    .string "iniquity of your priesthood$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_2::
    .string "And thy brethren also of the tribe\n"
    .string "of Levi, the tribe of thy father,\l"
    .string "bring thou with thee, that they may\l"
    .string "be joined unto thee, and minister\l"
    .string "unto thee: but thou and thy sons with\l"
    .string "thee shall minister before the\l"
    .string "tabernacle of witness.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_3::
    .string "And they shall keep thy charge,\n"
    .string "and the charge of all the\l"
    .string "tabernacle: only they shall not\l"
    .string "come nigh the vessels of the\l"
    .string "sanctuary and the altar, that\l"
    .string "neither they, nor ye also, die.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_4::
    .string "And they shall be joined unto thee,\n"
    .string "and keep the charge of the\l"
    .string "tabernacle of the congregation, for\l"
    .string "all the service of the tabernacle:\l"
    .string "and a stranger shall not come nigh\l"
    .string "unto you.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_5::
    .string "And ye shall keep the charge of\n"
    .string "the sanctuary, and the charge of the\l"
    .string "altar: that there be no wrath any\l"
    .string "more upon the children of Israel.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_6::
    .string "And I, behold, I have taken your\n"
    .string "brethren the Levites from among the\l"
    .string "children of Israel: to you they are\l"
    .string "given as a gift for the LORD, to do\l"
    .string "the service of the tabernacle of the\l"
    .string "congregation.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_7::
    .string "Therefore thou and thy sons with\n"
    .string "thee shall keep your priest’s\l"
    .string "office for everything of the altar,\l"
    .string "and within the vail; and ye shall\l"
    .string "serve: I have given your priest’s\l"
    .string "office unto you as a service of gift:\l"
    .string "and the stranger that cometh nigh\l"
    .string "shall be put to death.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_8::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Aaron,\n"
    .string "Behold, I also have given thee the\l"
    .string "charge of mine heave offerings of\l"
    .string "all the hallowed things of the\l"
    .string "children of Israel; unto thee have I\l"
    .string "given them by reason of the\l"
    .string "anointing, and to thy sons, by an\l"
    .string "ordinance for ever.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_9::
    .string "This shall be thine of the most\n"
    .string "holy things, reserved from the fire:\l"
    .string "every oblation of theirs, every meat\l"
    .string "offering of theirs, and every sin\l"
    .string "offering of theirs, and every\l"
    .string "trespass offering of theirs which\l"
    .string "they shall render unto me, shall\l"
    .string "be most holy for thee and for thy\l"
    .string "sons.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_10::
    .string "In the most holy place shalt thou\n"
    .string "eat it; every male shall eat it: it\l"
    .string "shall be holy unto thee.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_11::
    .string "And this is thine; the heave\n"
    .string "offering of their gift, with all the\l"
    .string "wave offerings of the children of\l"
    .string "Israel: I have given them unto thee,\l"
    .string "and to thy sons and to thy daughters\l"
    .string "with thee, by a statute for ever:\l"
    .string "every one that is clean in thy house\l"
    .string "shall eat of it.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_12::
    .string "All the best of the oil, and all\n"
    .string "the best of the wine, and of the\l"
    .string "wheat, the firstfruits of them which\l"
    .string "they shall offer unto the LORD, them\l"
    .string "have I given thee.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_13::
    .string "And whatsoever is first ripe in the\n"
    .string "land, which they shall bring unto\l"
    .string "the LORD, shall be thine; every one\l"
    .string "that is clean in thine house shall\l"
    .string "eat of it.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_14::
    .string "Every thing devoted in Israel\n"
    .string "shall be thine.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_15::
    .string "Every thing that openeth the matrix\n"
    .string "in all flesh, which they bring unto\l"
    .string "the LORD, whether it be of men or\l"
    .string "beasts, shall be thine:\l"
    .string "nevertheless the firstborn of man\l"
    .string "shalt thou surely redeem, and the\l"
    .string "firstling of unclean beasts shalt\l"
    .string "thou redeem.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_16::
    .string "And those that are to be redeemed\n"
    .string "from a month old shalt thou redeem,\l"
    .string "according to thine estimation, for\l"
    .string "the money of five shekels, after the\l"
    .string "shekel of the sanctuary, which is\l"
    .string "twenty gerahs.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_17::
    .string "But the firstling of a cow, or the\n"
    .string "firstling of a sheep, or the\l"
    .string "firstling of a goat, thou shalt not\l"
    .string "redeem; they are holy: thou shalt\l"
    .string "sprinkle their blood upon the\l"
    .string "altar, and shalt burn their fat for\l"
    .string "an offering made by fire, for a sweet\l"
    .string "savour unto the LORD.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_18::
    .string "And the flesh of them shall be\n"
    .string "thine, as the wave breast and as the\l"
    .string "right shoulder are thine.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_19::
    .string "All the heave offerings of the\n"
    .string "holy things, which the children of\l"
    .string "Israel offer unto the LORD, have I\l"
    .string "given thee, and thy sons and thy\l"
    .string "daughters with thee, by a statute for\l"
    .string "ever: it is a covenant of salt for\l"
    .string "ever before the LORD unto thee and to\l"
    .string "thy seed with thee.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_20::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Aaron, Thou\n"
    .string "shalt have no inheritance in their\l"
    .string "land, neither shalt thou have any\l"
    .string "part among them: I am thy part and\l"
    .string "thine inheritance among the\l"
    .string "children of Israel.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_21::
    .string "And, behold, I have given the\n"
    .string "children of Levi all the tenth in\l"
    .string "Israel for an inheritance, for their\l"
    .string "service which they serve, even the\l"
    .string "service of the tabernacle of the\l"
    .string "congregation.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_22::
    .string "Neither must the children of\n"
    .string "Israel henceforth come nigh the\l"
    .string "tabernacle of the congregation,\l"
    .string "lest they bear sin, and die.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_23::
    .string "But the Levites shall do the\n"
    .string "service of the tabernacle of the\l"
    .string "congregation, and they shall bear\l"
    .string "their iniquity: it shall be a\l"
    .string "statute for ever throughout your\l"
    .string "generations, that among the children\l"
    .string "of Israel they have no inheritance.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_24::
    .string "But the tithes of the children of\n"
    .string "Israel, which they offer as an heave\l"
    .string "offering unto the LORD, I have given\l"
    .string "to the Levites to inherit: therefore\l"
    .string "I have said unto them, Among the\l"
    .string "children of Israel they shall have\l"
    .string "no inheritance.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_25::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_26::
    .string "Thus speak unto the Levites, and\n"
    .string "say unto them, When ye take of the\l"
    .string "children of Israel the tithes which\l"
    .string "I have given you from them for your\l"
    .string "inheritance, then ye shall offer up\l"
    .string "an heave offering of it for the LORD,\l"
    .string "even a tenth part of the tithe$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_27::
    .string "And this your heave offering shall\n"
    .string "be reckoned unto you, as though it\l"
    .string "were the corn of the threshingfloor,\l"
    .string "and as the fulness of the winepress.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_28::
    .string "Thus ye also shall offer an heave\n"
    .string "offering unto the LORD of all your\l"
    .string "tithes, which ye receive of the\l"
    .string "children of Israel; and ye shall\l"
    .string "give thereof the LORD’s heave\l"
    .string "offering to Aaron the priest.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_29::
    .string "Out of all your gifts ye shall\n"
    .string "offer every heave offering of the\l"
    .string "LORD, of all the best thereof, even\l"
    .string "the hallowed part thereof out of it.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_30::
    .string "Therefore thou shalt say unto them,\n"
    .string "When ye have heaved the best thereof\l"
    .string "from it, then it shall be counted\l"
    .string "unto the Levites as the increase of\l"
    .string "the threshingfloor, and as the\l"
    .string "increase of the winepress.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_31::
    .string "And ye shall eat it in every\n"
    .string "place, ye and your households: for\l"
    .string "it is your reward for your service in\l"
    .string "the tabernacle of the congregation.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_18_32::
    .string "And ye shall bear no sin by reason\n"
    .string "of it, when ye have heaved from it the\l"
    .string "best of it: neither shall ye\l"
    .string "pollute the holy things of the\l"
    .string "children of Israel, lest ye die.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_19_1::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses and\n"
    .string "unto Aaron, saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_19_2::
    .string "This is the ordinance of the law\n"
    .string "which the LORD hath commanded,\l"
    .string "saying, Speak unto the children of\l"
    .string "Israel, that they bring thee a red\l"
    .string "heifer without spot, wherein is no\l"
    .string "blemish, and upon which never came\l"
    .string "yoke:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_19_3::
    .string "And ye shall give her unto Eleazar\n"
    .string "the priest, that he may bring her\l"
    .string "forth without the camp, and one\l"
    .string "shall slay her before his face:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_19_4::
    .string "And Eleazar the priest shall take\n"
    .string "of her blood with his finger, and\l"
    .string "sprinkle of her blood directly\l"
    .string "before the tabernacle of the\l"
    .string "congregation seven times:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_19_5::
    .string "And one shall burn the heifer in\n"
    .string "his sight; her skin, and her flesh,\l"
    .string "and her blood, with her dung, shall\l"
    .string "he burn:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_19_6::
    .string "And the priest shall take cedar\n"
    .string "wood, and hyssop, and scarlet, and\l"
    .string "cast it into the midst of the burning\l"
    .string "of the heifer$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_19_7::
    .string "Then the priest shall wash his\n"
    .string "clothes, and he shall bathe his\l"
    .string "flesh in water, and afterward he\l"
    .string "shall come into the camp, and the\l"
    .string "priest shall be unclean until the\l"
    .string "even.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_19_8::
    .string "And he that burneth her shall wash\n"
    .string "his clothes in water, and bathe his\l"
    .string "flesh in water, and shall be\l"
    .string "unclean until the even.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_19_9::
    .string "And a man that is clean shall\n"
    .string "gather up the ashes of the heifer,\l"
    .string "and lay them up without the camp in\l"
    .string "a clean place, and it shall be\l"
    .string "kept for the congregation of the\l"
    .string "children of Israel for a water of\l"
    .string "separation: it is a purification\l"
    .string "for sin.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_19_10::
    .string "And he that gathereth the ashes of\n"
    .string "the heifer shall wash his clothes,\l"
    .string "and be unclean until the even: and\l"
    .string "it shall be unto the children of\l"
    .string "Israel, and unto the stranger that\l"
    .string "sojourneth among them, for a statute\l"
    .string "for ever.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_19_11::
    .string "He that toucheth the dead body of\n"
    .string "any man shall be unclean seven days.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_19_12::
    .string "He shall purify himself with it\n"
    .string "on the third day, and on the seventh\l"
    .string "day he shall be clean: but if he\l"
    .string "purify not himself the third day,\l"
    .string "then the seventh day he shall not be\l"
    .string "clean.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_19_13::
    .string "Whosoever toucheth the dead body of\n"
    .string "any man that is dead, and purifieth\l"
    .string "not himself, defileth the\l"
    .string "tabernacle of the LORD; and that\l"
    .string "soul shall be cut off from Israel:\l"
    .string "because the water of separation was\l"
    .string "not sprinkled upon him, he shall\l"
    .string "be unclean; his uncleanness is yet\l"
    .string "upon him.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_19_14::
    .string "This is the law, when a man dieth in\n"
    .string "a tent: all that come into the tent,\l"
    .string "and all that is in the tent, shall\l"
    .string "be unclean seven days.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_19_15::
    .string "And every open vessel, which hath\n"
    .string "no covering bound upon it, is\l"
    .string "unclean.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_19_16::
    .string "And whosoever toucheth one that is\n"
    .string "slain with a sword in the open\l"
    .string "fields, or a dead body, or a bone of\l"
    .string "a man, or a grave, shall be unclean\l"
    .string "seven days.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_19_17::
    .string "And for an unclean person they\n"
    .string "shall take of the ashes of the burnt\l"
    .string "heifer of purification for sin, and\l"
    .string "running water shall be put thereto\l"
    .string "in a vessel:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_19_18::
    .string "And a clean person shall take\n"
    .string "hyssop, and dip it in the water, and\l"
    .string "sprinkle it upon the tent, and\l"
    .string "upon all the vessels, and upon the\l"
    .string "persons that were there, and upon\l"
    .string "him that touched a bone, or one\l"
    .string "slain, or one dead, or a grave:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_19_19::
    .string "And the clean person shall\n"
    .string "sprinkle upon the unclean on the\l"
    .string "third day, and on the seventh day:\l"
    .string "and on the seventh day he shall\l"
    .string "purify himself, and wash his\l"
    .string "clothes, and bathe himself in\l"
    .string "water, and shall be clean at even$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_19_20::
    .string "But the man that shall be unclean,\n"
    .string "and shall not purify himself, that\l"
    .string "soul shall be cut off from among\l"
    .string "the congregation, because he hath\l"
    .string "defiled the sanctuary of the LORD:\l"
    .string "the water of separation hath not\l"
    .string "been sprinkled upon him; he is\l"
    .string "unclean.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_19_21::
    .string "And it shall be a perpetual\n"
    .string "statute unto them, that he that\l"
    .string "sprinkleth the water of separation\l"
    .string "shall wash his clothes; and he that\l"
    .string "toucheth the water of separation\l"
    .string "shall be unclean until even.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_19_22::
    .string "And whatsoever the unclean person\n"
    .string "toucheth shall be unclean; and the\l"
    .string "soul that toucheth it shall be\l"
    .string "unclean until even.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_1::
    .string "Then came the children of Israel,\n"
    .string "even the whole congregation, into\l"
    .string "the desert of Zin in the first month:\l"
    .string "and the people abode in Kadesh; and\l"
    .string "Miriam died there, and was buried\l"
    .string "there.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_2::
    .string "And there was no water for the\n"
    .string "congregation: and they gathered\l"
    .string "themselves together against Moses\l"
    .string "and against Aaron.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_3::
    .string "And the people chode with Moses,\n"
    .string "and spake, saying, Would God that we\l"
    .string "had died when our brethren died\l"
    .string "before the LORD!"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_4::
    .string "And why have ye brought up the\n"
    .string "congregation of the LORD into this\l"
    .string "wilderness, that we and our cattle\l"
    .string "should die there?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_5::
    .string "And wherefore have ye made us to\n"
    .string "come up out of Egypt, to bring us in\l"
    .string "unto this evil place? it is no\l"
    .string "place of seed, or of figs, or of\l"
    .string "vines, or of pomegranates; neither\l"
    .string "is there any water to drink$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_6::
    .string "And Moses and Aaron went from the\n"
    .string "presence of the assembly unto the\l"
    .string "door of the tabernacle of the\l"
    .string "congregation, and they fell upon\l"
    .string "their faces: and the glory of the\l"
    .string "LORD appeared unto them.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_7::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_8::
    .string "Take the rod, and gather thou the\n"
    .string "assembly together, thou, and Aaron\l"
    .string "thy brother, and speak ye unto the\l"
    .string "rock before their eyes; and it shall\l"
    .string "give forth his water, and thou shalt\l"
    .string "bring forth to them water out of the\l"
    .string "rock: so thou shalt give the\l"
    .string "congregation and their beasts drink$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_9::
    .string "And Moses took the rod from before\n"
    .string "the LORD, as he commanded him.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_10::
    .string "And Moses and Aaron gathered the\n"
    .string "congregation together before the\l"
    .string "rock, and he said unto them, Hear now,\l"
    .string "ye rebels; must we fetch you water\l"
    .string "out of this rock?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_11::
    .string "And Moses lifted up his hand, and\n"
    .string "with his rod he smote the rock twice:\l"
    .string "and the water came out abundantly,\l"
    .string "and the congregation drank, and their\l"
    .string "beasts also$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_12::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses and\n"
    .string "Aaron, Because ye believed me not,\l"
    .string "to sanctify me in the eyes of the\l"
    .string "children of Israel, therefore ye\l"
    .string "shall not bring this congregation\l"
    .string "into the land which I have given\l"
    .string "them.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_13::
    .string "This is the water of Meribah;\n"
    .string "because the children of Israel\l"
    .string "strove with the LORD, and he was\l"
    .string "sanctified in them.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_14::
    .string "And Moses sent messengers from\n"
    .string "Kadesh unto the king of Edom, Thus\l"
    .string "saith thy brother Israel, Thou\l"
    .string "knowest all the travail that hath\l"
    .string "befallen us:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_15::
    .string "How our fathers went down into\n"
    .string "Egypt, and we have dwelt in Egypt a\l"
    .string "long time; and the Egyptians vexed\l"
    .string "us, and our fathers:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_16::
    .string "And when we cried unto the LORD, he\n"
    .string "heard our voice, and sent an angel,\l"
    .string "and hath brought us forth out of\l"
    .string "Egypt: and, behold, we are in\l"
    .string "Kadesh, a city in the uttermost of\l"
    .string "thy border:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_17::
    .string "Let us pass, I pray thee, through\n"
    .string "thy country: we will not pass\l"
    .string "through the fields, or through the\l"
    .string "vineyards, neither will we drink of\l"
    .string "the water of the wells: we will go\l"
    .string "by the king’s high way, we will not\l"
    .string "turn to the right hand nor to the\l"
    .string "left, until we have passed thy\l"
    .string "borders$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_18::
    .string "And Edom said unto him, Thou shalt\n"
    .string "not pass by me, lest I come out\l"
    .string "against thee with the sword.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_19::
    .string "And the children of Israel said\n"
    .string "unto him, We will go by the high\l"
    .string "way: and if I and my cattle drink of\l"
    .string "thy water, then I will pay for it: I\l"
    .string "will only, without doing anything\l"
    .string "else, go through on my feet.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_20::
    .string "And he said, Thou shalt not go\n"
    .string "through. And Edom came out against\l"
    .string "him with much people, and with a\l"
    .string "strong hand.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_21::
    .string "Thus Edom refused to give Israel\n"
    .string "passage through his border:\l"
    .string "wherefore Israel turned away from\l"
    .string "him.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_22::
    .string "And the children of Israel, even\n"
    .string "the whole congregation, journeyed\l"
    .string "from Kadesh, and came unto mount Hor.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_23::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses and\n"
    .string "Aaron in mount Hor, by the coast of\l"
    .string "the land of Edom, saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_24::
    .string "Aaron shall be gathered unto his\n"
    .string "people: for he shall not enter\l"
    .string "into the land which I have given\l"
    .string "unto the children of Israel,\l"
    .string "because ye rebelled against my word\l"
    .string "at the water of Meribah$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_25::
    .string "Take Aaron and Eleazar his son, and\n"
    .string "bring them up unto mount Hor:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_26::
    .string "And strip Aaron of his garments,\n"
    .string "and put them upon Eleazar his son:\l"
    .string "and Aaron shall be gathered unto\l"
    .string "his people, and shall die there$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_27::
    .string "And Moses did as the LORD commanded:\n"
    .string "and they went up into mount Hor in\l"
    .string "the sight of all the congregation.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_28::
    .string "And Moses stripped Aaron of his\n"
    .string "garments, and put them upon Eleazar\l"
    .string "his son; and Aaron died there in the\l"
    .string "top of the mount: and Moses and\l"
    .string "Eleazar came down from the mount.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_20_29::
    .string "And when all the congregation saw\n"
    .string "that Aaron was dead, they mourned for\l"
    .string "Aaron thirty days, even all the\l"
    .string "house of Israel.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_1::
    .string "And when king Arad the Canaanite,\n"
    .string "which dwelt in the south, heard\l"
    .string "tell that Israel came by the way of\l"
    .string "the spies; then he fought against\l"
    .string "Israel, and took some of them\l"
    .string "prisoners.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_2::
    .string "And Israel vowed a vow unto the\n"
    .string "LORD, and said, If thou wilt indeed\l"
    .string "deliver this people into my hand,\l"
    .string "then I will utterly destroy their\l"
    .string "cities.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_3::
    .string "And the LORD hearkened to the voice\n"
    .string "of Israel, and delivered up the\l"
    .string "Canaanites; and they utterly\l"
    .string "destroyed them and their cities: and\l"
    .string "he called the name of the place\l"
    .string "Hormah.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_4::
    .string "And they journeyed from mount Hor by\n"
    .string "the way of the Red sea, to compass\l"
    .string "the land of Edom: and the soul of\l"
    .string "the people was much discouraged\l"
    .string "because of the way.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_5::
    .string "And the people spake against God,\n"
    .string "and against Moses, Wherefore have ye\l"
    .string "brought us up out of Egypt to die in\l"
    .string "the wilderness? for there is no\l"
    .string "bread, neither is there any water;\l"
    .string "and our soul loatheth this light\l"
    .string "bread.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_6::
    .string "And the LORD sent fiery serpents\n"
    .string "among the people, and they bit the\l"
    .string "people; and much people of Israel\l"
    .string "died.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_7::
    .string "Therefore the people came to\n"
    .string "Moses, and said, We have sinned, for\l"
    .string "we have spoken against the LORD, and\l"
    .string "against thee; pray unto the LORD,\l"
    .string "that he take away the serpents from\l"
    .string "us. And Moses prayed for the\l"
    .string "people.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_8::
    .string "And the LORD said unto Moses, Make\n"
    .string "thee a fiery serpent, and set it\l"
    .string "upon a pole: and it shall come to\l"
    .string "pass, that every one that is bitten,\l"
    .string "when he looketh upon it, shall\l"
    .string "live.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_9::
    .string "And Moses made a serpent of brass,\n"
    .string "and put it upon a pole, and it came\l"
    .string "to pass, that if a serpent had\l"
    .string "bitten any man, when he beheld the\l"
    .string "serpent of brass, he lived.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_10::
    .string "And the children of Israel set\n"
    .string "forward, and pitched in Oboth.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_11::
    .string "And they journeyed from Oboth, and\n"
    .string "pitched at Ijeabarim, in the\l"
    .string "wilderness which is before Moab,\l"
    .string "toward the sunrising.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_12::
    .string "From thence they removed, and\n"
    .string "pitched in the valley of Zared.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_13::
    .string "From thence they removed, and\n"
    .string "pitched on the other side of Arnon,\l"
    .string "which is in the wilderness that\l"
    .string "cometh out of the coasts of the\l"
    .string "Amorites: for Arnon is the border of\l"
    .string "Moab, between Moab and the Amorites.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_14::
    .string "Wherefore it is said in the book of\n"
    .string "the wars of the LORD, What he did in\l"
    .string "the Red sea, and in the brooks of\l"
    .string "Arnon,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_15::
    .string "And at the stream of the brooks that\n"
    .string "goeth down to the dwelling of Ar,\l"
    .string "and lieth upon the border of Moab$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_16::
    .string "And from thence they went to Beer:\n"
    .string "that is the well whereof the LORD\l"
    .string "spake unto Moses, Gather the\l"
    .string "people together, and I will give\l"
    .string "them water.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_17::
    .string "Then Israel sang this song, Spring\n"
    .string "up, O well; sing ye unto it:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_18::
    .string "The princes digged the well, the\n"
    .string "nobles of the people digged it, by\l"
    .string "the direction of the lawgiver, with\l"
    .string "their staves. And from the\l"
    .string "wilderness they went to Mattanah:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_19::
    .string "And from Mattanah to Nahaliel: and\n"
    .string "from Nahaliel to Bamoth:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_20::
    .string "And from Bamoth in the valley, that\n"
    .string "is in the country of Moab, to the top\l"
    .string "of Pisgah, which looketh toward\l"
    .string "Jeshimon$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_21::
    .string "And Israel sent messengers unto\n"
    .string "Sihon king of the Amorites, saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_22::
    .string "Let me pass through thy land: we\n"
    .string "will not turn into the fields, or\l"
    .string "into the vineyards; we will not\l"
    .string "drink of the waters of the well: but\l"
    .string "we will go along by the king’s high\l"
    .string "way, until we be past thy borders$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_23::
    .string "And Sihon would not suffer Israel\n"
    .string "to pass through his border: but\l"
    .string "Sihon gathered all his people\l"
    .string "together, and went out against\l"
    .string "Israel into the wilderness: and he\l"
    .string "came to Jahaz, and fought against\l"
    .string "Israel.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_24::
    .string "And Israel smote him with the edge\n"
    .string "of the sword, and possessed his land\l"
    .string "from Arnon unto Jabbok, even unto the\l"
    .string "children of Ammon: for the border of\l"
    .string "the children of Ammon was strong.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_25::
    .string "And Israel took all these cities:\n"
    .string "and Israel dwelt in all the cities\l"
    .string "of the Amorites, in Heshbon, and in\l"
    .string "all the villages thereof.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_26::
    .string "For Heshbon was the city of Sihon\n"
    .string "the king of the Amorites, who had\l"
    .string "fought against the former king of\l"
    .string "Moab, and taken all his land out of\l"
    .string "his hand, even unto Arnon.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_27::
    .string "Wherefore they that speak in\n"
    .string "proverbs say, Come into Heshbon, let\l"
    .string "the city of Sihon be built and\l"
    .string "prepared:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_28::
    .string "For there is a fire gone out of\n"
    .string "Heshbon, a flame from the city of\l"
    .string "Sihon: it hath consumed Ar of Moab,\l"
    .string "and the lords of the high places of\l"
    .string "Arnon$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_29::
    .string "Woe to thee, Moab! thou art undone, O\n"
    .string "people of Chemosh: he hath given his\l"
    .string "sons that escaped, and his\l"
    .string "daughters, into captivity unto Sihon\l"
    .string "king of the Amorites.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_30::
    .string "We have shot at them; Heshbon is\n"
    .string "perished even unto Dibon, and we have\l"
    .string "laid them waste even unto Nophah,\l"
    .string "which reacheth unto Medeba.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_31::
    .string "Thus Israel dwelt in the land of\n"
    .string "the Amorites.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_32::
    .string "And Moses sent to spy out Jaazer,\n"
    .string "and they took the villages thereof,\l"
    .string "and drove out the Amorites that were\l"
    .string "there.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_33::
    .string "And they turned and went up by the\n"
    .string "way of Bashan: and Og the king of\l"
    .string "Bashan went out against them, he, and\l"
    .string "all his people, to the battle at\l"
    .string "Edrei.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_34::
    .string "And the LORD said unto Moses, Fear\n"
    .string "him not: for I have delivered him\l"
    .string "into thy hand, and all his people,\l"
    .string "and his land; and thou shalt do to\l"
    .string "him as thou didst unto Sihon king of\l"
    .string "the Amorites, which dwelt at Heshbon.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_21_35::
    .string "So they smote him, and his sons, and\n"
    .string "all his people, until there was\l"
    .string "none left him alive: and they\l"
    .string "possessed his land.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_1::
    .string "And the children of Israel set\n"
    .string "forward, and pitched in the plains\l"
    .string "of Moab on this side Jordan by\l"
    .string "Jericho.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_2::
    .string "And Balak the son of Zippor saw\n"
    .string "all that Israel had done to the\l"
    .string "Amorites.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_3::
    .string "And Moab was sore afraid of the\n"
    .string "people, because they were many: and\l"
    .string "Moab was distressed because of the\l"
    .string "children of Israel.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_4::
    .string "And Moab said unto the elders of\n"
    .string "Midian, Now shall this company\l"
    .string "lick up all that are round about\l"
    .string "us, as the ox licketh up the grass\l"
    .string "of the field. And Balak the son of\l"
    .string "Zippor was king of the Moabites at\l"
    .string "that time.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_5::
    .string "He sent messengers therefore unto\n"
    .string "Balaam the son of Beor to Pethor,\l"
    .string "which is by the river of the land of\l"
    .string "the children of his people, to\l"
    .string "call him, saying, Behold, there is\l"
    .string "a people come out from Egypt:\l"
    .string "behold, they cover the face of the\l"
    .string "earth, and they abide over against\l"
    .string "me:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_6::
    .string "Come now therefore, I pray thee,\n"
    .string "curse me this people; for they are\l"
    .string "too mighty for me: peradventure I\l"
    .string "shall prevail, that we may smite\l"
    .string "them, and that I may drive them out of\l"
    .string "the land: for I wot that he whom thou\l"
    .string "blessest is blessed, and he whom\l"
    .string "thou cursest is cursed$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_7::
    .string "And the elders of Moab and the\n"
    .string "elders of Midian departed with the\l"
    .string "rewards of divination in their hand;\l"
    .string "and they came unto Balaam, and spake\l"
    .string "unto him the words of Balak.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_8::
    .string "And he said unto them, Lodge here\n"
    .string "this night, and I will bring you\l"
    .string "word again, as the LORD shall speak\l"
    .string "unto me: and the princes of Moab\l"
    .string "abode with Balaam.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_9::
    .string "And God came unto Balaam, and said,\n"
    .string "What men are these with thee?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_10::
    .string "And Balaam said unto God, Balak the\n"
    .string "son of Zippor, king of Moab, hath\l"
    .string "sent unto me, saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_11::
    .string "Behold, there is a people come\n"
    .string "out of Egypt, which covereth the\l"
    .string "face of the earth: come now, curse me\l"
    .string "them; peradventure I shall be able\l"
    .string "to overcome them, and drive them out$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_12::
    .string "And God said unto Balaam, Thou\n"
    .string "shalt not go with them; thou shalt\l"
    .string "not curse the people: for they are\l"
    .string "blessed.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_13::
    .string "And Balaam rose up in the morning,\n"
    .string "and said unto the princes of Balak,\l"
    .string "Get you into your land: for the LORD\l"
    .string "refuseth to give me leave to go with\l"
    .string "you.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_14::
    .string "And the princes of Moab rose up,\n"
    .string "and they went unto Balak, and said,\l"
    .string "Balaam refuseth to come with us.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_15::
    .string "And Balak sent yet again princes,\n"
    .string "more, and more honourable than they.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_16::
    .string "And they came to Balaam, and said to\n"
    .string "him, Thus saith Balak the son of\l"
    .string "Zippor, Let nothing, I pray thee,\l"
    .string "hinder thee from coming unto me:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_17::
    .string "For I will promote thee unto very\n"
    .string "great honour, and I will do\l"
    .string "whatsoever thou sayest unto me: come\l"
    .string "therefore, I pray thee, curse me\l"
    .string "this people$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_18::
    .string "And Balaam answered and said unto\n"
    .string "the servants of Balak, If Balak\l"
    .string "would give me his house full of\l"
    .string "silver and gold, I cannot go beyond\l"
    .string "the word of the LORD my God, to do\l"
    .string "less or more.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_19::
    .string "Now therefore, I pray you, tarry ye\n"
    .string "also here this night, that I may know\l"
    .string "what the LORD will say unto me more.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_20::
    .string "And God came unto Balaam at night,\n"
    .string "and said unto him, If the men come to\l"
    .string "call thee, rise up, and go with\l"
    .string "them; but yet the word which I shall\l"
    .string "say unto thee, that shalt thou do.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_21::
    .string "And Balaam rose up in the morning,\n"
    .string "and saddled his ass, and went with\l"
    .string "the princes of Moab.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_22::
    .string "And God’s anger was kindled because\n"
    .string "he went: and the angel of the LORD\l"
    .string "stood in the way for an adversary\l"
    .string "against him. Now he was riding upon\l"
    .string "his ass, and his two servants were\l"
    .string "with him.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_23::
    .string "And the ass saw the angel of the\n"
    .string "LORD standing in the way, and his\l"
    .string "sword drawn in his hand: and the ass\l"
    .string "turned aside out of the way, and went\l"
    .string "into the field: and Balaam smote the\l"
    .string "ass, to turn her into the way.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_24::
    .string "But the angel of the LORD stood in a\n"
    .string "path of the vineyards, a wall being\l"
    .string "on this side, and a wall on that\l"
    .string "side.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_25::
    .string "And when the ass saw the angel of\n"
    .string "the LORD, she thrust herself unto\l"
    .string "the wall, and crushed Balaam’s foot\l"
    .string "against the wall: and he smote her\l"
    .string "again.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_26::
    .string "And the angel of the LORD went\n"
    .string "further, and stood in a narrow\l"
    .string "place, where was no way to turn\l"
    .string "either to the right hand or to the\l"
    .string "left.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_27::
    .string "And when the ass saw the angel of\n"
    .string "the LORD, she fell down under\l"
    .string "Balaam: and Balaam’s anger was\l"
    .string "kindled, and he smote the ass with a\l"
    .string "staff.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_28::
    .string "And the LORD opened the mouth of\n"
    .string "the ass, and she said unto Balaam,\l"
    .string "What have I done unto thee, that thou\l"
    .string "hast smitten me these three times?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_29::
    .string "And Balaam said unto the ass,\n"
    .string "Because thou hast mocked me: I would\l"
    .string "there were a sword in mine hand, for\l"
    .string "now would I kill thee$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_30::
    .string "And the ass said unto Balaam, Am not\n"
    .string "I thine ass, upon which thou hast\l"
    .string "ridden ever since I was thine unto\l"
    .string "this day? was I ever wont to do so\l"
    .string "unto thee? And he said, Nay.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_31::
    .string "Then the LORD opened the eyes of\n"
    .string "Balaam, and he saw the angel of the\l"
    .string "LORD standing in the way, and his\l"
    .string "sword drawn in his hand: and he bowed\l"
    .string "down his head, and fell flat on his\l"
    .string "face.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_32::
    .string "And the angel of the LORD said unto\n"
    .string "him, Wherefore hast thou smitten\l"
    .string "thine ass these three times? behold,\l"
    .string "I went out to withstand thee, because\l"
    .string "thy way is perverse before me:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_33::
    .string "And the ass saw me, and turned from\n"
    .string "me these three times: unless she had\l"
    .string "turned from me, surely now also I\l"
    .string "had slain thee, and saved her alive$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_34::
    .string "And Balaam said unto the angel of\n"
    .string "the LORD, I have sinned; for I knew\l"
    .string "not that thou stoodest in the way\l"
    .string "against me: now therefore, if it\l"
    .string "displease thee, I will get me back\l"
    .string "again.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_35::
    .string "And the angel of the LORD said unto\n"
    .string "Balaam, Go with the men: but only\l"
    .string "the word that I shall speak unto\l"
    .string "thee, that thou shalt speak. So\l"
    .string "Balaam went with the princes of\l"
    .string "Balak.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_36::
    .string "And when Balak heard that Balaam\n"
    .string "was come, he went out to meet him unto\l"
    .string "a city of Moab, which is in the border\l"
    .string "of Arnon, which is in the utmost\l"
    .string "coast.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_37::
    .string "And Balak said unto Balaam, Did I\n"
    .string "not earnestly send unto thee to\l"
    .string "call thee? wherefore camest thou\l"
    .string "not unto me? am I not able indeed to\l"
    .string "promote thee to honour?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_38::
    .string "And Balaam said unto Balak, Lo, I\n"
    .string "am come unto thee: have I now any\l"
    .string "power at all to say any thing? the\l"
    .string "word that God putteth in my mouth,\l"
    .string "that shall I speak$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_39::
    .string "And Balaam went with Balak, and\n"
    .string "they came unto Kirjathhuzoth.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_40::
    .string "And Balak offered oxen and sheep,\n"
    .string "and sent to Balaam, and to the\l"
    .string "princes that were with him.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_22_41::
    .string "And it came to pass on the morrow,\n"
    .string "that Balak took Balaam, and brought\l"
    .string "him up into the high places of\l"
    .string "Baal, that thence he might see the\l"
    .string "utmost part of the people.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_1::
    .string "And Balaam said unto Balak, Build\n"
    .string "me here seven altars, and prepare\l"
    .string "me here seven oxen and seven rams.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_2::
    .string "And Balak did as Balaam had\n"
    .string "spoken; and Balak and Balaam\l"
    .string "offered on every altar a bullock\l"
    .string "and a ram.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_3::
    .string "And Balaam said unto Balak, Stand\n"
    .string "by thy burnt offering, and I will\l"
    .string "go: peradventure the LORD will come\l"
    .string "to meet me: and whatsoever he sheweth\l"
    .string "me I will tell thee. And he went to\l"
    .string "an high place.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_4::
    .string "And God met Balaam: and he said unto\n"
    .string "him, I have prepared seven altars,\l"
    .string "and I have offered upon every altar\l"
    .string "a bullock and a ram.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_5::
    .string "And the LORD put a word in Balaam’s\n"
    .string "mouth, and said, Return unto Balak,\l"
    .string "and thus thou shalt speak.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_6::
    .string "And he returned unto him, and, lo,\n"
    .string "he stood by his burnt sacrifice, he,\l"
    .string "and all the princes of Moab.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_7::
    .string "And he took up his parable, and\n"
    .string "said, Balak the king of Moab hath\l"
    .string "brought me from Aram, out of the\l"
    .string "mountains of the east, saying, Come,\l"
    .string "curse me Jacob, and come, defy\l"
    .string "Israel.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_8::
    .string "How shall I curse, whom God hath\n"
    .string "not cursed? or how shall I defy,\l"
    .string "whom the LORD hath not defied?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_9::
    .string "For from the top of the rocks I see\n"
    .string "him, and from the hills I behold\l"
    .string "him: lo, the people shall dwell\l"
    .string "alone, and shall not be reckoned\l"
    .string "among the nations$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_10::
    .string "Who can count the dust of Jacob, and\n"
    .string "the number of the fourth part of\l"
    .string "Israel? Let me die the death of the\l"
    .string "righteous, and let my last end be\l"
    .string "like his!"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_11::
    .string "And Balak said unto Balaam, What\n"
    .string "hast thou done unto me? I took thee to\l"
    .string "curse mine enemies, and, behold,\l"
    .string "thou hast blessed them altogether$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_12::
    .string "And he answered and said, Must I not\n"
    .string "take heed to speak that which the\l"
    .string "LORD hath put in my mouth?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_13::
    .string "And Balak said unto him, Come, I\n"
    .string "pray thee, with me unto another\l"
    .string "place, from whence thou mayest see\l"
    .string "them: thou shalt see but the utmost\l"
    .string "part of them, and shalt not see them\l"
    .string "all: and curse me them from thence$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_14::
    .string "And he brought him into the field\n"
    .string "of Zophim, to the top of Pisgah, and\l"
    .string "built seven altars, and offered a\l"
    .string "bullock and a ram on every altar.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_15::
    .string "And he said unto Balak, Stand here\n"
    .string "by thy burnt offering, while I meet\l"
    .string "the LORD yonder.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_16::
    .string "And the LORD met Balaam, and put a\n"
    .string "word in his mouth, and said, Go again\l"
    .string "unto Balak, and say thus.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_17::
    .string "And when he came to him, behold, he\n"
    .string "stood by his burnt offering, and the\l"
    .string "princes of Moab with him. And Balak\l"
    .string "said unto him, What hath the LORD\l"
    .string "spoken?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_18::
    .string "And he took up his parable, and\n"
    .string "said, Rise up, Balak, and hear;\l"
    .string "hearken unto me, thou son of Zippor:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_19::
    .string "God is not a man, that he should\n"
    .string "lie; neither the son of man, that he\l"
    .string "should repent: hath he said, and\l"
    .string "shall he not do it? or hath he\l"
    .string "spoken, and shall he not make it\l"
    .string "good?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_20::
    .string "Behold, I have received commandment\n"
    .string "to bless: and he hath blessed; and I\l"
    .string "cannot reverse it$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_21::
    .string "He hath not beheld iniquity in\n"
    .string "Jacob, neither hath he seen\l"
    .string "perverseness in Israel: the LORD his\l"
    .string "God is with him, and the shout of a\l"
    .string "king is among them.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_22::
    .string "God brought them out of Egypt; he\n"
    .string "hath as it were the strength of an\l"
    .string "unicorn.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_23::
    .string "Surely there is no enchantment\n"
    .string "against Jacob, neither is there any\l"
    .string "divination against Israel:\l"
    .string "according to this time it shall be\l"
    .string "said of Jacob and of Israel, What\l"
    .string "hath God wrought!"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_24::
    .string "Behold, the people shall rise\n"
    .string "up as a great lion, and lift up\l"
    .string "himself as a young lion: he shall\l"
    .string "not lie down until he eat of the\l"
    .string "prey, and drink the blood of the\l"
    .string "slain$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_25::
    .string "And Balak said unto Balaam,\n"
    .string "Neither curse them at all, nor\l"
    .string "bless them at all.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_26::
    .string "But Balaam answered and said unto\n"
    .string "Balak, Told not I thee, saying, All\l"
    .string "that the LORD speaketh, that I must\l"
    .string "do?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_27::
    .string "And Balak said unto Balaam, Come, I\n"
    .string "pray thee, I will bring thee unto\l"
    .string "another place; peradventure it\l"
    .string "will please God that thou mayest\l"
    .string "curse me them from thence$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_28::
    .string "And Balak brought Balaam unto the\n"
    .string "top of Peor, that looketh toward\l"
    .string "Jeshimon.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_29::
    .string "And Balaam said unto Balak, Build\n"
    .string "me here seven altars, and prepare\l"
    .string "me here seven bullocks and seven\l"
    .string "rams.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_23_30::
    .string "And Balak did as Balaam had said,\n"
    .string "and offered a bullock and a ram on\l"
    .string "every altar.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_24_1::
    .string "And when Balaam saw that it\n"
    .string "pleased the LORD to bless Israel,\l"
    .string "he went not, as at other times, to\l"
    .string "seek for enchantments, but he set his\l"
    .string "face toward the wilderness.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_24_2::
    .string "And Balaam lifted up his eyes, and\n"
    .string "he saw Israel abiding in his tents\l"
    .string "according to their tribes; and the\l"
    .string "spirit of God came upon him.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_24_3::
    .string "And he took up his parable, and\n"
    .string "said, Balaam the son of Beor hath\l"
    .string "said, and the man whose eyes are open\l"
    .string "hath said:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_24_4::
    .string "He hath said, which heard the words\n"
    .string "of God, which saw the vision of the\l"
    .string "Almighty, falling into a trance,\l"
    .string "but having his eyes open:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_24_5::
    .string "How goodly are thy tents, O Jacob,\n"
    .string "and thy tabernacles, O Israel!"
Bible_Text_Numbers_24_6::
    .string "As the valleys are they spread\n"
    .string "forth, as gardens by the river’s\l"
    .string "side, as the trees of lign aloes\l"
    .string "which the LORD hath planted, and as\l"
    .string "cedar trees beside the waters$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_24_7::
    .string "He shall pour the water out of his\n"
    .string "buckets, and his seed shall be in\l"
    .string "many waters, and his king shall be\l"
    .string "higher than Agag, and his kingdom\l"
    .string "shall be exalted.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_24_8::
    .string "God brought him forth out of Egypt;\n"
    .string "he hath as it were the strength of an\l"
    .string "unicorn: he shall eat up the\l"
    .string "nations his enemies, and shall\l"
    .string "break their bones, and pierce them\l"
    .string "through with his arrows.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_24_9::
    .string "He couched, he lay down as a lion,\n"
    .string "and as a great lion: who shall stir\l"
    .string "him up? Blessed is he that blesseth\l"
    .string "thee, and cursed is he that curseth\l"
    .string "thee.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_24_10::
    .string "And Balak’s anger was kindled\n"
    .string "against Balaam, and he smote his\l"
    .string "hands together: and Balak said unto\l"
    .string "Balaam, I called thee to curse mine\l"
    .string "enemies, and, behold, thou hast\l"
    .string "altogether blessed them these three\l"
    .string "times.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_24_11::
    .string "Therefore now flee thou to thy\n"
    .string "place: I thought to promote thee\l"
    .string "unto great honour; but, lo, the LORD\l"
    .string "hath kept thee back from honour.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_24_12::
    .string "And Balaam said unto Balak, Spake\n"
    .string "I not also to thy messengers which\l"
    .string "thou sentest unto me, saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_24_13::
    .string "If Balak would give me his house\n"
    .string "full of silver and gold, I cannot\l"
    .string "go beyond the commandment of the\l"
    .string "LORD, to do either good or bad of mine\l"
    .string "own mind; but what the LORD saith,\l"
    .string "that will I speak?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_24_14::
    .string "And now, behold, I go unto my\n"
    .string "people: come therefore, and I will\l"
    .string "advertise thee what this people\l"
    .string "shall do to thy people in the\l"
    .string "latter days$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_24_15::
    .string "And he took up his parable, and\n"
    .string "said, Balaam the son of Beor hath\l"
    .string "said, and the man whose eyes are open\l"
    .string "hath said:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_24_16::
    .string "He hath said, which heard the words\n"
    .string "of God, and knew the knowledge of the\l"
    .string "most High, which saw the vision of\l"
    .string "the Almighty, falling into a\l"
    .string "trance, but having his eyes open:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_24_17::
    .string "I shall see him, but not now: I\n"
    .string "shall behold him, but not nigh:\l"
    .string "there shall come a Star out of\l"
    .string "Jacob, and a Sceptre shall rise out\l"
    .string "of Israel, and shall smite the\l"
    .string "corners of Moab, and destroy all the\l"
    .string "children of Sheth$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_24_18::
    .string "And Edom shall be a possession,\n"
    .string "Seir also shall be a possession\l"
    .string "for his enemies; and Israel shall\l"
    .string "do valiantly.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_24_19::
    .string "Out of Jacob shall come he that\n"
    .string "shall have dominion, and shall\l"
    .string "destroy him that remaineth of the\l"
    .string "city.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_24_20::
    .string "And when he looked on Amalek, he\n"
    .string "took up his parable, and said,\l"
    .string "Amalek was the first of the nations;\l"
    .string "but his latter end shall be that he\l"
    .string "perish for ever.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_24_21::
    .string "And he looked on the Kenites, and\n"
    .string "took up his parable, and said,\l"
    .string "Strong is thy dwellingplace, and\l"
    .string "thou puttest thy nest in a rock.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_24_22::
    .string "Nevertheless the Kenite shall be\n"
    .string "wasted, until Asshur shall carry\l"
    .string "thee away captive.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_24_23::
    .string "And he took up his parable, and\n"
    .string "said, Alas, who shall live when\l"
    .string "God doeth this!"
Bible_Text_Numbers_24_24::
    .string "And ships shall come from the\n"
    .string "coast of Chittim, and shall afflict\l"
    .string "Asshur, and shall afflict Eber, and\l"
    .string "he also shall perish for ever$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_24_25::
    .string "And Balaam rose up, and went and\n"
    .string "returned to his place: and Balak\l"
    .string "also went his way.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_25_1::
    .string "And Israel abode in Shittim, and\n"
    .string "the people began to commit\l"
    .string "whoredom with the daughters of Moab.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_25_2::
    .string "And they called the people unto\n"
    .string "the sacrifices of their gods: and the\l"
    .string "people did eat, and bowed down to\l"
    .string "their gods.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_25_3::
    .string "And Israel joined himself unto\n"
    .string "Baalpeor: and the anger of the LORD\l"
    .string "was kindled against Israel.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_25_4::
    .string "And the LORD said unto Moses, Take\n"
    .string "all the heads of the people, and\l"
    .string "hang them up before the LORD against\l"
    .string "the sun, that the fierce anger of the\l"
    .string "LORD may be turned away from Israel.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_25_5::
    .string "And Moses said unto the judges of\n"
    .string "Israel, Slay ye every one his men\l"
    .string "that were joined unto Baalpeor.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_25_6::
    .string "And, behold, one of the children of\n"
    .string "Israel came and brought unto his\l"
    .string "brethren a Midianitish woman in the\l"
    .string "sight of Moses, and in the sight of\l"
    .string "all the congregation of the\l"
    .string "children of Israel, who were\l"
    .string "weeping before the door of the\l"
    .string "tabernacle of the congregation.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_25_7::
    .string "And when Phinehas, the son of\n"
    .string "Eleazar, the son of Aaron the\l"
    .string "priest, saw it, he rose up from among\l"
    .string "the congregation, and took a javelin\l"
    .string "in his hand;"
Bible_Text_Numbers_25_8::
    .string "And he went after the man of Israel\n"
    .string "into the tent, and thrust both of\l"
    .string "them through, the man of Israel, and\l"
    .string "the woman through her belly. So the\l"
    .string "plague was stayed from the children\l"
    .string "of Israel$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_25_9::
    .string "And those that died in the plague\n"
    .string "were twenty and four thousand.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_25_10::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_25_11::
    .string "Phinehas, the son of Eleazar, the\n"
    .string "son of Aaron the priest, hath turned\l"
    .string "my wrath away from the children of\l"
    .string "Israel, while he was zealous for my\l"
    .string "sake among them, that I consumed not\l"
    .string "the children of Israel in my\l"
    .string "jealousy$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_25_12::
    .string "Wherefore say, Behold, I give unto\n"
    .string "him my covenant of peace:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_25_13::
    .string "And he shall have it, and his seed\n"
    .string "after him, even the covenant of an\l"
    .string "everlasting priesthood; because he\l"
    .string "was zealous for his God, and made an\l"
    .string "atonement for the children of Israel$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_25_14::
    .string "Now the name of the Israelite that\n"
    .string "was slain, even that was slain with\l"
    .string "the Midianitish woman, was Zimri, the\l"
    .string "son of Salu, a prince of a chief\l"
    .string "house among the Simeonites.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_25_15::
    .string "And the name of the Midianitish\n"
    .string "woman that was slain was Cozbi, the\l"
    .string "daughter of Zur; he was head over a\l"
    .string "people, and of a chief house in\l"
    .string "Midian.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_25_16::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_25_17::
    .string "Vex the Midianites, and smite them:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_25_18::
    .string "For they vex you with their wiles,\n"
    .string "wherewith they have beguiled you in\l"
    .string "the matter of Peor, and in the matter\l"
    .string "of Cozbi, the daughter of a prince of\l"
    .string "Midian, their sister, which was\l"
    .string "slain in the day of the plague for\l"
    .string "Peor’s sake$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_1::
    .string "And it came to pass after the\n"
    .string "plague, that the LORD spake unto\l"
    .string "Moses and unto Eleazar the son of\l"
    .string "Aaron the priest, saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_2::
    .string "Take the sum of all the\n"
    .string "congregation of the children of\l"
    .string "Israel, from twenty years old and\l"
    .string "upward, throughout their fathers’\l"
    .string "house, all that are able to go to\l"
    .string "war in Israel$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_3::
    .string "And Moses and Eleazar the priest\n"
    .string "spake with them in the plains of\l"
    .string "Moab by Jordan near Jericho, saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_4::
    .string "Take the sum of the people, from\n"
    .string "twenty years old and upward; as the\l"
    .string "LORD commanded Moses and the\l"
    .string "children of Israel, which went\l"
    .string "forth out of the land of Egypt$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_5::
    .string "Reuben, the eldest son of Israel:\n"
    .string "the children of Reuben; Hanoch, of\l"
    .string "whom cometh the family of the\l"
    .string "Hanochites: of Pallu, the family of\l"
    .string "the Palluites:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_6::
    .string "Of Hezron, the family of the\n"
    .string "Hezronites: of Carmi, the family of\l"
    .string "the Carmites$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_7::
    .string "These are the families of the\n"
    .string "Reubenites: and they that were\l"
    .string "numbered of them were forty and three\l"
    .string "thousand and seven hundred and\l"
    .string "thirty.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_8::
    .string "And the sons of Pallu; Eliab.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_9::
    .string "And the sons of Eliab; Nemuel, and\n"
    .string "Dathan, and Abiram. This is that\l"
    .string "Dathan and Abiram, which were famous\l"
    .string "in the congregation, who strove\l"
    .string "against Moses and against Aaron in\l"
    .string "the company of Korah, when they\l"
    .string "strove against the LORD:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_10::
    .string "And the earth opened her mouth, and\n"
    .string "swallowed them up together with\l"
    .string "Korah, when that company died, what\l"
    .string "time the fire devoured two hundred\l"
    .string "and fifty men: and they became a sign$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_11::
    .string "Notwithstanding the children of\n"
    .string "Korah died not.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_12::
    .string "The sons of Simeon after their\n"
    .string "families: of Nemuel, the family of\l"
    .string "the Nemuelites: of Jamin, the\l"
    .string "family of the Jaminites: of Jachin,\l"
    .string "the family of the Jachinites:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_13::
    .string "Of Zerah, the family of the\n"
    .string "Zarhites: of Shaul, the family of\l"
    .string "the Shaulites$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_14::
    .string "These are the families of the\n"
    .string "Simeonites, twenty and two thousand\l"
    .string "and two hundred.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_15::
    .string "The children of Gad after their\n"
    .string "families: of Zephon, the family of\l"
    .string "the Zephonites: of Haggi, the\l"
    .string "family of the Haggites: of Shuni,\l"
    .string "the family of the Shunites:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_16::
    .string "Of Ozni, the family of the Oznites:\n"
    .string "of Eri, the family of the Erites:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_17::
    .string "Of Arod, the family of the\n"
    .string "Arodites: of Areli, the family of\l"
    .string "the Arelites$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_18::
    .string "These are the families of the\n"
    .string "children of Gad according to those\l"
    .string "that were numbered of them, forty\l"
    .string "thousand and five hundred.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_19::
    .string "The sons of Judah were Er and Onan:\n"
    .string "and Er and Onan died in the land of\l"
    .string "Canaan.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_20::
    .string "And the sons of Judah after their\n"
    .string "families were; of Shelah, the\l"
    .string "family of the Shelanites: of\l"
    .string "Pharez, the family of the Pharzites:\l"
    .string "of Zerah, the family of the Zarhites.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_21::
    .string "And the sons of Pharez were; of\n"
    .string "Hezron, the family of the\l"
    .string "Hezronites: of Hamul, the family of\l"
    .string "the Hamulites.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_22::
    .string "These are the families of Judah\n"
    .string "according to those that were\l"
    .string "numbered of them, threescore and\l"
    .string "sixteen thousand and five hundred.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_23::
    .string "Of the sons of Issachar after their\n"
    .string "families: of Tola, the family of\l"
    .string "the Tolaites: of Pua, the family of\l"
    .string "the Punites:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_24::
    .string "Of Jashub, the family of the\n"
    .string "Jashubites: of Shimron, the family\l"
    .string "of the Shimronites$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_25::
    .string "These are the families of Issachar\n"
    .string "according to those that were\l"
    .string "numbered of them, threescore and four\l"
    .string "thousand and three hundred.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_26::
    .string "Of the sons of Zebulun after their\n"
    .string "families: of Sered, the family of\l"
    .string "the Sardites: of Elon, the family of\l"
    .string "the Elonites: of Jahleel, the\l"
    .string "family of the Jahleelites.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_27::
    .string "These are the families of the\n"
    .string "Zebulunites according to those that\l"
    .string "were numbered of them, threescore\l"
    .string "thousand and five hundred.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_28::
    .string "The sons of Joseph after their\n"
    .string "families were Manasseh and Ephraim.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_29::
    .string "Of the sons of Manasseh: of Machir,\n"
    .string "the family of the Machirites: and\l"
    .string "Machir begat Gilead: of Gilead come\l"
    .string "the family of the Gileadites.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_30::
    .string "These are the sons of Gilead: of\n"
    .string "Jeezer, the family of the\l"
    .string "Jeezerites: of Helek, the family of\l"
    .string "the Helekites:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_31::
    .string "And of Asriel, the family of the\n"
    .string "Asrielites: and of Shechem, the\l"
    .string "family of the Shechemites:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_32::
    .string "And of Shemida, the family of the\n"
    .string "Shemidaites: and of Hepher, the\l"
    .string "family of the Hepherites$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_33::
    .string "And Zelophehad the son of Hepher\n"
    .string "had no sons, but daughters: and the\l"
    .string "names of the daughters of\l"
    .string "Zelophehad were Mahlah, and Noah,\l"
    .string "Hoglah, Milcah, and Tirzah.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_34::
    .string "These are the families of Manasseh,\n"
    .string "and those that were numbered of them,\l"
    .string "fifty and two thousand and seven\l"
    .string "hundred.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_35::
    .string "These are the sons of Ephraim after\n"
    .string "their families: of Shuthelah, the\l"
    .string "family of the Shuthalhites: of\l"
    .string "Becher, the family of the Bachrites:\l"
    .string "of Tahan, the family of the\l"
    .string "Tahanites.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_36::
    .string "And these are the sons of\n"
    .string "Shuthelah: of Eran, the family of\l"
    .string "the Eranites.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_37::
    .string "These are the families of the sons\n"
    .string "of Ephraim according to those that\l"
    .string "were numbered of them, thirty and two\l"
    .string "thousand and five hundred. These are\l"
    .string "the sons of Joseph after their\l"
    .string "families.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_38::
    .string "The sons of Benjamin after their\n"
    .string "families: of Bela, the family of\l"
    .string "the Belaites: of Ashbel, the family\l"
    .string "of the Ashbelites: of Ahiram, the\l"
    .string "family of the Ahiramites:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_39::
    .string "Of Shupham, the family of the\n"
    .string "Shuphamites: of Hupham, the family\l"
    .string "of the Huphamites$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_40::
    .string "And the sons of Bela were Ard and\n"
    .string "Naaman: of Ard, the family of the\l"
    .string "Ardites: and of Naaman, the family\l"
    .string "of the Naamites.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_41::
    .string "These are the sons of Benjamin after\n"
    .string "their families: and they that were\l"
    .string "numbered of them were forty and five\l"
    .string "thousand and six hundred.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_42::
    .string "These are the sons of Dan after\n"
    .string "their families: of Shuham, the\l"
    .string "family of the Shuhamites. These are\l"
    .string "the families of Dan after their\l"
    .string "families.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_43::
    .string "All the families of the\n"
    .string "Shuhamites, according to those that\l"
    .string "were numbered of them, were\l"
    .string "threescore and four thousand and\l"
    .string "four hundred.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_44::
    .string "Of the children of Asher after\n"
    .string "their families: of Jimna, the\l"
    .string "family of the Jimnites: of Jesui,\l"
    .string "the family of the Jesuites: of\l"
    .string "Beriah, the family of the Beriites.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_45::
    .string "Of the sons of Beriah: of Heber, the\n"
    .string "family of the Heberites: of\l"
    .string "Malchiel, the family of the\l"
    .string "Malchielites.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_46::
    .string "And the name of the daughter of\n"
    .string "Asher was Sarah.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_47::
    .string "These are the families of the sons\n"
    .string "of Asher according to those that were\l"
    .string "numbered of them; who were fifty and\l"
    .string "three thousand and four hundred.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_48::
    .string "Of the sons of Naphtali after\n"
    .string "their families: of Jahzeel, the\l"
    .string "family of the Jahzeelites: of Guni,\l"
    .string "the family of the Gunites:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_49::
    .string "Of Jezer, the family of the\n"
    .string "Jezerites: of Shillem, the family\l"
    .string "of the Shillemites$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_50::
    .string "These are the families of\n"
    .string "Naphtali according to their\l"
    .string "families: and they that were\l"
    .string "numbered of them were forty and five\l"
    .string "thousand and four hundred.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_51::
    .string "These were the numbered of the\n"
    .string "children of Israel, six hundred\l"
    .string "thousand and a thousand seven\l"
    .string "hundred and thirty.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_52::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_53::
    .string "Unto these the land shall be\n"
    .string "divided for an inheritance according\l"
    .string "to the number of names$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_54::
    .string "To many thou shalt give the more\n"
    .string "inheritance, and to few thou shalt\l"
    .string "give the less inheritance: to every\l"
    .string "one shall his inheritance be given\l"
    .string "according to those that were\l"
    .string "numbered of him.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_55::
    .string "Notwithstanding the land shall be\n"
    .string "divided by lot: according to the\l"
    .string "names of the tribes of their fathers\l"
    .string "they shall inherit.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_56::
    .string "According to the lot shall the\n"
    .string "possession thereof be divided\l"
    .string "between many and few.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_57::
    .string "And these are they that were\n"
    .string "numbered of the Levites after their\l"
    .string "families: of Gershon, the family of\l"
    .string "the Gershonites: of Kohath, the\l"
    .string "family of the Kohathites: of Merari,\l"
    .string "the family of the Merarites.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_58::
    .string "These are the families of the\n"
    .string "Levites: the family of the Libnites,\l"
    .string "the family of the Hebronites, the\l"
    .string "family of the Mahlites, the family\l"
    .string "of the Mushites, the family of the\l"
    .string "Korathites. And Kohath begat Amram.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_59::
    .string "And the name of Amram’s wife was\n"
    .string "Jochebed, the daughter of Levi, whom\l"
    .string "her mother bare to Levi in Egypt: and\l"
    .string "she bare unto Amram Aaron and Moses,\l"
    .string "and Miriam their sister.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_60::
    .string "And unto Aaron was born Nadab, and\n"
    .string "Abihu, Eleazar, and Ithamar.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_61::
    .string "And Nadab and Abihu died, when they\n"
    .string "offered strange fire before the LORD.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_62::
    .string "And those that were numbered of them\n"
    .string "were twenty and three thousand, all\l"
    .string "males from a month old and upward:\l"
    .string "for they were not numbered among the\l"
    .string "children of Israel, because there\l"
    .string "was no inheritance given them among\l"
    .string "the children of Israel.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_63::
    .string "These are they that were numbered by\n"
    .string "Moses and Eleazar the priest, who\l"
    .string "numbered the children of Israel in\l"
    .string "the plains of Moab by Jordan near\l"
    .string "Jericho.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_64::
    .string "But among these there was not a man\n"
    .string "of them whom Moses and Aaron the\l"
    .string "priest numbered, when they numbered\l"
    .string "the children of Israel in the\l"
    .string "wilderness of Sinai.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_26_65::
    .string "For the LORD had said of them, They\n"
    .string "shall surely die in the\l"
    .string "wilderness. And there was not left a\l"
    .string "man of them, save Caleb the son of\l"
    .string "Jephunneh, and Joshua the son of Nun.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_27_1::
    .string "Then came the daughters of\n"
    .string "Zelophehad, the son of Hepher, the\l"
    .string "son of Gilead, the son of Machir, the\l"
    .string "son of Manasseh, of the families of\l"
    .string "Manasseh the son of Joseph: and\l"
    .string "these are the names of his daughters;\l"
    .string "Mahlah, Noah, and Hoglah, and\l"
    .string "Milcah, and Tirzah.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_27_2::
    .string "And they stood before Moses, and\n"
    .string "before Eleazar the priest, and\l"
    .string "before the princes and all the\l"
    .string "congregation, by the door of the\l"
    .string "tabernacle of the congregation,\l"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_27_3::
    .string "Our father died in the wilderness,\n"
    .string "and he was not in the company of them\l"
    .string "that gathered themselves together\l"
    .string "against the LORD in the company of\l"
    .string "Korah; but died in his own sin, and\l"
    .string "had no sons$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_27_4::
    .string "Why should the name of our father\n"
    .string "be done away from among his family,\l"
    .string "because he hath no son? Give unto us\l"
    .string "therefore a possession among the\l"
    .string "brethren of our father.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_27_5::
    .string "And Moses brought their cause\n"
    .string "before the LORD.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_27_6::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_27_7::
    .string "The daughters of Zelophehad speak\n"
    .string "right: thou shalt surely give them a\l"
    .string "possession of an inheritance among\l"
    .string "their father’s brethren; and thou\l"
    .string "shalt cause the inheritance of their\l"
    .string "father to pass unto them$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_27_8::
    .string "And thou shalt speak unto the\n"
    .string "children of Israel, saying, If a man\l"
    .string "die, and have no son, then ye shall\l"
    .string "cause his inheritance to pass unto\l"
    .string "his daughter.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_27_9::
    .string "And if he have no daughter, then ye\n"
    .string "shall give his inheritance unto his\l"
    .string "brethren.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_27_10::
    .string "And if he have no brethren, then ye\n"
    .string "shall give his inheritance unto his\l"
    .string "father’s brethren.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_27_11::
    .string "And if his father have no brethren,\n"
    .string "then ye shall give his inheritance\l"
    .string "unto his kinsman that is next to him\l"
    .string "of his family, and he shall\l"
    .string "possess it: and it shall be unto the\l"
    .string "children of Israel a statute of\l"
    .string "judgment, as the LORD commanded\l"
    .string "Moses.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_27_12::
    .string "And the LORD said unto Moses, Get\n"
    .string "thee up into this mount Abarim, and\l"
    .string "see the land which I have given unto\l"
    .string "the children of Israel.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_27_13::
    .string "And when thou hast seen it, thou\n"
    .string "also shalt be gathered unto thy\l"
    .string "people, as Aaron thy brother was\l"
    .string "gathered.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_27_14::
    .string "For ye rebelled against my\n"
    .string "commandment in the desert of Zin, in\l"
    .string "the strife of the congregation, to\l"
    .string "sanctify me at the water before their\l"
    .string "eyes: that is the water of Meribah in\l"
    .string "Kadesh in the wilderness of Zin.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_27_15::
    .string "And Moses spake unto the LORD,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_27_16::
    .string "Let the LORD, the God of the spirits\n"
    .string "of all flesh, set a man over the\l"
    .string "congregation,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_27_17::
    .string "Which may go out before them, and\n"
    .string "which may go in before them, and\l"
    .string "which may lead them out, and which\l"
    .string "may bring them in; that the\l"
    .string "congregation of the LORD be not as\l"
    .string "sheep which have no shepherd$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_27_18::
    .string "And the LORD said unto Moses, Take\n"
    .string "thee Joshua the son of Nun, a man in\l"
    .string "whom is the spirit, and lay thine\l"
    .string "hand upon him;"
Bible_Text_Numbers_27_19::
    .string "And set him before Eleazar the\n"
    .string "priest, and before all the\l"
    .string "congregation; and give him a charge\l"
    .string "in their sight$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_27_20::
    .string "And thou shalt put some of thine\n"
    .string "honour upon him, that all the\l"
    .string "congregation of the children of\l"
    .string "Israel may be obedient.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_27_21::
    .string "And he shall stand before Eleazar\n"
    .string "the priest, who shall ask counsel\l"
    .string "for him after the judgment of Urim\l"
    .string "before the LORD: at his word shall\l"
    .string "they go out, and at his word they\l"
    .string "shall come in, both he, and all the\l"
    .string "children of Israel with him, even\l"
    .string "all the congregation.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_27_22::
    .string "And Moses did as the LORD commanded\n"
    .string "him: and he took Joshua, and set him\l"
    .string "before Eleazar the priest, and\l"
    .string "before all the congregation:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_27_23::
    .string "And he laid his hands upon him, and\n"
    .string "gave him a charge, as the LORD\l"
    .string "commanded by the hand of Moses$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_1::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_2::
    .string "Command the children of Israel,\n"
    .string "and say unto them, My offering, and\l"
    .string "my bread for my sacrifices made by\l"
    .string "fire, for a sweet savour unto me,\l"
    .string "shall ye observe to offer unto me in\l"
    .string "their due season$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_3::
    .string "And thou shalt say unto them, This\n"
    .string "is the offering made by fire which ye\l"
    .string "shall offer unto the LORD; two\l"
    .string "lambs of the first year without spot\l"
    .string "day by day, for a continual burnt\l"
    .string "offering.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_4::
    .string "The one lamb shalt thou offer in\n"
    .string "the morning, and the other lamb\l"
    .string "shalt thou offer at even;"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_5::
    .string "And a tenth part of an ephah of\n"
    .string "flour for a meat offering, mingled\l"
    .string "with the fourth part of an hin of\l"
    .string "beaten oil$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_6::
    .string "It is a continual burnt offering,\n"
    .string "which was ordained in mount Sinai for\l"
    .string "a sweet savour, a sacrifice made by\l"
    .string "fire unto the LORD.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_7::
    .string "And the drink offering thereof\n"
    .string "shall be the fourth part of an hin\l"
    .string "for the one lamb: in the holy place\l"
    .string "shalt thou cause the strong wine to\l"
    .string "be poured unto the LORD for a drink\l"
    .string "offering.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_8::
    .string "And the other lamb shalt thou\n"
    .string "offer at even: as the meat offering\l"
    .string "of the morning, and as the drink\l"
    .string "offering thereof, thou shalt offer\l"
    .string "it, a sacrifice made by fire, of a\l"
    .string "sweet savour unto the LORD.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_9::
    .string "And on the sabbath day two lambs of\n"
    .string "the first year without spot, and two\l"
    .string "tenth deals of flour for a meat\l"
    .string "offering, mingled with oil, and the\l"
    .string "drink offering thereof:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_10::
    .string "This is the burnt offering of every\n"
    .string "sabbath, beside the continual burnt\l"
    .string "offering, and his drink offering$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_11::
    .string "And in the beginnings of your months\n"
    .string "ye shall offer a burnt offering\l"
    .string "unto the LORD; two young bullocks,\l"
    .string "and one ram, seven lambs of the first\l"
    .string "year without spot;"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_12::
    .string "And three tenth deals of flour for\n"
    .string "a meat offering, mingled with oil,\l"
    .string "for one bullock; and two tenth\l"
    .string "deals of flour for a meat offering,\l"
    .string "mingled with oil, for one ram;"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_13::
    .string "And a several tenth deal of flour\n"
    .string "mingled with oil for a meat\l"
    .string "offering unto one lamb; for a burnt\l"
    .string "offering of a sweet savour, a\l"
    .string "sacrifice made by fire unto the LORD$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_14::
    .string "And their drink offerings shall be\n"
    .string "half an hin of wine unto a bullock,\l"
    .string "and the third part of an hin unto a\l"
    .string "ram, and a fourth part of an hin unto\l"
    .string "a lamb: this is the burnt offering of\l"
    .string "every month throughout the months of\l"
    .string "the year.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_15::
    .string "And one kid of the goats for a sin\n"
    .string "offering unto the LORD shall be\l"
    .string "offered, beside the continual burnt\l"
    .string "offering, and his drink offering.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_16::
    .string "And in the fourteenth day of the\n"
    .string "first month is the passover of the\l"
    .string "LORD.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_17::
    .string "And in the fifteenth day of this\n"
    .string "month is the feast: seven days shall\l"
    .string "unleavened bread be eaten.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_18::
    .string "In the first day shall be an holy\n"
    .string "convocation; ye shall do no manner\l"
    .string "of servile work therein:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_19::
    .string "But ye shall offer a sacrifice\n"
    .string "made by fire for a burnt offering\l"
    .string "unto the LORD; two young bullocks,\l"
    .string "and one ram, and seven lambs of the\l"
    .string "first year: they shall be unto you\l"
    .string "without blemish:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_20::
    .string "And their meat offering shall be\n"
    .string "of flour mingled with oil: three\l"
    .string "tenth deals shall ye offer for a\l"
    .string "bullock, and two tenth deals for a\l"
    .string "ram;"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_21::
    .string "A several tenth deal shalt thou\n"
    .string "offer for every lamb, throughout the\l"
    .string "seven lambs:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_22::
    .string "And one goat for a sin offering, to\n"
    .string "make an atonement for you$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_23::
    .string "Ye shall offer these beside the\n"
    .string "burnt offering in the morning, which\l"
    .string "is for a continual burnt offering.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_24::
    .string "After this manner ye shall offer\n"
    .string "daily, throughout the seven days,\l"
    .string "the meat of the sacrifice made by\l"
    .string "fire, of a sweet savour unto the\l"
    .string "LORD: it shall be offered beside the\l"
    .string "continual burnt offering, and his\l"
    .string "drink offering.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_25::
    .string "And on the seventh day ye shall\n"
    .string "have an holy convocation; ye shall\l"
    .string "do no servile work.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_26::
    .string "Also in the day of the firstfruits,\n"
    .string "when ye bring a new meat offering\l"
    .string "unto the LORD, after your weeks be\l"
    .string "out, ye shall have an holy\l"
    .string "convocation; ye shall do no servile\l"
    .string "work:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_27::
    .string "But ye shall offer the burnt\n"
    .string "offering for a sweet savour unto the\l"
    .string "LORD; two young bullocks, one ram,\l"
    .string "seven lambs of the first year;"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_28::
    .string "And their meat offering of flour\n"
    .string "mingled with oil, three tenth deals\l"
    .string "unto one bullock, two tenth deals\l"
    .string "unto one ram,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_29::
    .string "A several tenth deal unto one\n"
    .string "lamb, throughout the seven lambs;"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_30::
    .string "And one kid of the goats, to make an\n"
    .string "atonement for you$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_28_31::
    .string "Ye shall offer them beside the\n"
    .string "continual burnt offering, and his\l"
    .string "meat offering, (they shall be unto\l"
    .string "you without blemish) and their drink\l"
    .string "offerings.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_1::
    .string "And in the seventh month, on the\n"
    .string "first day of the month, ye shall\l"
    .string "have an holy convocation; ye shall\l"
    .string "do no servile work: it is a day of\l"
    .string "blowing the trumpets unto you.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_2::
    .string "And ye shall offer a burnt\n"
    .string "offering for a sweet savour unto the\l"
    .string "LORD; one young bullock, one ram,\l"
    .string "and seven lambs of the first year\l"
    .string "without blemish:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_3::
    .string "And their meat offering shall be\n"
    .string "of flour mingled with oil, three\l"
    .string "tenth deals for a bullock, and two\l"
    .string "tenth deals for a ram,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_4::
    .string "And one tenth deal for one lamb,\n"
    .string "throughout the seven lambs:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_5::
    .string "And one kid of the goats for a sin\n"
    .string "offering, to make an atonement for\l"
    .string "you:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_6::
    .string "Beside the burnt offering of the\n"
    .string "month, and his meat offering, and the\l"
    .string "daily burnt offering, and his meat\l"
    .string "offering, and their drink offerings,\l"
    .string "according unto their manner, for a\l"
    .string "sweet savour, a sacrifice made by\l"
    .string "fire unto the LORD$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_7::
    .string "And ye shall have on the tenth day\n"
    .string "of this seventh month an holy\l"
    .string "convocation; and ye shall afflict\l"
    .string "your souls: ye shall not do any\l"
    .string "work therein:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_8::
    .string "But ye shall offer a burnt\n"
    .string "offering unto the LORD for a sweet\l"
    .string "savour; one young bullock, one ram,\l"
    .string "and seven lambs of the first year;\l"
    .string "they shall be unto you without\l"
    .string "blemish:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_9::
    .string "And their meat offering shall be\n"
    .string "of flour mingled with oil, three\l"
    .string "tenth deals to a bullock, and two\l"
    .string "tenth deals to one ram,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_10::
    .string "A several tenth deal for one lamb,\n"
    .string "throughout the seven lambs:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_11::
    .string "One kid of the goats for a sin\n"
    .string "offering; beside the sin offering of\l"
    .string "atonement, and the continual burnt\l"
    .string "offering, and the meat offering of\l"
    .string "it, and their drink offerings$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_12::
    .string "And on the fifteenth day of the\n"
    .string "seventh month ye shall have an holy\l"
    .string "convocation; ye shall do no servile\l"
    .string "work, and ye shall keep a feast\l"
    .string "unto the LORD seven days:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_13::
    .string "And ye shall offer a burnt\n"
    .string "offering, a sacrifice made by fire,\l"
    .string "of a sweet savour unto the LORD;\l"
    .string "thirteen young bullocks, two rams,\l"
    .string "and fourteen lambs of the first\l"
    .string "year; they shall be without\l"
    .string "blemish:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_14::
    .string "And their meat offering shall be\n"
    .string "of flour mingled with oil, three\l"
    .string "tenth deals unto every bullock of\l"
    .string "the thirteen bullocks, two tenth\l"
    .string "deals to each ram of the two rams,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_15::
    .string "And a several tenth deal to each\n"
    .string "lamb of the fourteen lambs:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_16::
    .string "And one kid of the goats for a sin\n"
    .string "offering; beside the continual burnt\l"
    .string "offering, his meat offering, and his\l"
    .string "drink offering$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_17::
    .string "And on the second day ye shall\n"
    .string "offer twelve young bullocks, two\l"
    .string "rams, fourteen lambs of the first\l"
    .string "year without spot:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_18::
    .string "And their meat offering and their\n"
    .string "drink offerings for the bullocks,\l"
    .string "for the rams, and for the lambs,\l"
    .string "shall be according to their number,\l"
    .string "after the manner:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_19::
    .string "And one kid of the goats for a sin\n"
    .string "offering; beside the continual burnt\l"
    .string "offering, and the meat offering\l"
    .string "thereof, and their drink offerings$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_20::
    .string "And on the third day eleven\n"
    .string "bullocks, two rams, fourteen lambs\l"
    .string "of the first year without blemish;"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_21::
    .string "And their meat offering and their\n"
    .string "drink offerings for the bullocks,\l"
    .string "for the rams, and for the lambs,\l"
    .string "shall be according to their number,\l"
    .string "after the manner:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_22::
    .string "And one goat for a sin offering;\n"
    .string "beside the continual burnt offering,\l"
    .string "and his meat offering, and his drink\l"
    .string "offering$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_23::
    .string "And on the fourth day ten bullocks,\n"
    .string "two rams, and fourteen lambs of the\l"
    .string "first year without blemish:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_24::
    .string "Their meat offering and their drink\n"
    .string "offerings for the bullocks, for the\l"
    .string "rams, and for the lambs, shall be\l"
    .string "according to their number, after the\l"
    .string "manner:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_25::
    .string "And one kid of the goats for a sin\n"
    .string "offering; beside the continual burnt\l"
    .string "offering, his meat offering, and his\l"
    .string "drink offering$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_26::
    .string "And on the fifth day nine bullocks,\n"
    .string "two rams, and fourteen lambs of the\l"
    .string "first year without spot:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_27::
    .string "And their meat offering and their\n"
    .string "drink offerings for the bullocks,\l"
    .string "for the rams, and for the lambs,\l"
    .string "shall be according to their number,\l"
    .string "after the manner:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_28::
    .string "And one goat for a sin offering;\n"
    .string "beside the continual burnt offering,\l"
    .string "and his meat offering, and his drink\l"
    .string "offering$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_29::
    .string "And on the sixth day eight\n"
    .string "bullocks, two rams, and fourteen\l"
    .string "lambs of the first year without\l"
    .string "blemish:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_30::
    .string "And their meat offering and their\n"
    .string "drink offerings for the bullocks,\l"
    .string "for the rams, and for the lambs,\l"
    .string "shall be according to their number,\l"
    .string "after the manner:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_31::
    .string "And one goat for a sin offering;\n"
    .string "beside the continual burnt offering,\l"
    .string "his meat offering, and his drink\l"
    .string "offering$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_32::
    .string "And on the seventh day seven\n"
    .string "bullocks, two rams, and fourteen\l"
    .string "lambs of the first year without\l"
    .string "blemish:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_33::
    .string "And their meat offering and their\n"
    .string "drink offerings for the bullocks,\l"
    .string "for the rams, and for the lambs,\l"
    .string "shall be according to their number,\l"
    .string "after the manner:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_34::
    .string "And one goat for a sin offering;\n"
    .string "beside the continual burnt offering,\l"
    .string "his meat offering, and his drink\l"
    .string "offering$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_35::
    .string "On the eighth day ye shall have a\n"
    .string "solemn assembly: ye shall do no\l"
    .string "servile work therein:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_36::
    .string "But ye shall offer a burnt\n"
    .string "offering, a sacrifice made by fire,\l"
    .string "of a sweet savour unto the LORD: one\l"
    .string "bullock, one ram, seven lambs of\l"
    .string "the first year without blemish:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_37::
    .string "Their meat offering and their drink\n"
    .string "offerings for the bullock, for the\l"
    .string "ram, and for the lambs, shall be\l"
    .string "according to their number, after the\l"
    .string "manner:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_38::
    .string "And one goat for a sin offering;\n"
    .string "beside the continual burnt offering,\l"
    .string "and his meat offering, and his drink\l"
    .string "offering$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_39::
    .string "These things ye shall do unto the\n"
    .string "LORD in your set feasts, beside your\l"
    .string "vows, and your freewill offerings,\l"
    .string "for your burnt offerings, and for\l"
    .string "your meat offerings, and for your\l"
    .string "drink offerings, and for your peace\l"
    .string "offerings.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_29_40::
    .string "And Moses told the children of\n"
    .string "Israel according to all that the\l"
    .string "LORD commanded Moses.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_30_1::
    .string "And Moses spake unto the heads of\n"
    .string "the tribes concerning the children\l"
    .string "of Israel, saying, This is the thing\l"
    .string "which the LORD hath commanded.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_30_2::
    .string "If a man vow a vow unto the LORD, or\n"
    .string "swear an oath to bind his soul with a\l"
    .string "bond; he shall not break his word,\l"
    .string "he shall do according to all that\l"
    .string "proceedeth out of his mouth.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_30_3::
    .string "If a woman also vow a vow unto the\n"
    .string "LORD, and bind herself by a bond,\l"
    .string "being in her father’s house in her\l"
    .string "youth;"
Bible_Text_Numbers_30_4::
    .string "And her father hear her vow, and her\n"
    .string "bond wherewith she hath bound her\l"
    .string "soul, and her father shall hold\l"
    .string "his peace at her; then all her vows\l"
    .string "shall stand, and every bond\l"
    .string "wherewith she hath bound her soul\l"
    .string "shall stand$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_30_5::
    .string "But if her father disallow her in\n"
    .string "the day that he heareth; not any of\l"
    .string "her vows, or of her bonds wherewith\l"
    .string "she hath bound her soul, shall\l"
    .string "stand: and the LORD shall forgive\l"
    .string "her, because her father disallowed\l"
    .string "her.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_30_6::
    .string "And if she had at all an husband,\n"
    .string "when she vowed, or uttered ought out\l"
    .string "of her lips, wherewith she bound her\l"
    .string "soul;"
Bible_Text_Numbers_30_7::
    .string "And her husband heard it, and held\n"
    .string "his peace at her in the day that he\l"
    .string "heard it: then her vows shall stand,\l"
    .string "and her bonds wherewith she bound her\l"
    .string "soul shall stand$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_30_8::
    .string "But if her husband disallowed her\n"
    .string "on the day that he heard it; then he\l"
    .string "shall make her vow which she vowed,\l"
    .string "and that which she uttered with her\l"
    .string "lips, wherewith she bound her soul,\l"
    .string "of none effect: and the LORD shall\l"
    .string "forgive her.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_30_9::
    .string "But every vow of a widow, and of her\n"
    .string "that is divorced, wherewith they have\l"
    .string "bound their souls, shall stand\l"
    .string "against her.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_30_10::
    .string "And if she vowed in her husband’s\n"
    .string "house, or bound her soul by a bond\l"
    .string "with an oath;"
Bible_Text_Numbers_30_11::
    .string "And her husband heard it, and held\n"
    .string "his peace at her, and disallowed\l"
    .string "her not: then all her vows shall\l"
    .string "stand, and every bond wherewith she\l"
    .string "bound her soul shall stand$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_30_12::
    .string "But if her husband hath utterly\n"
    .string "made them void on the day he heard\l"
    .string "them; then whatsoever proceeded out\l"
    .string "of her lips concerning her vows, or\l"
    .string "concerning the bond of her soul,\l"
    .string "shall not stand: her husband hath\l"
    .string "made them void; and the LORD shall\l"
    .string "forgive her.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_30_13::
    .string "Every vow, and every binding oath to\n"
    .string "afflict the soul, her husband may\l"
    .string "establish it, or her husband may\l"
    .string "make it void.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_30_14::
    .string "But if her husband altogether hold\n"
    .string "his peace at her from day to day;\l"
    .string "then he establisheth all her vows,\l"
    .string "or all her bonds, which are upon\l"
    .string "her: he confirmeth them, because he\l"
    .string "held his peace at her in the day\l"
    .string "that he heard them.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_30_15::
    .string "But if he shall any ways make them\n"
    .string "void after that he hath heard them;\l"
    .string "then he shall bear her iniquity.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_30_16::
    .string "These are the statutes, which the\n"
    .string "LORD commanded Moses, between a man\l"
    .string "and his wife, between the father and\l"
    .string "his daughter, being yet in her youth\l"
    .string "in her father’s house.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_1::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_2::
    .string "Avenge the children of Israel of\n"
    .string "the Midianites: afterward shalt thou\l"
    .string "be gathered unto thy people$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_3::
    .string "And Moses spake unto the people,\n"
    .string "saying, Arm some of yourselves unto\l"
    .string "the war, and let them go against the\l"
    .string "Midianites, and avenge the LORD of\l"
    .string "Midian.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_4::
    .string "Of every tribe a thousand,\n"
    .string "throughout all the tribes of\l"
    .string "Israel, shall ye send to the war.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_5::
    .string "So there were delivered out of the\n"
    .string "thousands of Israel, a thousand of\l"
    .string "every tribe, twelve thousand armed\l"
    .string "for war.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_6::
    .string "And Moses sent them to the war, a\n"
    .string "thousand of every tribe, them and\l"
    .string "Phinehas the son of Eleazar the\l"
    .string "priest, to the war, with the holy\l"
    .string "instruments, and the trumpets to\l"
    .string "blow in his hand.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_7::
    .string "And they warred against the\n"
    .string "Midianites, as the LORD commanded\l"
    .string "Moses; and they slew all the males.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_8::
    .string "And they slew the kings of Midian,\n"
    .string "beside the rest of them that were\l"
    .string "slain; namely, Evi, and Rekem, and\l"
    .string "Zur, and Hur, and Reba, five kings of\l"
    .string "Midian: Balaam also the son of Beor\l"
    .string "they slew with the sword.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_9::
    .string "And the children of Israel took\n"
    .string "all the women of Midian captives,\l"
    .string "and their little ones, and took the\l"
    .string "spoil of all their cattle, and\l"
    .string "all their flocks, and all their\l"
    .string "goods.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_10::
    .string "And they burnt all their cities\n"
    .string "wherein they dwelt, and all their\l"
    .string "goodly castles, with fire.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_11::
    .string "And they took all the spoil, and\n"
    .string "all the prey, both of men and of\l"
    .string "beasts.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_12::
    .string "And they brought the captives, and\n"
    .string "the prey, and the spoil, unto\l"
    .string "Moses, and Eleazar the priest, and\l"
    .string "unto the congregation of the\l"
    .string "children of Israel, unto the camp\l"
    .string "at the plains of Moab, which are by\l"
    .string "Jordan near Jericho.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_13::
    .string "And Moses, and Eleazar the priest,\n"
    .string "and all the princes of the\l"
    .string "congregation, went forth to meet them\l"
    .string "without the camp.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_14::
    .string "And Moses was wroth with the\n"
    .string "officers of the host, with the\l"
    .string "captains over thousands, and\l"
    .string "captains over hundreds, which came\l"
    .string "from the battle.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_15::
    .string "And Moses said unto them, Have ye\n"
    .string "saved all the women alive?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_16::
    .string "Behold, these caused the children\n"
    .string "of Israel, through the counsel of\l"
    .string "Balaam, to commit trespass against\l"
    .string "the LORD in the matter of Peor, and\l"
    .string "there was a plague among the\l"
    .string "congregation of the LORD$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_17::
    .string "Now therefore kill every male\n"
    .string "among the little ones, and kill\l"
    .string "every woman that hath known man by\l"
    .string "lying with him.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_18::
    .string "But all the women children, that\n"
    .string "have not known a man by lying with\l"
    .string "him, keep alive for yourselves.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_19::
    .string "And do ye abide without the camp\n"
    .string "seven days: whosoever hath killed\l"
    .string "any person, and whosoever hath\l"
    .string "touched any slain, purify both\l"
    .string "yourselves and your captives on the\l"
    .string "third day, and on the seventh day.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_20::
    .string "And purify all your raiment, and\n"
    .string "all that is made of skins, and all\l"
    .string "work of goats’ hair, and all things\l"
    .string "made of wood.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_21::
    .string "And Eleazar the priest said unto\n"
    .string "the men of war which went to the\l"
    .string "battle, This is the ordinance of the\l"
    .string "law which the LORD commanded Moses;"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_22::
    .string "Only the gold, and the silver, the\n"
    .string "brass, the iron, the tin, and the\l"
    .string "lead,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_23::
    .string "Every thing that may abide the fire,\n"
    .string "ye shall make it go through the\l"
    .string "fire, and it shall be clean:\l"
    .string "nevertheless it shall be purified\l"
    .string "with the water of separation: and\l"
    .string "all that abideth not the fire ye\l"
    .string "shall make go through the water$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_24::
    .string "And ye shall wash your clothes on\n"
    .string "the seventh day, and ye shall be\l"
    .string "clean, and afterward ye shall come\l"
    .string "into the camp.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_25::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_26::
    .string "Take the sum of the prey that was\n"
    .string "taken, both of man and of beast, thou,\l"
    .string "and Eleazar the priest, and the\l"
    .string "chief fathers of the congregation:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_27::
    .string "And divide the prey into two parts;\n"
    .string "between them that took the war upon\l"
    .string "them, who went out to battle, and\l"
    .string "between all the congregation:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_28::
    .string "And levy a tribute unto the Lord of\n"
    .string "the men of war which went out to\l"
    .string "battle: one soul of five hundred,\l"
    .string "both of the persons, and of the\l"
    .string "beeves, and of the asses, and of the\l"
    .string "sheep:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_29::
    .string "Take it of their half, and give it\n"
    .string "unto Eleazar the priest, for an\l"
    .string "heave offering of the LORD$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_30::
    .string "And of the children of Israel’s\n"
    .string "half, thou shalt take one portion\l"
    .string "of fifty, of the persons, of the\l"
    .string "beeves, of the asses, and of the\l"
    .string "flocks, of all manner of beasts,\l"
    .string "and give them unto the Levites, which\l"
    .string "keep the charge of the tabernacle\l"
    .string "of the LORD.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_31::
    .string "And Moses and Eleazar the priest\n"
    .string "did as the LORD commanded Moses.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_32::
    .string "And the booty, being the rest of the\n"
    .string "prey which the men of war had caught,\l"
    .string "was six hundred thousand and seventy\l"
    .string "thousand and five thousand sheep,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_33::
    .string "And threescore and twelve thousand\n"
    .string "beeves,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_34::
    .string "And threescore and one thousand\n"
    .string "asses,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_35::
    .string "And thirty and two thousand persons\n"
    .string "in all, of women that had not known\l"
    .string "man by lying with him$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_36::
    .string "And the half, which was the portion\n"
    .string "of them that went out to war, was in\l"
    .string "number three hundred thousand and\l"
    .string "seven and thirty thousand and five\l"
    .string "hundred sheep:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_37::
    .string "And the LORD’s tribute of the sheep\n"
    .string "was six hundred and threescore and\l"
    .string "fifteen$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_38::
    .string "And the beeves were thirty and six\n"
    .string "thousand; of which the LORD’s tribute\l"
    .string "was threescore and twelve.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_39::
    .string "And the asses were thirty thousand\n"
    .string "and five hundred; of which the LORD’s\l"
    .string "tribute was threescore and one.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_40::
    .string "And the persons were sixteen\n"
    .string "thousand; of which the LORD’s tribute\l"
    .string "was thirty and two persons.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_41::
    .string "And Moses gave the tribute, which\n"
    .string "was the LORD’s heave offering, unto\l"
    .string "Eleazar the priest, as the LORD\l"
    .string "commanded Moses.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_42::
    .string "And of the children of Israel’s\n"
    .string "half, which Moses divided from the\l"
    .string "men that warred,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_43::
    .string "(Now the half that pertained unto\n"
    .string "the congregation was three hundred\l"
    .string "thousand and thirty thousand and\l"
    .string "seven thousand and five hundred\l"
    .string "sheep,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_44::
    .string "And thirty and six thousand beeves,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_45::
    .string "And thirty thousand asses and five\n"
    .string "hundred,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_46::
    .string "And sixteen thousand persons;)"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_47::
    .string "Even of the children of Israel’s\n"
    .string "half, Moses took one portion of\l"
    .string "fifty, both of man and of beast, and\l"
    .string "gave them unto the Levites, which\l"
    .string "kept the charge of the tabernacle\l"
    .string "of the LORD; as the LORD commanded\l"
    .string "Moses$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_48::
    .string "And the officers which were over\n"
    .string "thousands of the host, the captains\l"
    .string "of thousands, and captains of\l"
    .string "hundreds, came near unto Moses:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_49::
    .string "And they said unto Moses, Thy\n"
    .string "servants have taken the sum of the\l"
    .string "men of war which are under our\l"
    .string "charge, and there lacketh not one\l"
    .string "man of us$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_50::
    .string "We have therefore brought an\n"
    .string "oblation for the LORD, what every\l"
    .string "man hath gotten, of jewels of gold,\l"
    .string "chains, and bracelets, rings,\l"
    .string "earrings, and tablets, to make an\l"
    .string "atonement for our souls before the\l"
    .string "LORD.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_51::
    .string "And Moses and Eleazar the priest\n"
    .string "took the gold of them, even all\l"
    .string "wrought jewels.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_52::
    .string "And all the gold of the offering\n"
    .string "that they offered up to the LORD, of\l"
    .string "the captains of thousands, and of\l"
    .string "the captains of hundreds, was\l"
    .string "sixteen thousand seven hundred and\l"
    .string "fifty shekels.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_53::
    .string "(For the men of war had taken\n"
    .string "spoil, every man for himself.)"
Bible_Text_Numbers_31_54::
    .string "And Moses and Eleazar the priest\n"
    .string "took the gold of the captains of\l"
    .string "thousands and of hundreds, and\l"
    .string "brought it into the tabernacle of\l"
    .string "the congregation, for a memorial for\l"
    .string "the children of Israel before the\l"
    .string "LORD$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_1::
    .string "Now the children of Reuben and the\n"
    .string "children of Gad had a very great\l"
    .string "multitude of cattle: and when they\l"
    .string "saw the land of Jazer, and the land\l"
    .string "of Gilead, that, behold, the place\l"
    .string "was a place for cattle;"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_2::
    .string "The children of Gad and the\n"
    .string "children of Reuben came and spake\l"
    .string "unto Moses, and to Eleazar the\l"
    .string "priest, and unto the princes of the\l"
    .string "congregation, saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_3::
    .string "Ataroth, and Dibon, and Jazer, and\n"
    .string "Nimrah, and Heshbon, and Elealeh,\l"
    .string "and Shebam, and Nebo, and Beon,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_4::
    .string "Even the country which the LORD\n"
    .string "smote before the congregation of\l"
    .string "Israel, is a land for cattle, and\l"
    .string "thy servants have cattle:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_5::
    .string "Wherefore, said they, if we have\n"
    .string "found grace in thy sight, let this\l"
    .string "land be given unto thy servants for a\l"
    .string "possession, and bring us not over\l"
    .string "Jordan$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_6::
    .string "And Moses said unto the children of\n"
    .string "Gad and to the children of Reuben,\l"
    .string "Shall your brethren go to war, and\l"
    .string "shall ye sit here?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_7::
    .string "And wherefore discourage ye the\n"
    .string "heart of the children of Israel\l"
    .string "from going over into the land which\l"
    .string "the LORD hath given them?"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_8::
    .string "Thus did your fathers, when I sent\n"
    .string "them from Kadeshbarnea to see the\l"
    .string "land$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_9::
    .string "For when they went up unto the\n"
    .string "valley of Eshcol, and saw the\l"
    .string "land, they discouraged the heart of\l"
    .string "the children of Israel, that they\l"
    .string "should not go into the land which\l"
    .string "the LORD had given them.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_10::
    .string "And the LORD’s anger was kindled\n"
    .string "the same time, and he sware, saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_11::
    .string "Surely none of the men that came up\n"
    .string "out of Egypt, from twenty years old\l"
    .string "and upward, shall see the land\l"
    .string "which I sware unto Abraham, unto\l"
    .string "Isaac, and unto Jacob; because they\l"
    .string "have not wholly followed me:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_12::
    .string "Save Caleb the son of Jephunneh\n"
    .string "the Kenezite, and Joshua the son of\l"
    .string "Nun: for they have wholly followed\l"
    .string "the LORD$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_13::
    .string "And the LORD’s anger was kindled\n"
    .string "against Israel, and he made them\l"
    .string "wander in the wilderness forty\l"
    .string "years, until all the generation,\l"
    .string "that had done evil in the sight of\l"
    .string "the LORD, was consumed.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_14::
    .string "And, behold, ye are risen up in\n"
    .string "your fathers’ stead, an increase of\l"
    .string "sinful men, to augment yet the\l"
    .string "fierce anger of the LORD toward\l"
    .string "Israel.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_15::
    .string "For if ye turn away from after him,\n"
    .string "he will yet again leave them in the\l"
    .string "wilderness; and ye shall destroy\l"
    .string "all this people.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_16::
    .string "And they came near unto him, and\n"
    .string "said, We will build sheepfolds\l"
    .string "here for our cattle, and cities for\l"
    .string "our little ones:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_17::
    .string "But we ourselves will go ready\n"
    .string "armed before the children of\l"
    .string "Israel, until we have brought them\l"
    .string "unto their place: and our little\l"
    .string "ones shall dwell in the fenced\l"
    .string "cities because of the inhabitants of\l"
    .string "the land$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_18::
    .string "We will not return unto our houses,\n"
    .string "until the children of Israel have\l"
    .string "inherited every man his inheritance.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_19::
    .string "For we will not inherit with them\n"
    .string "on yonder side Jordan, or forward;\l"
    .string "because our inheritance is fallen\l"
    .string "to us on this side Jordan eastward.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_20::
    .string "And Moses said unto them, If ye\n"
    .string "will do this thing, if ye will go\l"
    .string "armed before the LORD to war,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_21::
    .string "And will go all of you armed over\n"
    .string "Jordan before the LORD, until he\l"
    .string "hath driven out his enemies from\l"
    .string "before him,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_22::
    .string "And the land be subdued before the\n"
    .string "LORD: then afterward ye shall\l"
    .string "return, and be guiltless before the\l"
    .string "LORD, and before Israel; and this\l"
    .string "land shall be your possession\l"
    .string "before the LORD$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_23::
    .string "But if ye will not do so, behold,\n"
    .string "ye have sinned against the LORD: and\l"
    .string "be sure your sin will find you out.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_24::
    .string "Build you cities for your little\n"
    .string "ones, and folds for your sheep; and\l"
    .string "do that which hath proceeded out of\l"
    .string "your mouth.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_25::
    .string "And the children of Gad and the\n"
    .string "children of Reuben spake unto\l"
    .string "Moses, saying, Thy servants will do\l"
    .string "as my lord commandeth.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_26::
    .string "Our little ones, our wives, our\n"
    .string "flocks, and all our cattle, shall\l"
    .string "be there in the cities of Gilead:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_27::
    .string "But thy servants will pass over,\n"
    .string "every man armed for war, before the\l"
    .string "LORD to battle, as my lord saith$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_28::
    .string "So concerning them Moses commanded\n"
    .string "Eleazar the priest, and Joshua the\l"
    .string "son of Nun, and the chief fathers of\l"
    .string "the tribes of the children of\l"
    .string "Israel:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_29::
    .string "And Moses said unto them, If the\n"
    .string "children of Gad and the children of\l"
    .string "Reuben will pass with you over\l"
    .string "Jordan, every man armed to battle,\l"
    .string "before the LORD, and the land shall\l"
    .string "be subdued before you; then ye shall\l"
    .string "give them the land of Gilead for a\l"
    .string "possession:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_30::
    .string "But if they will not pass over\n"
    .string "with you armed, they shall have\l"
    .string "possessions among you in the land of\l"
    .string "Canaan$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_31::
    .string "And the children of Gad and the\n"
    .string "children of Reuben answered, saying,\l"
    .string "As the LORD hath said unto thy\l"
    .string "servants, so will we do.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_32::
    .string "We will pass over armed before the\n"
    .string "LORD into the land of Canaan, that\l"
    .string "the possession of our inheritance on\l"
    .string "this side Jordan may be ours.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_33::
    .string "And Moses gave unto them, even to\n"
    .string "the children of Gad, and to the\l"
    .string "children of Reuben, and unto half\l"
    .string "the tribe of Manasseh the son of\l"
    .string "Joseph, the kingdom of Sihon king of\l"
    .string "the Amorites, and the kingdom of Og\l"
    .string "king of Bashan, the land, with the\l"
    .string "cities thereof in the coasts, even\l"
    .string "the cities of the country round about.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_34::
    .string "And the children of Gad built\n"
    .string "Dibon, and Ataroth, and Aroer,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_35::
    .string "And Atroth, Shophan, and Jaazer,\n"
    .string "and Jogbehah,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_36::
    .string "And Bethnimrah, and Bethharan,\n"
    .string "fenced cities: and folds for sheep$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_37::
    .string "And the children of Reuben built\n"
    .string "Heshbon, and Elealeh, and\l"
    .string "Kirjathaim,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_38::
    .string "And Nebo, and Baalmeon, (their\n"
    .string "names being changed,) and Shibmah:\l"
    .string "and gave other names unto the cities\l"
    .string "which they builded$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_39::
    .string "And the children of Machir the son\n"
    .string "of Manasseh went to Gilead, and took\l"
    .string "it, and dispossessed the Amorite\l"
    .string "which was in it.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_40::
    .string "And Moses gave Gilead unto Machir\n"
    .string "the son of Manasseh; and he dwelt\l"
    .string "therein.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_41::
    .string "And Jair the son of Manasseh went\n"
    .string "and took the small towns thereof,\l"
    .string "and called them Havothjair.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_32_42::
    .string "And Nobah went and took Kenath, and\n"
    .string "the villages thereof, and called\l"
    .string "it Nobah, after his own name.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_1::
    .string "These are the journeys of the\n"
    .string "children of Israel, which went\l"
    .string "forth out of the land of Egypt with\l"
    .string "their armies under the hand of Moses\l"
    .string "and Aaron.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_2::
    .string "And Moses wrote their goings out\n"
    .string "according to their journeys by the\l"
    .string "commandment of the LORD: and these\l"
    .string "are their journeys according to\l"
    .string "their goings out.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_3::
    .string "And they departed from Rameses in\n"
    .string "the first month, on the fifteenth day\l"
    .string "of the first month; on the morrow\l"
    .string "after the passover the children of\l"
    .string "Israel went out with an high hand in\l"
    .string "the sight of all the Egyptians.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_4::
    .string "For the Egyptians buried all\n"
    .string "their firstborn, which the LORD had\l"
    .string "smitten among them: upon their gods\l"
    .string "also the LORD executed judgments.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_5::
    .string "And the children of Israel removed\n"
    .string "from Rameses, and pitched in Succoth.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_6::
    .string "And they departed from Succoth, and\n"
    .string "pitched in Etham, which is in the\l"
    .string "edge of the wilderness.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_7::
    .string "And they removed from Etham, and\n"
    .string "turned again unto Pihahiroth, which\l"
    .string "is before Baalzephon: and they\l"
    .string "pitched before Migdol.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_8::
    .string "And they departed from before\n"
    .string "Pihahiroth, and passed through the\l"
    .string "midst of the sea into the\l"
    .string "wilderness, and went three days’\l"
    .string "journey in the wilderness of Etham,\l"
    .string "and pitched in Marah.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_9::
    .string "And they removed from Marah, and\n"
    .string "came unto Elim: and in Elim were\l"
    .string "twelve fountains of water, and\l"
    .string "threescore and ten palm trees; and\l"
    .string "they pitched there.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_10::
    .string "And they removed from Elim, and\n"
    .string "encamped by the Red sea.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_11::
    .string "And they removed from the Red sea,\n"
    .string "and encamped in the wilderness of\l"
    .string "Sin.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_12::
    .string "And they took their journey out of\n"
    .string "the wilderness of Sin, and encamped\l"
    .string "in Dophkah.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_13::
    .string "And they departed from Dophkah,\n"
    .string "and encamped in Alush.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_14::
    .string "And they removed from Alush, and\n"
    .string "encamped at Rephidim, where was no\l"
    .string "water for the people to drink.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_15::
    .string "And they departed from Rephidim,\n"
    .string "and pitched in the wilderness of\l"
    .string "Sinai.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_16::
    .string "And they removed from the desert of\n"
    .string "Sinai, and pitched at\l"
    .string "Kibrothhattaavah.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_17::
    .string "And they departed from\n"
    .string "Kibrothhattaavah, and encamped at\l"
    .string "Hazeroth.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_18::
    .string "And they departed from Hazeroth,\n"
    .string "and pitched in Rithmah.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_19::
    .string "And they departed from Rithmah, and\n"
    .string "pitched at Rimmonparez.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_20::
    .string "And they departed from\n"
    .string "Rimmonparez, and pitched in Libnah.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_21::
    .string "And they removed from Libnah, and\n"
    .string "pitched at Rissah.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_22::
    .string "And they journeyed from Rissah, and\n"
    .string "pitched in Kehelathah.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_23::
    .string "And they went from Kehelathah, and\n"
    .string "pitched in mount Shapher.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_24::
    .string "And they removed from mount\n"
    .string "Shapher, and encamped in Haradah.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_25::
    .string "And they removed from Haradah, and\n"
    .string "pitched in Makheloth.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_26::
    .string "And they removed from Makheloth,\n"
    .string "and encamped at Tahath.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_27::
    .string "And they departed from Tahath, and\n"
    .string "pitched at Tarah.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_28::
    .string "And they removed from Tarah, and\n"
    .string "pitched in Mithcah.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_29::
    .string "And they went from Mithcah, and\n"
    .string "pitched in Hashmonah.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_30::
    .string "And they departed from Hashmonah,\n"
    .string "and encamped at Moseroth.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_31::
    .string "And they departed from Moseroth,\n"
    .string "and pitched in Benejaakan.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_32::
    .string "And they removed from Benejaakan,\n"
    .string "and encamped at Horhagidgad.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_33::
    .string "And they went from Horhagidgad, and\n"
    .string "pitched in Jotbathah.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_34::
    .string "And they removed from Jotbathah, and\n"
    .string "encamped at Ebronah.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_35::
    .string "And they departed from Ebronah, and\n"
    .string "encamped at Eziongaber.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_36::
    .string "And they removed from Eziongaber,\n"
    .string "and pitched in the wilderness of\l"
    .string "Zin, which is Kadesh.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_37::
    .string "And they removed from Kadesh, and\n"
    .string "pitched in mount Hor, in the edge of\l"
    .string "the land of Edom.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_38::
    .string "And Aaron the priest went up into\n"
    .string "mount Hor at the commandment of the\l"
    .string "LORD, and died there, in the fortieth\l"
    .string "year after the children of Israel\l"
    .string "were come out of the land of Egypt,\l"
    .string "in the first day of the fifth month.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_39::
    .string "And Aaron was an hundred and twenty\n"
    .string "and three years old when he died in\l"
    .string "mount Hor.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_40::
    .string "And king Arad the Canaanite, which\n"
    .string "dwelt in the south in the land of\l"
    .string "Canaan, heard of the coming of the\l"
    .string "children of Israel.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_41::
    .string "And they departed from mount Hor,\n"
    .string "and pitched in Zalmonah.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_42::
    .string "And they departed from Zalmonah,\n"
    .string "and pitched in Punon.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_43::
    .string "And they departed from Punon, and\n"
    .string "pitched in Oboth.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_44::
    .string "And they departed from Oboth, and\n"
    .string "pitched in Ijeabarim, in the border\l"
    .string "of Moab.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_45::
    .string "And they departed from Iim, and\n"
    .string "pitched in Dibongad.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_46::
    .string "And they removed from Dibongad, and\n"
    .string "encamped in Almondiblathaim.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_47::
    .string "And they removed from\n"
    .string "Almondiblathaim, and pitched in\l"
    .string "the mountains of Abarim, before Nebo.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_48::
    .string "And they departed from the\n"
    .string "mountains of Abarim, and pitched in\l"
    .string "the plains of Moab by Jordan near\l"
    .string "Jericho.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_49::
    .string "And they pitched by Jordan, from\n"
    .string "Bethjesimoth even unto Abelshittim\l"
    .string "in the plains of Moab.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_50::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses in\n"
    .string "the plains of Moab by Jordan near\l"
    .string "Jericho, saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_51::
    .string "Speak unto the children of Israel,\n"
    .string "and say unto them, When ye are passed\l"
    .string "over Jordan into the land of Canaan;"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_52::
    .string "Then ye shall drive out all the\n"
    .string "inhabitants of the land from before\l"
    .string "you, and destroy all their\l"
    .string "pictures, and destroy all their\l"
    .string "molten images, and quite pluck down\l"
    .string "all their high places:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_53::
    .string "And ye shall dispossess the\n"
    .string "inhabitants of the land, and dwell\l"
    .string "therein: for I have given you the\l"
    .string "land to possess it$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_54::
    .string "And ye shall divide the land by\n"
    .string "lot for an inheritance among your\l"
    .string "families: and to the more ye shall\l"
    .string "give the more inheritance, and to the\l"
    .string "fewer ye shall give the less\l"
    .string "inheritance: every man’s inheritance\l"
    .string "shall be in the place where his\l"
    .string "lot falleth; according to the\l"
    .string "tribes of your fathers ye shall\l"
    .string "inherit.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_55::
    .string "But if ye will not drive out the\n"
    .string "inhabitants of the land from before\l"
    .string "you; then it shall come to pass,\l"
    .string "that those which ye let remain of\l"
    .string "them shall be pricks in your eyes,\l"
    .string "and thorns in your sides, and shall\l"
    .string "vex you in the land wherein ye\l"
    .string "dwell.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_33_56::
    .string "Moreover it shall come to pass,\n"
    .string "that I shall do unto you, as I\l"
    .string "thought to do unto them.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_1::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_2::
    .string "Command the children of Israel,\n"
    .string "and say unto them, When ye come into\l"
    .string "the land of Canaan; (this is the\l"
    .string "land that shall fall unto you for\l"
    .string "an inheritance, even the land of\l"
    .string "Canaan with the coasts thereof:)"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_3::
    .string "Then your south quarter shall be\n"
    .string "from the wilderness of Zin along by\l"
    .string "the coast of Edom, and your south\l"
    .string "border shall be the outmost coast\l"
    .string "of the salt sea eastward:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_4::
    .string "And your border shall turn from\n"
    .string "the south to the ascent of Akrabbim,\l"
    .string "and pass on to Zin: and the going\l"
    .string "forth thereof shall be from the\l"
    .string "south to Kadeshbarnea, and shall go\l"
    .string "on to Hazaraddar, and pass on to\l"
    .string "Azmon:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_5::
    .string "And the border shall fetch a\n"
    .string "compass from Azmon unto the river of\l"
    .string "Egypt, and the goings out of it\l"
    .string "shall be at the sea$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_6::
    .string "And as for the western border, ye\n"
    .string "shall even have the great sea for a\l"
    .string "border: this shall be your west\l"
    .string "border.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_7::
    .string "And this shall be your north\n"
    .string "border: from the great sea ye shall\l"
    .string "point out for you mount Hor:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_8::
    .string "From mount Hor ye shall point out\n"
    .string "your border unto the entrance of\l"
    .string "Hamath; and the goings forth of the\l"
    .string "border shall be to Zedad:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_9::
    .string "And the border shall go on to\n"
    .string "Ziphron, and the goings out of it\l"
    .string "shall be at Hazarenan: this shall\l"
    .string "be your north border$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_10::
    .string "And ye shall point out your east\n"
    .string "border from Hazarenan to Shepham:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_11::
    .string "And the coast shall go down from\n"
    .string "Shepham to Riblah, on the east side\l"
    .string "of Ain; and the border shall\l"
    .string "descend, and shall reach unto the\l"
    .string "side of the sea of Chinnereth\l"
    .string "eastward:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_12::
    .string "And the border shall go down to\n"
    .string "Jordan, and the goings out of it\l"
    .string "shall be at the salt sea: this\l"
    .string "shall be your land with the coasts\l"
    .string "thereof round about$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_13::
    .string "And Moses commanded the children of\n"
    .string "Israel, saying, This is the land\l"
    .string "which ye shall inherit by lot,\l"
    .string "which the LORD commanded to give unto\l"
    .string "the nine tribes, and to the half\l"
    .string "tribe:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_14::
    .string "For the tribe of the children of\n"
    .string "Reuben according to the house of\l"
    .string "their fathers, and the tribe of the\l"
    .string "children of Gad according to the\l"
    .string "house of their fathers, have received\l"
    .string "their inheritance; and half the\l"
    .string "tribe of Manasseh have received\l"
    .string "their inheritance:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_15::
    .string "The two tribes and the half tribe\n"
    .string "have received their inheritance on\l"
    .string "this side Jordan near Jericho\l"
    .string "eastward, toward the sunrising$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_16::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_17::
    .string "These are the names of the men which\n"
    .string "shall divide the land unto you:\l"
    .string "Eleazar the priest, and Joshua the\l"
    .string "son of Nun$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_18::
    .string "And ye shall take one prince of\n"
    .string "every tribe, to divide the land by\l"
    .string "inheritance.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_19::
    .string "And the names of the men are these:\n"
    .string "Of the tribe of Judah, Caleb the son\l"
    .string "of Jephunneh.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_20::
    .string "And of the tribe of the children of\n"
    .string "Simeon, Shemuel the son of Ammihud.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_21::
    .string "Of the tribe of Benjamin, Elidad\n"
    .string "the son of Chislon.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_22::
    .string "And the prince of the tribe of the\n"
    .string "children of Dan, Bukki the son of\l"
    .string "Jogli.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_23::
    .string "The prince of the children of\n"
    .string "Joseph, for the tribe of the\l"
    .string "children of Manasseh, Hanniel the\l"
    .string "son of Ephod.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_24::
    .string "And the prince of the tribe of the\n"
    .string "children of Ephraim, Kemuel the son\l"
    .string "of Shiphtan.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_25::
    .string "And the prince of the tribe of the\n"
    .string "children of Zebulun, Elizaphan the\l"
    .string "son of Parnach.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_26::
    .string "And the prince of the tribe of the\n"
    .string "children of Issachar, Paltiel the\l"
    .string "son of Azzan.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_27::
    .string "And the prince of the tribe of the\n"
    .string "children of Asher, Ahihud the son of\l"
    .string "Shelomi.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_28::
    .string "And the prince of the tribe of the\n"
    .string "children of Naphtali, Pedahel the\l"
    .string "son of Ammihud.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_34_29::
    .string "These are they whom the LORD\n"
    .string "commanded to divide the inheritance\l"
    .string "unto the children of Israel in the\l"
    .string "land of Canaan.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_1::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses in\n"
    .string "the plains of Moab by Jordan near\l"
    .string "Jericho, saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_2::
    .string "Command the children of Israel,\n"
    .string "that they give unto the Levites of\l"
    .string "the inheritance of their possession\l"
    .string "cities to dwell in; and ye shall\l"
    .string "give also unto the Levites suburbs\l"
    .string "for the cities round about them$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_3::
    .string "And the cities shall they have to\n"
    .string "dwell in; and the suburbs of them\l"
    .string "shall be for their cattle, and for\l"
    .string "their goods, and for all their\l"
    .string "beasts.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_4::
    .string "And the suburbs of the cities, which\n"
    .string "ye shall give unto the Levites,\l"
    .string "shall reach from the wall of the\l"
    .string "city and outward a thousand cubits\l"
    .string "round about.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_5::
    .string "And ye shall measure from without\n"
    .string "the city on the east side two\l"
    .string "thousand cubits, and on the south\l"
    .string "side two thousand cubits, and on the\l"
    .string "west side two thousand cubits, and on\l"
    .string "the north side two thousand cubits;\l"
    .string "and the city shall be in the midst:\l"
    .string "this shall be to them the suburbs of\l"
    .string "the cities.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_6::
    .string "And among the cities which ye\n"
    .string "shall give unto the Levites there\l"
    .string "shall be six cities for refuge,\l"
    .string "which ye shall appoint for the\l"
    .string "manslayer, that he may flee\l"
    .string "thither: and to them ye shall add\l"
    .string "forty and two cities.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_7::
    .string "So all the cities which ye shall\n"
    .string "give to the Levites shall be forty\l"
    .string "and eight cities: them shall ye give\l"
    .string "with their suburbs.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_8::
    .string "And the cities which ye shall give\n"
    .string "shall be of the possession of the\l"
    .string "children of Israel: from them that\l"
    .string "have many ye shall give many; but\l"
    .string "from them that have few ye shall\l"
    .string "give few: every one shall give of\l"
    .string "his cities unto the Levites\l"
    .string "according to his inheritance which\l"
    .string "he inheriteth.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_9::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto Moses,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_10::
    .string "Speak unto the children of Israel,\n"
    .string "and say unto them, When ye be come\l"
    .string "over Jordan into the land of Canaan;"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_11::
    .string "Then ye shall appoint you cities\n"
    .string "to be cities of refuge for you; that\l"
    .string "the slayer may flee thither, which\l"
    .string "killeth any person at unawares$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_12::
    .string "And they shall be unto you cities\n"
    .string "for refuge from the avenger; that the\l"
    .string "manslayer die not, until he stand\l"
    .string "before the congregation in judgment.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_13::
    .string "And of these cities which ye shall\n"
    .string "give six cities shall ye have for\l"
    .string "refuge.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_14::
    .string "Ye shall give three cities on this\n"
    .string "side Jordan, and three cities shall\l"
    .string "ye give in the land of Canaan, which\l"
    .string "shall be cities of refuge.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_15::
    .string "These six cities shall be a refuge,\n"
    .string "both for the children of Israel, and\l"
    .string "for the stranger, and for the\l"
    .string "sojourner among them: that every one\l"
    .string "that killeth any person unawares\l"
    .string "may flee thither.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_16::
    .string "And if he smite him with an\n"
    .string "instrument of iron, so that he die,\l"
    .string "he is a murderer: the murderer shall\l"
    .string "surely be put to death.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_17::
    .string "And if he smite him with throwing a\n"
    .string "stone, wherewith he may die, and he\l"
    .string "die, he is a murderer: the murderer\l"
    .string "shall surely be put to death.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_18::
    .string "Or if he smite him with an hand\n"
    .string "weapon of wood, wherewith he may\l"
    .string "die, and he die, he is a murderer: the\l"
    .string "murderer shall surely be put to\l"
    .string "death.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_19::
    .string "The revenger of blood himself\n"
    .string "shall slay the murderer: when he\l"
    .string "meeteth him, he shall slay him.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_20::
    .string "But if he thrust him of hatred, or\n"
    .string "hurl at him by laying of wait, that\l"
    .string "he die;"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_21::
    .string "Or in enmity smite him with his\n"
    .string "hand, that he die: he that smote him\l"
    .string "shall surely be put to death; for\l"
    .string "he is a murderer: the revenger of\l"
    .string "blood shall slay the murderer,\l"
    .string "when he meeteth him$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_22::
    .string "But if he thrust him suddenly\n"
    .string "without enmity, or have cast upon\l"
    .string "him any thing without laying of\l"
    .string "wait,"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_23::
    .string "Or with any stone, wherewith a man\n"
    .string "may die, seeing him not, and cast it\l"
    .string "upon him, that he die, and was not\l"
    .string "his enemy, neither sought his harm:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_24::
    .string "Then the congregation shall judge\n"
    .string "between the slayer and the revenger\l"
    .string "of blood according to these\l"
    .string "judgments:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_25::
    .string "And the congregation shall\n"
    .string "deliver the slayer out of the hand\l"
    .string "of the revenger of blood, and the\l"
    .string "congregation shall restore him to\l"
    .string "the city of his refuge, whither he\l"
    .string "was fled: and he shall abide in it\l"
    .string "unto the death of the high priest,\l"
    .string "which was anointed with the holy oil$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_26::
    .string "But if the slayer shall at any\n"
    .string "time come without the border of the\l"
    .string "city of his refuge, whither he was\l"
    .string "fled;"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_27::
    .string "And the revenger of blood find him\n"
    .string "without the borders of the city of\l"
    .string "his refuge, and the revenger of\l"
    .string "blood kill the slayer; he shall\l"
    .string "not be guilty of blood:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_28::
    .string "Because he should have remained in\n"
    .string "the city of his refuge until the\l"
    .string "death of the high priest: but after\l"
    .string "the death of the high priest the\l"
    .string "slayer shall return into the land\l"
    .string "of his possession$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_29::
    .string "So these things shall be for a\n"
    .string "statute of judgment unto you\l"
    .string "throughout your generations in all\l"
    .string "your dwellings.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_30::
    .string "Whoso killeth any person, the\n"
    .string "murderer shall be put to death by\l"
    .string "the mouth of witnesses: but one\l"
    .string "witness shall not testify against\l"
    .string "any person to cause him to die.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_31::
    .string "Moreover ye shall take no\n"
    .string "satisfaction for the life of a\l"
    .string "murderer, which is guilty of death:\l"
    .string "but he shall be surely put to\l"
    .string "death.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_32::
    .string "And ye shall take no satisfaction\n"
    .string "for him that is fled to the city of\l"
    .string "his refuge, that he should come\l"
    .string "again to dwell in the land, until\l"
    .string "the death of the priest.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_33::
    .string "So ye shall not pollute the land\n"
    .string "wherein ye are: for blood it\l"
    .string "defileth the land: and the land\l"
    .string "cannot be cleansed of the blood\l"
    .string "that is shed therein, but by the\l"
    .string "blood of him that shed it.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_35_34::
    .string "Defile not therefore the land\n"
    .string "which ye shall inhabit, wherein I\l"
    .string "dwell: for I the LORD dwell among\l"
    .string "the children of Israel.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_36_1::
    .string "And the chief fathers of the\n"
    .string "families of the children of Gilead,\l"
    .string "the son of Machir, the son of\l"
    .string "Manasseh, of the families of the\l"
    .string "sons of Joseph, came near, and spake\l"
    .string "before Moses, and before the\l"
    .string "princes, the chief fathers of the\l"
    .string "children of Israel:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_36_2::
    .string "And they said, The LORD commanded my\n"
    .string "lord to give the land for an\l"
    .string "inheritance by lot to the children\l"
    .string "of Israel: and my lord was commanded\l"
    .string "by the LORD to give the inheritance\l"
    .string "of Zelophehad our brother unto his\l"
    .string "daughters$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_36_3::
    .string "And if they be married to any of the\n"
    .string "sons of the other tribes of the\l"
    .string "children of Israel, then shall\l"
    .string "their inheritance be taken from the\l"
    .string "inheritance of our fathers, and\l"
    .string "shall be put to the inheritance of\l"
    .string "the tribe whereunto they are\l"
    .string "received: so shall it be taken from\l"
    .string "the lot of our inheritance.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_36_4::
    .string "And when the jubile of the\n"
    .string "children of Israel shall be, then\l"
    .string "shall their inheritance be put\l"
    .string "unto the inheritance of the tribe\l"
    .string "whereunto they are received: so\l"
    .string "shall their inheritance be taken\l"
    .string "away from the inheritance of the\l"
    .string "tribe of our fathers.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_36_5::
    .string "And Moses commanded the children of\n"
    .string "Israel according to the word of the\l"
    .string "LORD, saying, The tribe of the sons\l"
    .string "of Joseph hath said well.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_36_6::
    .string "This is the thing which the LORD\n"
    .string "doth command concerning the\l"
    .string "daughters of Zelophehad, saying,\l"
    .string "Let them marry to whom they think\l"
    .string "best; only to the family of the\l"
    .string "tribe of their father shall they\l"
    .string "marry.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_36_7::
    .string "So shall not the inheritance of\n"
    .string "the children of Israel remove from\l"
    .string "tribe to tribe: for every one of the\l"
    .string "children of Israel shall keep\l"
    .string "himself to the inheritance of the\l"
    .string "tribe of his fathers.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_36_8::
    .string "And every daughter, that possesseth\n"
    .string "an inheritance in any tribe of the\l"
    .string "children of Israel, shall be wife\l"
    .string "unto one of the family of the tribe\l"
    .string "of her father, that the children of\l"
    .string "Israel may enjoy every man the\l"
    .string "inheritance of his fathers.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_36_9::
    .string "Neither shall the inheritance\n"
    .string "remove from one tribe to another\l"
    .string "tribe; but every one of the tribes of\l"
    .string "the children of Israel shall keep\l"
    .string "himself to his own inheritance.$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_36_10::
    .string "Even as the LORD commanded Moses, so\n"
    .string "did the daughters of Zelophehad:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_36_11::
    .string "For Mahlah, Tirzah, and Hoglah, and\n"
    .string "Milcah, and Noah, the daughters of\l"
    .string "Zelophehad, were married unto their\l"
    .string "father’s brothers’ sons:"
Bible_Text_Numbers_36_12::
    .string "And they were married into the\n"
    .string "families of the sons of Manasseh the\l"
    .string "son of Joseph, and their inheritance\l"
    .string "remained in the tribe of the family\l"
    .string "of their father$"
Bible_Text_Numbers_36_13::
    .string "These are the commandments and the\n"
    .string "judgments, which the LORD commanded\l"
    .string "by the hand of Moses unto the\l"
    .string "children of Israel in the plains\l"
    .string "of Moab by Jordan near Jericho.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_1::
    .string "These be the words which Moses\n"
    .string "spake unto all Israel on this side\l"
    .string "Jordan in the wilderness, in the\l"
    .string "plain over against the Red sea,\l"
    .string "between Paran, and Tophel, and\l"
    .string "Laban, and Hazeroth, and Dizahab.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_2::
    .string "(There are eleven days’ journey\n"
    .string "from Horeb by the way of mount Seir\l"
    .string "unto Kadeshbarnea.)"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_3::
    .string "And it came to pass in the fortieth\n"
    .string "year, in the eleventh month, on the\l"
    .string "first day of the month, that Moses\l"
    .string "spake unto the children of Israel,\l"
    .string "according unto all that the LORD\l"
    .string "had given him in commandment unto\l"
    .string "them;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_4::
    .string "After he had slain Sihon the king\n"
    .string "of the Amorites, which dwelt in\l"
    .string "Heshbon, and Og the king of Bashan,\l"
    .string "which dwelt at Astaroth in Edrei:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_5::
    .string "On this side Jordan, in the land of\n"
    .string "Moab, began Moses to declare this\l"
    .string "law, saying,"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_6::
    .string "The LORD our God spake unto us in\n"
    .string "Horeb, saying, Ye have dwelt long\l"
    .string "enough in this mount:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_7::
    .string "Turn you, and take your journey, and\n"
    .string "go to the mount of the Amorites, and\l"
    .string "unto all the places nigh\l"
    .string "thereunto, in the plain, in the\l"
    .string "hills, and in the vale, and in the\l"
    .string "south, and by the sea side, to the\l"
    .string "land of the Canaanites, and unto\l"
    .string "Lebanon, unto the great river, the\l"
    .string "river Euphrates$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_8::
    .string "Behold, I have set the land before\n"
    .string "you: go in and possess the land\l"
    .string "which the LORD sware unto your\l"
    .string "fathers, Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob,\l"
    .string "to give unto them and to their seed\l"
    .string "after them.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_9::
    .string "And I spake unto you at that time,\n"
    .string "saying, I am not able to bear you\l"
    .string "myself alone:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_10::
    .string "The LORD your God hath multiplied\n"
    .string "you, and, behold, ye are this day as\l"
    .string "the stars of heaven for multitude$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_11::
    .string "(The LORD God of your fathers make\n"
    .string "you a thousand times so many more as\l"
    .string "ye are, and bless you, as he hath\l"
    .string "promised you!)"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_12::
    .string "How can I myself alone bear your\n"
    .string "cumbrance, and your burden, and your\l"
    .string "strife?"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_13::
    .string "Take you wise men, and\n"
    .string "understanding, and known among your\l"
    .string "tribes, and I will make them rulers\l"
    .string "over you$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_14::
    .string "And ye answered me, and said, The\n"
    .string "thing which thou hast spoken is good\l"
    .string "for us to do.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_15::
    .string "So I took the chief of your tribes,\n"
    .string "wise men, and known, and made them\l"
    .string "heads over you, captains over\l"
    .string "thousands, and captains over\l"
    .string "hundreds, and captains over fifties,\l"
    .string "and captains over tens, and officers\l"
    .string "among your tribes.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_16::
    .string "And I charged your judges at that\n"
    .string "time, saying, Hear the causes between\l"
    .string "your brethren, and judge righteously\l"
    .string "between every man and his brother,\l"
    .string "and the stranger that is with him.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_17::
    .string "Ye shall not respect persons in\n"
    .string "judgment; but ye shall hear the\l"
    .string "small as well as the great; ye\l"
    .string "shall not be afraid of the face of\l"
    .string "man; for the judgment is God’s: and\l"
    .string "the cause that is too hard for you,\l"
    .string "bring it unto me, and I will hear it.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_18::
    .string "And I commanded you at that time\n"
    .string "all the things which ye should do.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_19::
    .string "And when we departed from Horeb, we\n"
    .string "went through all that great and\l"
    .string "terrible wilderness, which ye saw\l"
    .string "by the way of the mountain of the\l"
    .string "Amorites, as the LORD our God\l"
    .string "commanded us; and we came to\l"
    .string "Kadeshbarnea.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_20::
    .string "And I said unto you, Ye are come unto\n"
    .string "the mountain of the Amorites, which\l"
    .string "the LORD our God doth give unto us.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_21::
    .string "Behold, the LORD thy God hath set\n"
    .string "the land before thee: go up and\l"
    .string "possess it, as the LORD God of thy\l"
    .string "fathers hath said unto thee; fear\l"
    .string "not, neither be discouraged.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_22::
    .string "And ye came near unto me every one\n"
    .string "of you, and said, We will send men\l"
    .string "before us, and they shall search us\l"
    .string "out the land, and bring us word again\l"
    .string "by what way we must go up, and into\l"
    .string "what cities we shall come.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_23::
    .string "And the saying pleased me well:\n"
    .string "and I took twelve men of you, one of\l"
    .string "a tribe:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_24::
    .string "And they turned and went up into\n"
    .string "the mountain, and came unto the\l"
    .string "valley of Eshcol, and searched it\l"
    .string "out$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_25::
    .string "And they took of the fruit of the\n"
    .string "land in their hands, and brought it\l"
    .string "down unto us, and brought us word\l"
    .string "again, and said, It is a good land\l"
    .string "which the LORD our God doth give us.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_26::
    .string "Notwithstanding ye would not go\n"
    .string "up, but rebelled against the\l"
    .string "commandment of the LORD your God:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_27::
    .string "And ye murmured in your tents, and\n"
    .string "said, Because the LORD hated us, he\l"
    .string "hath brought us forth out of the\l"
    .string "land of Egypt, to deliver us into\l"
    .string "the hand of the Amorites, to destroy\l"
    .string "us$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_28::
    .string "Whither shall we go up? our\n"
    .string "brethren have discouraged our heart,\l"
    .string "saying, The people is greater and\l"
    .string "taller than we; the cities are great\l"
    .string "and walled up to heaven; and\l"
    .string "moreover we have seen the sons of the\l"
    .string "Anakims there.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_29::
    .string "Then I said unto you, Dread not,\n"
    .string "neither be afraid of them.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_30::
    .string "The LORD your God which goeth before\n"
    .string "you, he shall fight for you,\l"
    .string "according to all that he did for you\l"
    .string "in Egypt before your eyes;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_31::
    .string "And in the wilderness, where thou\n"
    .string "hast seen how that the LORD thy God\l"
    .string "bare thee, as a man doth bear his son,\l"
    .string "in all the way that ye went, until\l"
    .string "ye came into this place$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_32::
    .string "Yet in this thing ye did not\n"
    .string "believe the LORD your God,"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_33::
    .string "Who went in the way before you, to\n"
    .string "search you out a place to pitch\l"
    .string "your tents in, in fire by night, to\l"
    .string "shew you by what way ye should go,\l"
    .string "and in a cloud by day$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_34::
    .string "And the LORD heard the voice of your\n"
    .string "words, and was wroth, and sware,\l"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_35::
    .string "Surely there shall not one of\n"
    .string "these men of this evil generation\l"
    .string "see that good land, which I sware to\l"
    .string "give unto your fathers$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_36::
    .string "Save Caleb the son of Jephunneh; he\n"
    .string "shall see it, and to him will I\l"
    .string "give the land that he hath trodden\l"
    .string "upon, and to his children, because\l"
    .string "he hath wholly followed the LORD.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_37::
    .string "Also the LORD was angry with me for\n"
    .string "your sakes, saying, Thou also shalt\l"
    .string "not go in thither.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_38::
    .string "But Joshua the son of Nun, which\n"
    .string "standeth before thee, he shall go in\l"
    .string "thither: encourage him: for he\l"
    .string "shall cause Israel to inherit it.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_39::
    .string "Moreover your little ones, which\n"
    .string "ye said should be a prey, and your\l"
    .string "children, which in that day had no\l"
    .string "knowledge between good and evil,\l"
    .string "they shall go in thither, and unto\l"
    .string "them will I give it, and they shall\l"
    .string "possess it.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_40::
    .string "But as for you, turn you, and take\n"
    .string "your journey into the wilderness by\l"
    .string "the way of the Red sea.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_41::
    .string "Then ye answered and said unto me,\n"
    .string "We have sinned against the LORD, we\l"
    .string "will go up and fight, according to\l"
    .string "all that the LORD our God commanded\l"
    .string "us. And when ye had girded on every\l"
    .string "man his weapons of war, ye were ready\l"
    .string "to go up into the hill.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_42::
    .string "And the LORD said unto me, Say unto\n"
    .string "them, Go not up, neither fight; for I\l"
    .string "am not among you; lest ye be smitten\l"
    .string "before your enemies.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_43::
    .string "So I spake unto you; and ye would\n"
    .string "not hear, but rebelled against the\l"
    .string "commandment of the LORD, and went\l"
    .string "presumptuously up into the hill.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_44::
    .string "And the Amorites, which dwelt in\n"
    .string "that mountain, came out against you,\l"
    .string "and chased you, as bees do, and\l"
    .string "destroyed you in Seir, even unto\l"
    .string "Hormah.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_45::
    .string "And ye returned and wept before the\n"
    .string "LORD; but the LORD would not hearken\l"
    .string "to your voice, nor give ear unto you.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_1_46::
    .string "So ye abode in Kadesh many days,\n"
    .string "according unto the days that ye abode\l"
    .string "there.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_1::
    .string "Then we turned, and took our journey\n"
    .string "into the wilderness by the way of\l"
    .string "the Red sea, as the LORD spake unto\l"
    .string "me: and we compassed mount Seir many\l"
    .string "days.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_2::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto me, saying,"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_3::
    .string "Ye have compassed this mountain\n"
    .string "long enough: turn you northward$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_4::
    .string "And command thou the people,\n"
    .string "saying, Ye are to pass through the\l"
    .string "coast of your brethren the children\l"
    .string "of Esau, which dwell in Seir; and\l"
    .string "they shall be afraid of you: take ye\l"
    .string "good heed unto yourselves therefore:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_5::
    .string "Meddle not with them; for I will\n"
    .string "not give you of their land, no, not\l"
    .string "so much as a foot breadth; because I\l"
    .string "have given mount Seir unto Esau for a\l"
    .string "possession$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_6::
    .string "Ye shall buy meat of them for\n"
    .string "money, that ye may eat; and ye shall\l"
    .string "also buy water of them for money,\l"
    .string "that ye may drink.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_7::
    .string "For the LORD thy God hath blessed\n"
    .string "thee in all the works of thy hand:\l"
    .string "he knoweth thy walking through this\l"
    .string "great wilderness: these forty years\l"
    .string "the LORD thy God hath been with thee;\l"
    .string "thou hast lacked nothing.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_8::
    .string "And when we passed by from our\n"
    .string "brethren the children of Esau, which\l"
    .string "dwelt in Seir, through the way of the\l"
    .string "plain from Elath, and from\l"
    .string "Eziongaber, we turned and passed by\l"
    .string "the way of the wilderness of Moab.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_9::
    .string "And the LORD said unto me, Distress\n"
    .string "not the Moabites, neither contend\l"
    .string "with them in battle: for I will not\l"
    .string "give thee of their land for a\l"
    .string "possession; because I have given Ar\l"
    .string "unto the children of Lot for a\l"
    .string "possession.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_10::
    .string "The Emims dwelt therein in times\n"
    .string "past, a people great, and many, and\l"
    .string "tall, as the Anakims;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_11::
    .string "Which also were accounted giants,\n"
    .string "as the Anakims; but the Moabites\l"
    .string "called them Emims$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_12::
    .string "The Horims also dwelt in Seir\n"
    .string "beforetime; but the children of Esau\l"
    .string "succeeded them, when they had\l"
    .string "destroyed them from before them, and\l"
    .string "dwelt in their stead; as Israel did\l"
    .string "unto the land of his possession,\l"
    .string "which the LORD gave unto them.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_13::
    .string "Now rise up, said I, and get you\n"
    .string "over the brook Zered. And we went\l"
    .string "over the brook Zered.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_14::
    .string "And the space in which we came from\n"
    .string "Kadeshbarnea, until we were come\l"
    .string "over the brook Zered, was thirty and\l"
    .string "eight years; until all the\l"
    .string "generation of the men of war were\l"
    .string "wasted out from among the host, as\l"
    .string "the LORD sware unto them.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_15::
    .string "For indeed the hand of the LORD was\n"
    .string "against them, to destroy them from\l"
    .string "among the host, until they were\l"
    .string "consumed.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_16::
    .string "So it came to pass, when all the\n"
    .string "men of war were consumed and dead\l"
    .string "from among the people,"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_17::
    .string "That the LORD spake unto me,\n"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_18::
    .string "Thou art to pass over through Ar,\n"
    .string "the coast of Moab, this day:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_19::
    .string "And when thou comest nigh over\n"
    .string "against the children of Ammon,\l"
    .string "distress them not, nor meddle with\l"
    .string "them: for I will not give thee of\l"
    .string "the land of the children of Ammon\l"
    .string "any possession; because I have given\l"
    .string "it unto the children of Lot for a\l"
    .string "possession$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_20::
    .string "(That also was accounted a land of\n"
    .string "giants: giants dwelt therein in old\l"
    .string "time; and the Ammonites call them\l"
    .string "Zamzummims;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_21::
    .string "A people great, and many, and\n"
    .string "tall, as the Anakims; but the LORD\l"
    .string "destroyed them before them; and they\l"
    .string "succeeded them, and dwelt in their\l"
    .string "stead:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_22::
    .string "As he did to the children of Esau,\n"
    .string "which dwelt in Seir, when he\l"
    .string "destroyed the Horims from before\l"
    .string "them; and they succeeded them, and\l"
    .string "dwelt in their stead even unto this\l"
    .string "day:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_23::
    .string "And the Avims which dwelt in\n"
    .string "Hazerim, even unto Azzah, the\l"
    .string "Caphtorims, which came forth out of\l"
    .string "Caphtor, destroyed them, and dwelt\l"
    .string "in their stead.)"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_24::
    .string "Rise ye up, take your journey, and\n"
    .string "pass over the river Arnon: behold, I\l"
    .string "have given into thine hand Sihon the\l"
    .string "Amorite, king of Heshbon, and his\l"
    .string "land: begin to possess it, and\l"
    .string "contend with him in battle$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_25::
    .string "This day will I begin to put the\n"
    .string "dread of thee and the fear of thee\l"
    .string "upon the nations that are under the\l"
    .string "whole heaven, who shall hear\l"
    .string "report of thee, and shall tremble,\l"
    .string "and be in anguish because of thee.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_26::
    .string "And I sent messengers out of the\n"
    .string "wilderness of Kedemoth unto Sihon\l"
    .string "king of Heshbon with words of peace,\l"
    .string "saying,"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_27::
    .string "Let me pass through thy land: I\n"
    .string "will go along by the high way, I\l"
    .string "will neither turn unto the right\l"
    .string "hand nor to the left$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_28::
    .string "Thou shalt sell me meat for money,\n"
    .string "that I may eat; and give me water for\l"
    .string "money, that I may drink: only I\l"
    .string "will pass through on my feet;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_29::
    .string "(As the children of Esau which\n"
    .string "dwell in Seir, and the Moabites\l"
    .string "which dwell in Ar, did unto me;)\l"
    .string "until I shall pass over Jordan\l"
    .string "into the land which the LORD our God\l"
    .string "giveth us$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_30::
    .string "But Sihon king of Heshbon would not\n"
    .string "let us pass by him: for the LORD thy\l"
    .string "God hardened his spirit, and made\l"
    .string "his heart obstinate, that he might\l"
    .string "deliver him into thy hand, as\l"
    .string "appeareth this day.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_31::
    .string "And the LORD said unto me, Behold, I\n"
    .string "have begun to give Sihon and his\l"
    .string "land before thee: begin to possess,\l"
    .string "that thou mayest inherit his land.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_32::
    .string "Then Sihon came out against us, he\n"
    .string "and all his people, to fight at\l"
    .string "Jahaz.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_33::
    .string "And the LORD our God delivered him\n"
    .string "before us; and we smote him, and his\l"
    .string "sons, and all his people.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_34::
    .string "And we took all his cities at that\n"
    .string "time, and utterly destroyed the men,\l"
    .string "and the women, and the little ones,\l"
    .string "of every city, we left none to\l"
    .string "remain:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_35::
    .string "Only the cattle we took for a prey\n"
    .string "unto ourselves, and the spoil of\l"
    .string "the cities which we took$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_36::
    .string "From Aroer, which is by the brink of\n"
    .string "the river of Arnon, and from the city\l"
    .string "that is by the river, even unto\l"
    .string "Gilead, there was not one city too\l"
    .string "strong for us: the LORD our God\l"
    .string "delivered all unto us:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_2_37::
    .string "Only unto the land of the children\n"
    .string "of Ammon thou camest not, nor unto\l"
    .string "any place of the river Jabbok, nor\l"
    .string "unto the cities in the mountains, nor\l"
    .string "unto whatsoever the LORD our God\l"
    .string "forbad us$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_1::
    .string "Then we turned, and went up the way\n"
    .string "to Bashan: and Og the king of Bashan\l"
    .string "came out against us, he and all his\l"
    .string "people, to battle at Edrei.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_2::
    .string "And the LORD said unto me, Fear him\n"
    .string "not: for I will deliver him, and\l"
    .string "all his people, and his land,\l"
    .string "into thy hand; and thou shalt do unto\l"
    .string "him as thou didst unto Sihon king of\l"
    .string "the Amorites, which dwelt at Heshbon.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_3::
    .string "So the LORD our God delivered into\n"
    .string "our hands Og also, the king of\l"
    .string "Bashan, and all his people: and we\l"
    .string "smote him until none was left to him\l"
    .string "remaining.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_4::
    .string "And we took all his cities at that\n"
    .string "time, there was not a city which we\l"
    .string "took not from them, threescore\l"
    .string "cities, all the region of Argob, the\l"
    .string "kingdom of Og in Bashan.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_5::
    .string "All these cities were fenced with\n"
    .string "high walls, gates, and bars; beside\l"
    .string "unwalled towns a great many.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_6::
    .string "And we utterly destroyed them, as\n"
    .string "we did unto Sihon king of Heshbon,\l"
    .string "utterly destroying the men, women,\l"
    .string "and children, of every city.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_7::
    .string "But all the cattle, and the spoil\n"
    .string "of the cities, we took for a prey to\l"
    .string "ourselves.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_8::
    .string "And we took at that time out of the\n"
    .string "hand of the two kings of the Amorites\l"
    .string "the land that was on this side\l"
    .string "Jordan, from the river of Arnon unto\l"
    .string "mount Hermon;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_9::
    .string "(Which Hermon the Sidonians call\n"
    .string "Sirion; and the Amorites call it\l"
    .string "Shenir;)"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_10::
    .string "All the cities of the plain, and\n"
    .string "all Gilead, and all Bashan, unto\l"
    .string "Salchah and Edrei, cities of the\l"
    .string "kingdom of Og in Bashan$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_11::
    .string "For only Og king of Bashan remained\n"
    .string "of the remnant of giants; behold his\l"
    .string "bedstead was a bedstead of iron; is\l"
    .string "it not in Rabbath of the children of\l"
    .string "Ammon? nine cubits was the length\l"
    .string "thereof, and four cubits the breadth\l"
    .string "of it, after the cubit of a man.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_12::
    .string "And this land, which we possessed\n"
    .string "at that time, from Aroer, which is by\l"
    .string "the river Arnon, and half mount\l"
    .string "Gilead, and the cities thereof, gave\l"
    .string "I unto the Reubenites and to the\l"
    .string "Gadites.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_13::
    .string "And the rest of Gilead, and all\n"
    .string "Bashan, being the kingdom of Og, gave\l"
    .string "I unto the half tribe of Manasseh;\l"
    .string "all the region of Argob, with all\l"
    .string "Bashan, which was called the land\l"
    .string "of giants.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_14::
    .string "Jair the son of Manasseh took all\n"
    .string "the country of Argob unto the coasts\l"
    .string "of Geshuri and Maachathi; and\l"
    .string "called them after his own name,\l"
    .string "Bashanhavothjair, unto this day.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_15::
    .string "And I gave Gilead unto Machir.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_16::
    .string "And unto the Reubenites and unto the\n"
    .string "Gadites I gave from Gilead even unto\l"
    .string "the river Arnon half the valley,\l"
    .string "and the border even unto the river\l"
    .string "Jabbok, which is the border of the\l"
    .string "children of Ammon;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_17::
    .string "The plain also, and Jordan, and\n"
    .string "the coast thereof, from Chinnereth\l"
    .string "even unto the sea of the plain, even\l"
    .string "the salt sea, under Ashdothpisgah\l"
    .string "eastward$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_18::
    .string "And I commanded you at that time,\n"
    .string "saying, The LORD your God hath given\l"
    .string "you this land to possess it: ye\l"
    .string "shall pass over armed before your\l"
    .string "brethren the children of Israel,\l"
    .string "all that are meet for the war.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_19::
    .string "But your wives, and your little\n"
    .string "ones, and your cattle, (for I know\l"
    .string "that ye have much cattle,) shall\l"
    .string "abide in your cities which I have\l"
    .string "given you;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_20::
    .string "Until the LORD have given rest unto\n"
    .string "your brethren, as well as unto you,\l"
    .string "and until they also possess the\l"
    .string "land which the LORD your God hath\l"
    .string "given them beyond Jordan: and then\l"
    .string "shall ye return every man unto his\l"
    .string "possession, which I have given you$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_21::
    .string "And I commanded Joshua at that time,\n"
    .string "saying, Thine eyes have seen all\l"
    .string "that the LORD your God hath done unto\l"
    .string "these two kings: so shall the LORD\l"
    .string "do unto all the kingdoms whither\l"
    .string "thou passest.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_22::
    .string "Ye shall not fear them: for the\n"
    .string "LORD your God he shall fight for you.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_23::
    .string "And I besought the LORD at that\n"
    .string "time, saying,"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_24::
    .string "O Lord GOD, thou hast begun to shew\n"
    .string "thy servant thy greatness, and thy\l"
    .string "mighty hand: for what God is there in\l"
    .string "heaven or in earth, that can do\l"
    .string "according to thy works, and according\l"
    .string "to thy might?"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_25::
    .string "I pray thee, let me go over, and\n"
    .string "see the good land that is beyond\l"
    .string "Jordan, that goodly mountain, and\l"
    .string "Lebanon$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_26::
    .string "But the LORD was wroth with me for\n"
    .string "your sakes, and would not hear me:\l"
    .string "and the LORD said unto me, Let it\l"
    .string "suffice thee; speak no more unto me\l"
    .string "of this matter.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_27::
    .string "Get thee up into the top of Pisgah,\n"
    .string "and lift up thine eyes westward, and\l"
    .string "northward, and southward, and\l"
    .string "eastward, and behold it with thine\l"
    .string "eyes: for thou shalt not go over this\l"
    .string "Jordan.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_28::
    .string "But charge Joshua, and encourage\n"
    .string "him, and strengthen him: for he\l"
    .string "shall go over before this people,\l"
    .string "and he shall cause them to inherit\l"
    .string "the land which thou shalt see.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_3_29::
    .string "So we abode in the valley over\n"
    .string "against Bethpeor.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_1::
    .string "Now therefore hearken, O Israel,\n"
    .string "unto the statutes and unto the\l"
    .string "judgments, which I teach you, for to\l"
    .string "do them, that ye may live, and go in\l"
    .string "and possess the land which the LORD\l"
    .string "God of your fathers giveth you.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_2::
    .string "Ye shall not add unto the word\n"
    .string "which I command you, neither shall\l"
    .string "ye diminish ought from it, that ye\l"
    .string "may keep the commandments of the\l"
    .string "LORD your God which I command you.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_3::
    .string "Your eyes have seen what the LORD\n"
    .string "did because of Baalpeor: for all\l"
    .string "the men that followed Baalpeor,\l"
    .string "the LORD thy God hath destroyed them\l"
    .string "from among you.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_4::
    .string "But ye that did cleave unto the\n"
    .string "LORD your God are alive every one of\l"
    .string "you this day.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_5::
    .string "Behold, I have taught you statutes\n"
    .string "and judgments, even as the LORD my\l"
    .string "God commanded me, that ye should do\l"
    .string "so in the land whither ye go to\l"
    .string "possess it.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_6::
    .string "Keep therefore and do them; for\n"
    .string "this is your wisdom and your\l"
    .string "understanding in the sight of the\l"
    .string "nations, which shall hear all\l"
    .string "these statutes, and say, Surely this\l"
    .string "great nation is a wise and\l"
    .string "understanding people.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_7::
    .string "For what nation is there so great,\n"
    .string "who hath God so nigh unto them, as the\l"
    .string "LORD our God is in all things that\l"
    .string "we call upon him for?"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_8::
    .string "And what nation is there so great,\n"
    .string "that hath statutes and judgments so\l"
    .string "righteous as all this law, which I\l"
    .string "set before you this day?"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_9::
    .string "Only take heed to thyself, and\n"
    .string "keep thy soul diligently, lest\l"
    .string "thou forget the things which thine\l"
    .string "eyes have seen, and lest they depart\l"
    .string "from thy heart all the days of thy\l"
    .string "life: but teach them thy sons, and\l"
    .string "thy sons’ sons;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_10::
    .string "Specially the day that thou\n"
    .string "stoodest before the LORD thy God in\l"
    .string "Horeb, when the LORD said unto me,\l"
    .string "Gather me the people together, and\l"
    .string "I will make them hear my words, that\l"
    .string "they may learn to fear me all the\l"
    .string "days that they shall live upon the\l"
    .string "earth, and that they may teach their\l"
    .string "children$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_11::
    .string "And ye came near and stood under the\n"
    .string "mountain; and the mountain burned\l"
    .string "with fire unto the midst of heaven,\l"
    .string "with darkness, clouds, and thick\l"
    .string "darkness.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_12::
    .string "And the LORD spake unto you out of\n"
    .string "the midst of the fire: ye heard the\l"
    .string "voice of the words, but saw no\l"
    .string "similitude; only ye heard a voice.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_13::
    .string "And he declared unto you his\n"
    .string "covenant, which he commanded you to\l"
    .string "perform, even ten commandments; and\l"
    .string "he wrote them upon two tables of\l"
    .string "stone.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_14::
    .string "And the LORD commanded me at that\n"
    .string "time to teach you statutes and\l"
    .string "judgments, that ye might do them in\l"
    .string "the land whither ye go over to\l"
    .string "possess it.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_15::
    .string "Take ye therefore good heed unto\n"
    .string "yourselves; for ye saw no manner of\l"
    .string "similitude on the day that the LORD\l"
    .string "spake unto you in Horeb out of the\l"
    .string "midst of the fire:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_16::
    .string "Lest ye corrupt yourselves, and\n"
    .string "make you a graven image, the\l"
    .string "similitude of any figure, the\l"
    .string "likeness of male or female,"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_17::
    .string "The likeness of any beast that is\n"
    .string "on the earth, the likeness of any\l"
    .string "winged fowl that flieth in the air,"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_18::
    .string "The likeness of any thing that\n"
    .string "creepeth on the ground, the\l"
    .string "likeness of any fish that is in the\l"
    .string "waters beneath the earth:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_19::
    .string "And lest thou lift up thine eyes\n"
    .string "unto heaven, and when thou seest the\l"
    .string "sun, and the moon, and the stars, even\l"
    .string "all the host of heaven, shouldest\l"
    .string "be driven to worship them, and serve\l"
    .string "them, which the LORD thy God hath\l"
    .string "divided unto all nations under the\l"
    .string "whole heaven$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_20::
    .string "But the LORD hath taken you, and\n"
    .string "brought you forth out of the iron\l"
    .string "furnace, even out of Egypt, to be\l"
    .string "unto him a people of inheritance,\l"
    .string "as ye are this day.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_21::
    .string "Furthermore the LORD was angry with\n"
    .string "me for your sakes, and sware that I\l"
    .string "should not go over Jordan, and that I\l"
    .string "should not go in unto that good\l"
    .string "land, which the LORD thy God giveth\l"
    .string "thee for an inheritance:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_22::
    .string "But I must die in this land, I must\n"
    .string "not go over Jordan: but ye shall go\l"
    .string "over, and possess that good land$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_23::
    .string "Take heed unto yourselves, lest ye\n"
    .string "forget the covenant of the LORD your\l"
    .string "God, which he made with you, and make\l"
    .string "you a graven image, or the likeness\l"
    .string "of any thing, which the LORD thy God\l"
    .string "hath forbidden thee.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_24::
    .string "For the LORD thy God is a consuming\n"
    .string "fire, even a jealous God.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_25::
    .string "When thou shalt beget children,\n"
    .string "and children’s children, and ye\l"
    .string "shall have remained long in the\l"
    .string "land, and shall corrupt\l"
    .string "yourselves, and make a graven image,\l"
    .string "or the likeness of any thing, and\l"
    .string "shall do evil in the sight of the\l"
    .string "LORD thy God, to provoke him to\l"
    .string "anger:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_26::
    .string "I call heaven and earth to witness\n"
    .string "against you this day, that ye shall\l"
    .string "soon utterly perish from off the\l"
    .string "land whereunto ye go over Jordan to\l"
    .string "possess it; ye shall not prolong\l"
    .string "your days upon it, but shall\l"
    .string "utterly be destroyed$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_27::
    .string "And the LORD shall scatter you\n"
    .string "among the nations, and ye shall be\l"
    .string "left few in number among the heathen,\l"
    .string "whither the LORD shall lead you.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_28::
    .string "And there ye shall serve gods, the\n"
    .string "work of men’s hands, wood and stone,\l"
    .string "which neither see, nor hear, nor eat,\l"
    .string "nor smell.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_29::
    .string "But if from thence thou shalt seek\n"
    .string "the LORD thy God, thou shalt find\l"
    .string "him, if thou seek him with all thy\l"
    .string "heart and with all thy soul.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_30::
    .string "When thou art in tribulation, and\n"
    .string "all these things are come upon\l"
    .string "thee, even in the latter days, if\l"
    .string "thou turn to the LORD thy God, and\l"
    .string "shalt be obedient unto his voice;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_31::
    .string "(For the LORD thy God is a merciful\n"
    .string "God;) he will not forsake thee,\l"
    .string "neither destroy thee, nor forget the\l"
    .string "covenant of thy fathers which he\l"
    .string "sware unto them$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_32::
    .string "For ask now of the days that are\n"
    .string "past, which were before thee, since\l"
    .string "the day that God created man upon\l"
    .string "the earth, and ask from the one side\l"
    .string "of heaven unto the other, whether\l"
    .string "there hath been any such thing as\l"
    .string "this great thing is, or hath been\l"
    .string "heard like it?"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_33::
    .string "Did ever people hear the voice of\n"
    .string "God speaking out of the midst of the\l"
    .string "fire, as thou hast heard, and live?"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_34::
    .string "Or hath God assayed to go and take\n"
    .string "him a nation from the midst of\l"
    .string "another nation, by temptations, by\l"
    .string "signs, and by wonders, and by war, and\l"
    .string "by a mighty hand, and by a stretched\l"
    .string "out arm, and by great terrors,\l"
    .string "according to all that the LORD your\l"
    .string "God did for you in Egypt before your\l"
    .string "eyes?"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_35::
    .string "Unto thee it was shewed, that thou\n"
    .string "mightest know that the LORD he is\l"
    .string "God; there is none else beside him$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_36::
    .string "Out of heaven he made thee to hear\n"
    .string "his voice, that he might instruct\l"
    .string "thee: and upon earth he shewed thee\l"
    .string "his great fire; and thou heardest his\l"
    .string "words out of the midst of the fire.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_37::
    .string "And because he loved thy fathers,\n"
    .string "therefore he chose their seed after\l"
    .string "them, and brought thee out in his\l"
    .string "sight with his mighty power out of\l"
    .string "Egypt;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_38::
    .string "To drive out nations from before\n"
    .string "thee greater and mightier than thou\l"
    .string "art, to bring thee in, to give thee\l"
    .string "their land for an inheritance, as it\l"
    .string "is this day$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_39::
    .string "Know therefore this day, and\n"
    .string "consider it in thine heart, that the\l"
    .string "LORD he is God in heaven above, and\l"
    .string "upon the earth beneath: there is\l"
    .string "none else.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_40::
    .string "Thou shalt keep therefore his\n"
    .string "statutes, and his commandments,\l"
    .string "which I command thee this day, that\l"
    .string "it may go well with thee, and with\l"
    .string "thy children after thee, and that\l"
    .string "thou mayest prolong thy days upon\l"
    .string "the earth, which the LORD thy God\l"
    .string "giveth thee, for ever.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_41::
    .string "Then Moses severed three cities on\n"
    .string "this side Jordan toward the\l"
    .string "sunrising;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_42::
    .string "That the slayer might flee\n"
    .string "thither, which should kill his\l"
    .string "neighbour unawares, and hated him not\l"
    .string "in times past; and that fleeing unto\l"
    .string "one of these cities he might live:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_43::
    .string "Namely, Bezer in the wilderness,\n"
    .string "in the plain country, of the\l"
    .string "Reubenites; and Ramoth in Gilead, of\l"
    .string "the Gadites; and Golan in Bashan, of\l"
    .string "the Manassites$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_44::
    .string "And this is the law which Moses set\n"
    .string "before the children of Israel:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_45::
    .string "These are the testimonies, and the\n"
    .string "statutes, and the judgments, which\l"
    .string "Moses spake unto the children of\l"
    .string "Israel, after they came forth out of\l"
    .string "Egypt$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_46::
    .string "On this side Jordan, in the valley\n"
    .string "over against Bethpeor, in the land\l"
    .string "of Sihon king of the Amorites, who\l"
    .string "dwelt at Heshbon, whom Moses and the\l"
    .string "children of Israel smote, after\l"
    .string "they were come forth out of Egypt:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_47::
    .string "And they possessed his land, and\n"
    .string "the land of Og king of Bashan, two\l"
    .string "kings of the Amorites, which were on\l"
    .string "this side Jordan toward the\l"
    .string "sunrising;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_48::
    .string "From Aroer, which is by the bank of\n"
    .string "the river Arnon, even unto mount\l"
    .string "Sion, which is Hermon,"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_4_49::
    .string "And all the plain on this side\n"
    .string "Jordan eastward, even unto the sea of\l"
    .string "the plain, under the springs of\l"
    .string "Pisgah$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_1::
    .string "And Moses called all Israel, and\n"
    .string "said unto them, Hear, O Israel, the\l"
    .string "statutes and judgments which I speak\l"
    .string "in your ears this day, that ye may\l"
    .string "learn them, and keep, and do them.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_2::
    .string "The LORD our God made a covenant\n"
    .string "with us in Horeb.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_3::
    .string "The LORD made not this covenant with\n"
    .string "our fathers, but with us, even us, who\l"
    .string "are all of us here alive this day.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_4::
    .string "The LORD talked with you face to\n"
    .string "face in the mount out of the midst of\l"
    .string "the fire,"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_5::
    .string "(I stood between the LORD and you at\n"
    .string "that time, to shew you the word of the\l"
    .string "LORD: for ye were afraid by reason of\l"
    .string "the fire, and went not up into the\l"
    .string "mount;) saying,"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_6::
    .string "I am the LORD thy God, which brought\n"
    .string "thee out of the land of Egypt, from\l"
    .string "the house of bondage$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_7::
    .string "Thou shalt have none other gods\n"
    .string "before me.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_8::
    .string "Thou shalt not make thee any graven\n"
    .string "image, or any likeness of any thing\l"
    .string "that is in heaven above, or that is in\l"
    .string "the earth beneath, or that is in the\l"
    .string "waters beneath the earth:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_9::
    .string "Thou shalt not bow down thyself\n"
    .string "unto them, nor serve them: for I the\l"
    .string "LORD thy God am a jealous God,\l"
    .string "visiting the iniquity of the fathers\l"
    .string "upon the children unto the third\l"
    .string "and fourth generation of them that\l"
    .string "hate me,"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_10::
    .string "And shewing mercy unto thousands of\n"
    .string "them that love me and keep my\l"
    .string "commandments$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_11::
    .string "Thou shalt not take the name of the\n"
    .string "LORD thy God in vain: for the LORD\l"
    .string "will not hold him guiltless that\l"
    .string "taketh his name in vain.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_12::
    .string "Keep the sabbath day to sanctify\n"
    .string "it, as the LORD thy God hath\l"
    .string "commanded thee.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_13::
    .string "Six days thou shalt labour, and do\n"
    .string "all thy work:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_14::
    .string "But the seventh day is the sabbath\n"
    .string "of the LORD thy God: in it thou shalt\l"
    .string "not do any work, thou, nor thy son,\l"
    .string "nor thy daughter, nor thy manservant,\l"
    .string "nor thy maidservant, nor thine ox,\l"
    .string "nor thine ass, nor any of thy cattle,\l"
    .string "nor thy stranger that is within thy\l"
    .string "gates; that thy manservant and thy\l"
    .string "maidservant may rest as well as thou$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_15::
    .string "And remember that thou wast a\n"
    .string "servant in the land of Egypt, and\l"
    .string "that the LORD thy God brought thee\l"
    .string "out thence through a mighty hand and\l"
    .string "by a stretched out arm: therefore the\l"
    .string "LORD thy God commanded thee to keep\l"
    .string "the sabbath day.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_16::
    .string "Honour thy father and thy mother, as\n"
    .string "the LORD thy God hath commanded thee;\l"
    .string "that thy days may be prolonged, and\l"
    .string "that it may go well with thee, in\l"
    .string "the land which the LORD thy God\l"
    .string "giveth thee.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_17::
    .string "Thou shalt not kill.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_18::
    .string "Neither shalt thou commit adultery.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_19::
    .string "Neither shalt thou steal.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_20::
    .string "Neither shalt thou bear false\n"
    .string "witness against thy neighbour.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_21::
    .string "Neither shalt thou desire thy\n"
    .string "neighbour’s wife, neither shalt thou\l"
    .string "covet thy neighbour’s house, his\l"
    .string "field, or his manservant, or his\l"
    .string "maidservant, his ox, or his ass, or\l"
    .string "any thing that is thy neighbour’s.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_22::
    .string "These words the LORD spake unto\n"
    .string "all your assembly in the mount out\l"
    .string "of the midst of the fire, of the\l"
    .string "cloud, and of the thick darkness,\l"
    .string "with a great voice: and he added no\l"
    .string "more. And he wrote them in two tables\l"
    .string "of stone, and delivered them unto me.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_23::
    .string "And it came to pass, when ye heard\n"
    .string "the voice out of the midst of the\l"
    .string "darkness, (for the mountain did burn\l"
    .string "with fire,) that ye came near unto\l"
    .string "me, even all the heads of your\l"
    .string "tribes, and your elders;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_24::
    .string "And ye said, Behold, the LORD our\n"
    .string "God hath shewed us his glory and his\l"
    .string "greatness, and we have heard his\l"
    .string "voice out of the midst of the fire: we\l"
    .string "have seen this day that God doth\l"
    .string "talk with man, and he liveth$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_25::
    .string "Now therefore why should we die?\n"
    .string "for this great fire will consume us:\l"
    .string "if we hear the voice of the LORD our\l"
    .string "God any more, then we shall die.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_26::
    .string "For who is there of all flesh,\n"
    .string "that hath heard the voice of the\l"
    .string "living God speaking out of the midst\l"
    .string "of the fire, as we have, and lived?"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_27::
    .string "Go thou near, and hear all that the\n"
    .string "LORD our God shall say: and speak\l"
    .string "thou unto us all that the LORD our\l"
    .string "God shall speak unto thee; and we\l"
    .string "will hear it, and do it$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_28::
    .string "And the LORD heard the voice of your\n"
    .string "words, when ye spake unto me; and the\l"
    .string "LORD said unto me, I have heard the\l"
    .string "voice of the words of this people,\l"
    .string "which they have spoken unto thee:\l"
    .string "they have well said all that they\l"
    .string "have spoken.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_29::
    .string "O that there were such an heart in\n"
    .string "them, that they would fear me, and\l"
    .string "keep all my commandments always,\l"
    .string "that it might be well with them, and\l"
    .string "with their children for ever!"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_30::
    .string "Go say to them, Get you into your\n"
    .string "tents again$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_31::
    .string "But as for thee, stand thou here by\n"
    .string "me, and I will speak unto thee all\l"
    .string "the commandments, and the statutes,\l"
    .string "and the judgments, which thou shalt\l"
    .string "teach them, that they may do them in\l"
    .string "the land which I give them to\l"
    .string "possess it.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_32::
    .string "Ye shall observe to do therefore\n"
    .string "as the LORD your God hath commanded\l"
    .string "you: ye shall not turn aside to the\l"
    .string "right hand or to the left.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_5_33::
    .string "Ye shall walk in all the ways\n"
    .string "which the LORD your God hath\l"
    .string "commanded you, that ye may live, and\l"
    .string "that it may be well with you, and\l"
    .string "that ye may prolong your days in the\l"
    .string "land which ye shall possess.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_6_1::
    .string "Now these are the commandments, the\n"
    .string "statutes, and the judgments, which\l"
    .string "the LORD your God commanded to teach\l"
    .string "you, that ye might do them in the\l"
    .string "land whither ye go to possess it:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_6_2::
    .string "That thou mightest fear the LORD thy\n"
    .string "God, to keep all his statutes and\l"
    .string "his commandments, which I command\l"
    .string "thee, thou, and thy son, and thy son’s\l"
    .string "son, all the days of thy life; and\l"
    .string "that thy days may be prolonged$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_6_3::
    .string "Hear therefore, O Israel, and\n"
    .string "observe to do it; that it may be\l"
    .string "well with thee, and that ye may\l"
    .string "increase mightily, as the LORD God\l"
    .string "of thy fathers hath promised thee,\l"
    .string "in the land that floweth with milk\l"
    .string "and honey.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_6_4::
    .string "Hear, O Israel: The LORD our God is\n"
    .string "one LORD:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_6_5::
    .string "And thou shalt love the LORD thy\n"
    .string "God with all thine heart, and with\l"
    .string "all thy soul, and with all thy\l"
    .string "might$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_6_6::
    .string "And these words, which I command\n"
    .string "thee this day, shall be in thine\l"
    .string "heart:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_6_7::
    .string "And thou shalt teach them\n"
    .string "diligently unto thy children, and\l"
    .string "shalt talk of them when thou\l"
    .string "sittest in thine house, and when thou\l"
    .string "walkest by the way, and when thou\l"
    .string "liest down, and when thou risest up$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_6_8::
    .string "And thou shalt bind them for a sign\n"
    .string "upon thine hand, and they shall be\l"
    .string "as frontlets between thine eyes.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_6_9::
    .string "And thou shalt write them upon the\n"
    .string "posts of thy house, and on thy gates.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_6_10::
    .string "And it shall be, when the LORD thy\n"
    .string "God shall have brought thee into\l"
    .string "the land which he sware unto thy\l"
    .string "fathers, to Abraham, to Isaac, and to\l"
    .string "Jacob, to give thee great and goodly\l"
    .string "cities, which thou buildedst not,"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_6_11::
    .string "And houses full of all good\n"
    .string "things, which thou filledst not,\l"
    .string "and wells digged, which thou\l"
    .string "diggedst not, vineyards and olive\l"
    .string "trees, which thou plantedst not;\l"
    .string "when thou shalt have eaten and be\l"
    .string "full;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_6_12::
    .string "Then beware lest thou forget the\n"
    .string "LORD, which brought thee forth out of\l"
    .string "the land of Egypt, from the house of\l"
    .string "bondage$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_6_13::
    .string "Thou shalt fear the LORD thy God,\n"
    .string "and serve him, and shalt swear by his\l"
    .string "name.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_6_14::
    .string "Ye shall not go after other gods,\n"
    .string "of the gods of the people which are\l"
    .string "round about you;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_6_15::
    .string "(For the LORD thy God is a jealous\n"
    .string "God among you) lest the anger of the\l"
    .string "LORD thy God be kindled against\l"
    .string "thee, and destroy thee from off the\l"
    .string "face of the earth$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_6_16::
    .string "Ye shall not tempt the LORD your\n"
    .string "God, as ye tempted him in Massah.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_6_17::
    .string "Ye shall diligently keep the\n"
    .string "commandments of the LORD your God,\l"
    .string "and his testimonies, and his\l"
    .string "statutes, which he hath commanded\l"
    .string "thee.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_6_18::
    .string "And thou shalt do that which is\n"
    .string "right and good in the sight of the\l"
    .string "LORD: that it may be well with thee,\l"
    .string "and that thou mayest go in and\l"
    .string "possess the good land which the LORD\l"
    .string "sware unto thy fathers.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_6_19::
    .string "To cast out all thine enemies from\n"
    .string "before thee, as the LORD hath spoken.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_6_20::
    .string "And when thy son asketh thee in time\n"
    .string "to come, saying, What mean the\l"
    .string "testimonies, and the statutes, and\l"
    .string "the judgments, which the LORD our God\l"
    .string "hath commanded you?"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_6_21::
    .string "Then thou shalt say unto thy son, We\n"
    .string "were Pharaoh’s bondmen in Egypt; and\l"
    .string "the LORD brought us out of Egypt\l"
    .string "with a mighty hand:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_6_22::
    .string "And the LORD shewed signs and\n"
    .string "wonders, great and sore, upon Egypt,\l"
    .string "upon Pharaoh, and upon all his\l"
    .string "household, before our eyes:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_6_23::
    .string "And he brought us out from thence,\n"
    .string "that he might bring us in, to give us\l"
    .string "the land which he sware unto our\l"
    .string "fathers$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_6_24::
    .string "And the LORD commanded us to do all\n"
    .string "these statutes, to fear the LORD our\l"
    .string "God, for our good always, that he\l"
    .string "might preserve us alive, as it is at\l"
    .string "this day.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_6_25::
    .string "And it shall be our righteousness,\n"
    .string "if we observe to do all these\l"
    .string "commandments before the LORD our God,\l"
    .string "as he hath commanded us.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_7_1::
    .string "When the LORD thy God shall bring\n"
    .string "thee into the land whither thou\l"
    .string "goest to possess it, and hath cast\l"
    .string "out many nations before thee, the\l"
    .string "Hittites, and the Girgashites, and\l"
    .string "the Amorites, and the Canaanites, and\l"
    .string "the Perizzites, and the Hivites, and\l"
    .string "the Jebusites, seven nations greater\l"
    .string "and mightier than thou;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_7_2::
    .string "And when the LORD thy God shall\n"
    .string "deliver them before thee; thou\l"
    .string "shalt smite them, and utterly\l"
    .string "destroy them; thou shalt make no\l"
    .string "covenant with them, nor shew mercy\l"
    .string "unto them:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_7_3::
    .string "Neither shalt thou make marriages\n"
    .string "with them; thy daughter thou shalt\l"
    .string "not give unto his son, nor his\l"
    .string "daughter shalt thou take unto thy son$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_7_4::
    .string "For they will turn away thy son\n"
    .string "from following me, that they may\l"
    .string "serve other gods: so will the anger\l"
    .string "of the LORD be kindled against you,\l"
    .string "and destroy thee suddenly.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_7_5::
    .string "But thus shall ye deal with them;\n"
    .string "ye shall destroy their altars, and\l"
    .string "break down their images, and cut down\l"
    .string "their groves, and burn their graven\l"
    .string "images with fire.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_7_6::
    .string "For thou art an holy people unto\n"
    .string "the LORD thy God: the LORD thy God\l"
    .string "hath chosen thee to be a special\l"
    .string "people unto himself, above all\l"
    .string "people that are upon the face of\l"
    .string "the earth.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_7_7::
    .string "The LORD did not set his love upon\n"
    .string "you, nor choose you, because ye were\l"
    .string "more in number than any people; for\l"
    .string "ye were the fewest of all people:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_7_8::
    .string "But because the LORD loved you, and\n"
    .string "because he would keep the oath\l"
    .string "which he had sworn unto your fathers,\l"
    .string "hath the LORD brought you out with a\l"
    .string "mighty hand, and redeemed you out of\l"
    .string "the house of bondmen, from the hand\l"
    .string "of Pharaoh king of Egypt$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_7_9::
    .string "Know therefore that the LORD thy\n"
    .string "God, he is God, the faithful God,\l"
    .string "which keepeth covenant and mercy\l"
    .string "with them that love him and keep his\l"
    .string "commandments to a thousand\l"
    .string "generations;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_7_10::
    .string "And repayeth them that hate him to\n"
    .string "their face, to destroy them: he will\l"
    .string "not be slack to him that hateth him,\l"
    .string "he will repay him to his face$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_7_11::
    .string "Thou shalt therefore keep the\n"
    .string "commandments, and the statutes, and\l"
    .string "the judgments, which I command thee\l"
    .string "this day, to do them.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_7_12::
    .string "Wherefore it shall come to pass,\n"
    .string "if ye hearken to these judgments, and\l"
    .string "keep, and do them, that the LORD thy\l"
    .string "God shall keep unto thee the\l"
    .string "covenant and the mercy which he sware\l"
    .string "unto thy fathers:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_7_13::
    .string "And he will love thee, and bless\n"
    .string "thee, and multiply thee: he will\l"
    .string "also bless the fruit of thy womb,\l"
    .string "and the fruit of thy land, thy corn,\l"
    .string "and thy wine, and thine oil, the\l"
    .string "increase of thy kine, and the flocks\l"
    .string "of thy sheep, in the land which he\l"
    .string "sware unto thy fathers to give thee$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_7_14::
    .string "Thou shalt be blessed above all\n"
    .string "people: there shall not be male or\l"
    .string "female barren among you, or among\l"
    .string "your cattle.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_7_15::
    .string "And the LORD will take away from\n"
    .string "thee all sickness, and will put\l"
    .string "none of the evil diseases of Egypt,\l"
    .string "which thou knowest, upon thee; but\l"
    .string "will lay them upon all them that\l"
    .string "hate thee.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_7_16::
    .string "And thou shalt consume all the\n"
    .string "people which the LORD thy God\l"
    .string "shall deliver thee; thine eye\l"
    .string "shall have no pity upon them:\l"
    .string "neither shalt thou serve their gods;\l"
    .string "for that will be a snare unto thee.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_7_17::
    .string "If thou shalt say in thine heart,\n"
    .string "These nations are more than I; how\l"
    .string "can I dispossess them?"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_7_18::
    .string "Thou shalt not be afraid of them:\n"
    .string "but shalt well remember what the\l"
    .string "LORD thy God did unto Pharaoh, and\l"
    .string "unto all Egypt;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_7_19::
    .string "The great temptations which thine\n"
    .string "eyes saw, and the signs, and the\l"
    .string "wonders, and the mighty hand, and the\l"
    .string "stretched out arm, whereby the LORD\l"
    .string "thy God brought thee out: so shall\l"
    .string "the LORD thy God do unto all the\l"
    .string "people of whom thou art afraid$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_7_20::
    .string "Moreover the LORD thy God will\n"
    .string "send the hornet among them, until\l"
    .string "they that are left, and hide\l"
    .string "themselves from thee, be destroyed.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_7_21::
    .string "Thou shalt not be affrighted at\n"
    .string "them: for the LORD thy God is among\l"
    .string "you, a mighty God and terrible.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_7_22::
    .string "And the LORD thy God will put out\n"
    .string "those nations before thee by little\l"
    .string "and little: thou mayest not consume\l"
    .string "them at once, lest the beasts of the\l"
    .string "field increase upon thee.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_7_23::
    .string "But the LORD thy God shall deliver\n"
    .string "them unto thee, and shall destroy\l"
    .string "them with a mighty destruction,\l"
    .string "until they be destroyed.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_7_24::
    .string "And he shall deliver their kings\n"
    .string "into thine hand, and thou shalt\l"
    .string "destroy their name from under heaven:\l"
    .string "there shall no man be able to stand\l"
    .string "before thee, until thou have\l"
    .string "destroyed them.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_7_25::
    .string "The graven images of their gods\n"
    .string "shall ye burn with fire: thou shalt\l"
    .string "not desire the silver or gold that\l"
    .string "is on them, nor take it unto thee,\l"
    .string "lest thou be snared therein: for it\l"
    .string "is an abomination to the LORD thy God.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_7_26::
    .string "Neither shalt thou bring an\n"
    .string "abomination into thine house, lest\l"
    .string "thou be a cursed thing like it: but\l"
    .string "thou shalt utterly detest it, and\l"
    .string "thou shalt utterly abhor it; for it\l"
    .string "is a cursed thing.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_8_1::
    .string "All the commandments which I\n"
    .string "command thee this day shall ye\l"
    .string "observe to do, that ye may live, and\l"
    .string "multiply, and go in and possess\l"
    .string "the land which the LORD sware unto\l"
    .string "your fathers.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_8_2::
    .string "And thou shalt remember all the\n"
    .string "way which the LORD thy God led thee\l"
    .string "these forty years in the wilderness,\l"
    .string "to humble thee, and to prove thee,\l"
    .string "to know what was in thine heart,\l"
    .string "whether thou wouldest keep his\l"
    .string "commandments, or no.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_8_3::
    .string "And he humbled thee, and suffered\n"
    .string "thee to hunger, and fed thee with\l"
    .string "manna, which thou knewest not,\l"
    .string "neither did thy fathers know; that he\l"
    .string "might make thee know that man doth\l"
    .string "not live by bread only, but by every\l"
    .string "word that proceedeth out of the\l"
    .string "mouth of the LORD doth man live.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_8_4::
    .string "Thy raiment waxed not old upon\n"
    .string "thee, neither did thy foot swell,\l"
    .string "these forty years.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_8_5::
    .string "Thou shalt also consider in thine\n"
    .string "heart, that, as a man chasteneth his\l"
    .string "son, so the LORD thy God chasteneth\l"
    .string "thee.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_8_6::
    .string "Therefore thou shalt keep the\n"
    .string "commandments of the LORD thy God, to\l"
    .string "walk in his ways, and to fear him.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_8_7::
    .string "For the LORD thy God bringeth thee\n"
    .string "into a good land, a land of brooks\l"
    .string "of water, of fountains and depths\l"
    .string "that spring out of valleys and\l"
    .string "hills;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_8_8::
    .string "A land of wheat, and barley, and\n"
    .string "vines, and fig trees, and\l"
    .string "pomegranates; a land of oil olive,\l"
    .string "and honey;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_8_9::
    .string "A land wherein thou shalt eat\n"
    .string "bread without scarceness, thou shalt\l"
    .string "not lack any thing in it; a land\l"
    .string "whose stones are iron, and out of\l"
    .string "whose hills thou mayest dig brass$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_8_10::
    .string "When thou hast eaten and art full,\n"
    .string "then thou shalt bless the LORD thy\l"
    .string "God for the good land which he hath\l"
    .string "given thee.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_8_11::
    .string "Beware that thou forget not the LORD\n"
    .string "thy God, in not keeping his\l"
    .string "commandments, and his judgments, and\l"
    .string "his statutes, which I command thee\l"
    .string "this day:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_8_12::
    .string "Lest when thou hast eaten and art\n"
    .string "full, and hast built goodly\l"
    .string "houses, and dwelt therein;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_8_13::
    .string "And when thy herds and thy flocks\n"
    .string "multiply, and thy silver and thy\l"
    .string "gold is multiplied, and all that\l"
    .string "thou hast is multiplied;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_8_14::
    .string "Then thine heart be lifted up, and\n"
    .string "thou forget the LORD thy God, which\l"
    .string "brought thee forth out of the land\l"
    .string "of Egypt, from the house of bondage;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_8_15::
    .string "Who led thee through that great and\n"
    .string "terrible wilderness, wherein were\l"
    .string "fiery serpents, and scorpions, and\l"
    .string "drought, where there was no water;\l"
    .string "who brought thee forth water out of\l"
    .string "the rock of flint;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_8_16::
    .string "Who fed thee in the wilderness with\n"
    .string "manna, which thy fathers knew not,\l"
    .string "that he might humble thee, and that\l"
    .string "he might prove thee, to do thee good\l"
    .string "at thy latter end;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_8_17::
    .string "And thou say in thine heart, My\n"
    .string "power and the might of mine hand hath\l"
    .string "gotten me this wealth$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_8_18::
    .string "But thou shalt remember the LORD\n"
    .string "thy God: for it is he that giveth thee\l"
    .string "power to get wealth, that he may\l"
    .string "establish his covenant which he\l"
    .string "sware unto thy fathers, as it is this\l"
    .string "day.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_8_19::
    .string "And it shall be, if thou do at all\n"
    .string "forget the LORD thy God, and walk\l"
    .string "after other gods, and serve them, and\l"
    .string "worship them, I testify against you\l"
    .string "this day that ye shall surely\l"
    .string "perish.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_8_20::
    .string "As the nations which the LORD\n"
    .string "destroyeth before your face, so\l"
    .string "shall ye perish; because ye would\l"
    .string "not be obedient unto the voice of the\l"
    .string "LORD your God.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_1::
    .string "Hear, O Israel: Thou art to pass\n"
    .string "over Jordan this day, to go in to\l"
    .string "possess nations greater and mightier\l"
    .string "than thyself, cities great and\l"
    .string "fenced up to heaven,"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_2::
    .string "A people great and tall, the\n"
    .string "children of the Anakims, whom thou\l"
    .string "knowest, and of whom thou hast heard\l"
    .string "say, Who can stand before the\l"
    .string "children of Anak!"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_3::
    .string "Understand therefore this day, that\n"
    .string "the LORD thy God is he which goeth\l"
    .string "over before thee; as a consuming fire\l"
    .string "he shall destroy them, and he\l"
    .string "shall bring them down before thy\l"
    .string "face: so shalt thou drive them out,\l"
    .string "and destroy them quickly, as the\l"
    .string "LORD hath said unto thee$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_4::
    .string "Speak not thou in thine heart,\n"
    .string "after that the LORD thy God hath cast\l"
    .string "them out from before thee, saying,\l"
    .string "For my righteousness the LORD hath\l"
    .string "brought me in to possess this land:\l"
    .string "but for the wickedness of these\l"
    .string "nations the LORD doth drive them out\l"
    .string "from before thee.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_5::
    .string "Not for thy righteousness, or for\n"
    .string "the uprightness of thine heart, dost\l"
    .string "thou go to possess their land: but\l"
    .string "for the wickedness of these nations\l"
    .string "the LORD thy God doth drive them out\l"
    .string "from before thee, and that he may\l"
    .string "perform the word which the LORD sware\l"
    .string "unto thy fathers, Abraham, Isaac, and\l"
    .string "Jacob.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_6::
    .string "Understand therefore, that the LORD\n"
    .string "thy God giveth thee not this good\l"
    .string "land to possess it for thy\l"
    .string "righteousness; for thou art a\l"
    .string "stiffnecked people.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_7::
    .string "Remember, and forget not, how thou\n"
    .string "provokedst the LORD thy God to wrath\l"
    .string "in the wilderness: from the day that\l"
    .string "thou didst depart out of the land of\l"
    .string "Egypt, until ye came unto this\l"
    .string "place, ye have been rebellious\l"
    .string "against the LORD.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_8::
    .string "Also in Horeb ye provoked the LORD\n"
    .string "to wrath, so that the LORD was angry\l"
    .string "with you to have destroyed you.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_9::
    .string "When I was gone up into the mount to\n"
    .string "receive the tables of stone, even\l"
    .string "the tables of the covenant which the\l"
    .string "LORD made with you, then I abode in\l"
    .string "the mount forty days and forty\l"
    .string "nights, I neither did eat bread nor\l"
    .string "drink water:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_10::
    .string "And the LORD delivered unto me two\n"
    .string "tables of stone written with the\l"
    .string "finger of God; and on them was\l"
    .string "written according to all the words,\l"
    .string "which the LORD spake with you in the\l"
    .string "mount out of the midst of the fire in\l"
    .string "the day of the assembly$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_11::
    .string "And it came to pass at the end of\n"
    .string "forty days and forty nights, that the\l"
    .string "LORD gave me the two tables of stone,\l"
    .string "even the tables of the covenant.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_12::
    .string "And the LORD said unto me, Arise,\n"
    .string "get thee down quickly from hence;\l"
    .string "for thy people which thou hast\l"
    .string "brought forth out of Egypt have\l"
    .string "corrupted themselves; they are\l"
    .string "quickly turned aside out of the way\l"
    .string "which I commanded them; they have\l"
    .string "made them a molten image.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_13::
    .string "Furthermore the LORD spake unto me,\n"
    .string "saying, I have seen this people,\l"
    .string "and, behold, it is a stiffnecked\l"
    .string "people:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_14::
    .string "Let me alone, that I may destroy\n"
    .string "them, and blot out their name from\l"
    .string "under heaven: and I will make of\l"
    .string "thee a nation mightier and greater\l"
    .string "than they$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_15::
    .string "So I turned and came down from the\n"
    .string "mount, and the mount burned with\l"
    .string "fire: and the two tables of the\l"
    .string "covenant were in my two hands.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_16::
    .string "And I looked, and, behold, ye had\n"
    .string "sinned against the LORD your God, and\l"
    .string "had made you a molten calf: ye had\l"
    .string "turned aside quickly out of the way\l"
    .string "which the LORD had commanded you.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_17::
    .string "And I took the two tables, and cast\n"
    .string "them out of my two hands, and brake\l"
    .string "them before your eyes.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_18::
    .string "And I fell down before the LORD, as\n"
    .string "at the first, forty days and forty\l"
    .string "nights: I did neither eat bread, nor\l"
    .string "drink water, because of all your\l"
    .string "sins which ye sinned, in doing\l"
    .string "wickedly in the sight of the LORD, to\l"
    .string "provoke him to anger.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_19::
    .string "For I was afraid of the anger and\n"
    .string "hot displeasure, wherewith the LORD\l"
    .string "was wroth against you to destroy you.\l"
    .string "But the LORD hearkened unto me at\l"
    .string "that time also.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_20::
    .string "And the LORD was very angry with\n"
    .string "Aaron to have destroyed him: and I\l"
    .string "prayed for Aaron also the same time.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_21::
    .string "And I took your sin, the calf which\n"
    .string "ye had made, and burnt it with fire,\l"
    .string "and stamped it, and ground it very\l"
    .string "small, even until it was as small\l"
    .string "as dust: and I cast the dust thereof\l"
    .string "into the brook that descended out of\l"
    .string "the mount.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_22::
    .string "And at Taberah, and at Massah, and\n"
    .string "at Kibrothhattaavah, ye provoked the\l"
    .string "LORD to wrath.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_23::
    .string "Likewise when the LORD sent you from\n"
    .string "Kadeshbarnea, saying, Go up and\l"
    .string "possess the land which I have given\l"
    .string "you; then ye rebelled against the\l"
    .string "commandment of the LORD your God, and\l"
    .string "ye believed him not, nor hearkened\l"
    .string "to his voice.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_24::
    .string "Ye have been rebellious against\n"
    .string "the LORD from the day that I knew you.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_25::
    .string "Thus I fell down before the LORD\n"
    .string "forty days and forty nights, as I\l"
    .string "fell down at the first; because the\l"
    .string "LORD had said he would destroy you.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_26::
    .string "I prayed therefore unto the LORD,\n"
    .string "and said, O Lord GOD, destroy not thy\l"
    .string "people and thine inheritance, which\l"
    .string "thou hast redeemed through thy\l"
    .string "greatness, which thou hast brought\l"
    .string "forth out of Egypt with a mighty\l"
    .string "hand.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_27::
    .string "Remember thy servants, Abraham,\n"
    .string "Isaac, and Jacob; look not unto the\l"
    .string "stubbornness of this people, nor to\l"
    .string "their wickedness, nor to their sin:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_28::
    .string "Lest the land whence thou\n"
    .string "broughtest us out say, Because the\l"
    .string "LORD was not able to bring them into\l"
    .string "the land which he promised them, and\l"
    .string "because he hated them, he hath\l"
    .string "brought them out to slay them in the\l"
    .string "wilderness$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_9_29::
    .string "Yet they are thy people and thine\n"
    .string "inheritance, which thou broughtest\l"
    .string "out by thy mighty power and by thy\l"
    .string "stretched out arm.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_10_1::
    .string "At that time the LORD said unto me,\n"
    .string "Hew thee two tables of stone like\l"
    .string "unto the first, and come up unto me\l"
    .string "into the mount, and make thee an ark\l"
    .string "of wood.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_10_2::
    .string "And I will write on the tables the\n"
    .string "words that were in the first tables\l"
    .string "which thou brakest, and thou shalt\l"
    .string "put them in the ark.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_10_3::
    .string "And I made an ark of shittim wood,\n"
    .string "and hewed two tables of stone like\l"
    .string "unto the first, and went up into the\l"
    .string "mount, having the two tables in mine\l"
    .string "hand.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_10_4::
    .string "And he wrote on the tables,\n"
    .string "according to the first writing, the\l"
    .string "ten commandments, which the LORD\l"
    .string "spake unto you in the mount out of\l"
    .string "the midst of the fire in the day of\l"
    .string "the assembly: and the LORD gave them\l"
    .string "unto me.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_10_5::
    .string "And I turned myself and came down\n"
    .string "from the mount, and put the tables\l"
    .string "in the ark which I had made; and there\l"
    .string "they be, as the LORD commanded me.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_10_6::
    .string "And the children of Israel took\n"
    .string "their journey from Beeroth of the\l"
    .string "children of Jaakan to Mosera: there\l"
    .string "Aaron died, and there he was buried;\l"
    .string "and Eleazar his son ministered in\l"
    .string "the priest’s office in his stead.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_10_7::
    .string "From thence they journeyed unto\n"
    .string "Gudgodah; and from Gudgodah to\l"
    .string "Jotbath, a land of rivers of waters.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_10_8::
    .string "At that time the LORD separated the\n"
    .string "tribe of Levi, to bear the ark of the\l"
    .string "covenant of the LORD, to stand before\l"
    .string "the LORD to minister unto him, and to\l"
    .string "bless in his name, unto this day.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_10_9::
    .string "Wherefore Levi hath no part nor\n"
    .string "inheritance with his brethren; the\l"
    .string "LORD is his inheritance, according as\l"
    .string "the LORD thy God promised him.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_10_10::
    .string "And I stayed in the mount, according\n"
    .string "to the first time, forty days and\l"
    .string "forty nights; and the LORD hearkened\l"
    .string "unto me at that time also, and the\l"
    .string "LORD would not destroy thee.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_10_11::
    .string "And the LORD said unto me, Arise,\n"
    .string "take thy journey before the people,\l"
    .string "that they may go in and possess the\l"
    .string "land, which I sware unto their\l"
    .string "fathers to give unto them.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_10_12::
    .string "And now, Israel, what doth the LORD\n"
    .string "thy God require of thee, but to fear\l"
    .string "the LORD thy God, to walk in all his\l"
    .string "ways, and to love him, and to serve\l"
    .string "the LORD thy God with all thy heart\l"
    .string "and with all thy soul,"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_10_13::
    .string "To keep the commandments of the\n"
    .string "LORD, and his statutes, which I\l"
    .string "command thee this day for thy good?"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_10_14::
    .string "Behold, the heaven and the heaven\n"
    .string "of heavens is the LORD’s thy God, the\l"
    .string "earth also, with all that therein is$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_10_15::
    .string "Only the LORD had a delight in thy\n"
    .string "fathers to love them, and he chose\l"
    .string "their seed after them, even you above\l"
    .string "all people, as it is this day.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_10_16::
    .string "Circumcise therefore the foreskin\n"
    .string "of your heart, and be no more\l"
    .string "stiffnecked.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_10_17::
    .string "For the LORD your God is God of gods,\n"
    .string "and Lord of lords, a great God, a\l"
    .string "mighty, and a terrible, which\l"
    .string "regardeth not persons, nor taketh\l"
    .string "reward:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_10_18::
    .string "He doth execute the judgment of the\n"
    .string "fatherless and widow, and loveth\l"
    .string "the stranger, in giving him food and\l"
    .string "raiment$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_10_19::
    .string "Love ye therefore the stranger: for\n"
    .string "ye were strangers in the land of\l"
    .string "Egypt.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_10_20::
    .string "Thou shalt fear the LORD thy God;\n"
    .string "him shalt thou serve, and to him\l"
    .string "shalt thou cleave, and swear by his\l"
    .string "name.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_10_21::
    .string "He is thy praise, and he is thy God,\n"
    .string "that hath done for thee these great\l"
    .string "and terrible things, which thine\l"
    .string "eyes have seen.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_10_22::
    .string "Thy fathers went down into Egypt\n"
    .string "with threescore and ten persons; and\l"
    .string "now the LORD thy God hath made thee\l"
    .string "as the stars of heaven for multitude.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_1::
    .string "Therefore thou shalt love the LORD\n"
    .string "thy God, and keep his charge, and his\l"
    .string "statutes, and his judgments, and his\l"
    .string "commandments, alway.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_2::
    .string "And know ye this day: for I speak\n"
    .string "not with your children which have\l"
    .string "not known, and which have not seen\l"
    .string "the chastisement of the LORD your\l"
    .string "God, his greatness, his mighty hand,\l"
    .string "and his stretched out arm,"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_3::
    .string "And his miracles, and his acts,\n"
    .string "which he did in the midst of Egypt\l"
    .string "unto Pharaoh the king of Egypt, and\l"
    .string "unto all his land;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_4::
    .string "And what he did unto the army of\n"
    .string "Egypt, unto their horses, and to\l"
    .string "their chariots; how he made the water\l"
    .string "of the Red sea to overflow them as\l"
    .string "they pursued after you, and how the\l"
    .string "LORD hath destroyed them unto this\l"
    .string "day;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_5::
    .string "And what he did unto you in the\n"
    .string "wilderness, until ye came into this\l"
    .string "place;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_6::
    .string "And what he did unto Dathan and\n"
    .string "Abiram, the sons of Eliab, the son of\l"
    .string "Reuben: how the earth opened her\l"
    .string "mouth, and swallowed them up, and\l"
    .string "their households, and their tents,\l"
    .string "and all the substance that was in\l"
    .string "their possession, in the midst of\l"
    .string "all Israel:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_7::
    .string "But your eyes have seen all the\n"
    .string "great acts of the LORD which he did$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_8::
    .string "Therefore shall ye keep all the\n"
    .string "commandments which I command you\l"
    .string "this day, that ye may be strong, and\l"
    .string "go in and possess the land, whither\l"
    .string "ye go to possess it;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_9::
    .string "And that ye may prolong your days\n"
    .string "in the land, which the LORD sware\l"
    .string "unto your fathers to give unto them\l"
    .string "and to their seed, a land that\l"
    .string "floweth with milk and honey$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_10::
    .string "For the land, whither thou goest in\n"
    .string "to possess it, is not as the land of\l"
    .string "Egypt, from whence ye came out,\l"
    .string "where thou sowedst thy seed, and\l"
    .string "wateredst it with thy foot, as a\l"
    .string "garden of herbs:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_11::
    .string "But the land, whither ye go to\n"
    .string "possess it, is a land of hills and\l"
    .string "valleys, and drinketh water of the\l"
    .string "rain of heaven:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_12::
    .string "A land which the LORD thy God\n"
    .string "careth for: the eyes of the LORD thy\l"
    .string "God are always upon it, from the\l"
    .string "beginning of the year even unto the\l"
    .string "end of the year$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_13::
    .string "And it shall come to pass, if ye\n"
    .string "shall hearken diligently unto my\l"
    .string "commandments which I command you\l"
    .string "this day, to love the LORD your God,\l"
    .string "and to serve him with all your heart\l"
    .string "and with all your soul,"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_14::
    .string "That I will give you the rain of\n"
    .string "your land in his due season, the\l"
    .string "first rain and the latter rain, that\l"
    .string "thou mayest gather in thy corn, and\l"
    .string "thy wine, and thine oil$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_15::
    .string "And I will send grass in thy\n"
    .string "fields for thy cattle, that thou\l"
    .string "mayest eat and be full.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_16::
    .string "Take heed to yourselves, that your\n"
    .string "heart be not deceived, and ye turn\l"
    .string "aside, and serve other gods, and\l"
    .string "worship them;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_17::
    .string "And then the LORD’s wrath be\n"
    .string "kindled against you, and he shut up\l"
    .string "the heaven, that there be no rain,\l"
    .string "and that the land yield not her\l"
    .string "fruit; and lest ye perish quickly\l"
    .string "from off the good land which the\l"
    .string "LORD giveth you$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_18::
    .string "Therefore shall ye lay up these\n"
    .string "my words in your heart and in your\l"
    .string "soul, and bind them for a sign upon\l"
    .string "your hand, that they may be as\l"
    .string "frontlets between your eyes.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_19::
    .string "And ye shall teach them your\n"
    .string "children, speaking of them when\l"
    .string "thou sittest in thine house, and when\l"
    .string "thou walkest by the way, when thou\l"
    .string "liest down, and when thou risest up.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_20::
    .string "And thou shalt write them upon the\n"
    .string "door posts of thine house, and upon\l"
    .string "thy gates:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_21::
    .string "That your days may be multiplied,\n"
    .string "and the days of your children, in the\l"
    .string "land which the LORD sware unto your\l"
    .string "fathers to give them, as the days of\l"
    .string "heaven upon the earth$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_22::
    .string "For if ye shall diligently keep\n"
    .string "all these commandments which I\l"
    .string "command you, to do them, to love the\l"
    .string "LORD your God, to walk in all his\l"
    .string "ways, and to cleave unto him;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_23::
    .string "Then will the LORD drive out all\n"
    .string "these nations from before you, and ye\l"
    .string "shall possess greater nations and\l"
    .string "mightier than yourselves$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_24::
    .string "Every place whereon the soles of\n"
    .string "your feet shall tread shall be\l"
    .string "yours: from the wilderness and\l"
    .string "Lebanon, from the river, the river\l"
    .string "Euphrates, even unto the uttermost\l"
    .string "sea shall your coast be.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_25::
    .string "There shall no man be able to\n"
    .string "stand before you: for the LORD your\l"
    .string "God shall lay the fear of you and\l"
    .string "the dread of you upon all the land\l"
    .string "that ye shall tread upon, as he\l"
    .string "hath said unto you.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_26::
    .string "Behold, I set before you this day a\n"
    .string "blessing and a curse;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_27::
    .string "A blessing, if ye obey the\n"
    .string "commandments of the LORD your God,\l"
    .string "which I command you this day:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_28::
    .string "And a curse, if ye will not obey\n"
    .string "the commandments of the LORD your\l"
    .string "God, but turn aside out of the way\l"
    .string "which I command you this day, to go\l"
    .string "after other gods, which ye have not\l"
    .string "known$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_11_29::
