Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_20_15::
    .string "Thus shalt thou do unto all the\n"
    .string "cities which are very far off from\l"
    .string "thee, which are not of the cities of\l"
    .string "these nations.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_20_16::
    .string "But of the cities of these people,\n"
    .string "which the LORD thy God doth give thee\l"
    .string "for an inheritance, thou shalt save\l"
