    .string "have born him children, both the\l"
    .string "beloved and the hated; and if the\l"
    .string "firstborn son be hers that was hated:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_21_16::
    .string "Then it shall be, when he maketh\n"
    .string "his sons to inherit that which he\l"
    .string "hath, that he may not make the son of\l"
    .string "the beloved firstborn before the son\l"
    .string "of the hated, which is indeed the\l"
    .string "firstborn:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_21_17::
    .string "But he shall acknowledge the son\n"
    .string "of the hated for the firstborn, by\l"
    .string "giving him a double portion of all\l"
    .string "that he hath: for he is the beginning\l"
    .string "of his strength; the right of the\l"
    .string "firstborn is his$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_21_18::
    .string "If a man have a stubborn and\n"
    .string "rebellious son, which will not\l"
    .string "obey the voice of his father, or the\l"
