    .string "they have chastened him, will not\l"
    .string "hearken unto them:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_21_19::
    .string "Then shall his father and his\n"
    .string "mother lay hold on him, and bring\l"
    .string "him out unto the elders of his city,\l"
    .string "and unto the gate of his place;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_21_20::
    .string "And they shall say unto the elders\n"
    .string "of his city, This our son is stubborn\l"
    .string "and rebellious, he will not obey\l"
    .string "our voice; he is a glutton, and a\l"
    .string "drunkard$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_21_21::
    .string "And all the men of his city shall\n"
    .string "stone him with stones, that he die:\l"
    .string "so shalt thou put evil away from\l"
    .string "among you; and all Israel shall\l"
    .string "hear, and fear.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_21_22::
    .string "And if a man have committed a sin\n"
    .string "worthy of death, and he be to be put\l"
    .string "to death, and thou hang him on a tree:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_21_23::
    .string "His body shall not remain all\n"
    .string "night upon the tree, but thou shalt\l"
    .string "in any wise bury him that day; (for he\l"
    .string "that is hanged is accursed of God;)\l"
    .string "that thy land be not defiled, which\l"
    .string "the LORD thy God giveth thee for an\l"
    .string "inheritance$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_22_1::
    .string "Thou shalt not see thy brother’s ox\n"
    .string "or his sheep go astray, and hide\l"
