    .string "woman: so shalt thou put away evil\l"
    .string "from Israel.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_22_23::
    .string "If a damsel that is a virgin be\n"
    .string "betrothed unto an husband, and a man\l"
    .string "find her in the city, and lie with\l"
    .string "her;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_22_24::
    .string "Then ye shall bring them both out\n"
    .string "unto the gate of that city, and ye\l"
    .string "shall stone them with stones that\l"
