    .string "cried not, being in the city; and the\l"
    .string "man, because he hath humbled his\l"
    .string "neighbour’s wife: so thou shalt put\l"
    .string "away evil from among you$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_22_25::
    .string "But if a man find a betrothed\n"
    .string "damsel in the field, and the man\l"
    .string "force her, and lie with her: then the\l"
    .string "man only that lay with her shall\l"
    .string "die.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_22_26::
    .string "But unto the damsel thou shalt do\n"
    .string "nothing; there is in the damsel no\l"
