    .string "slayeth him, even so is this matter:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_22_27::
    .string "For he found her in the field, and\n"
    .string "the betrothed damsel cried, and\l"
    .string "there was none to save her$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_22_28::
    .string "If a man find a damsel that is a\n"
    .string "virgin, which is not betrothed, and\l"
    .string "lay hold on her, and lie with her,\l"
    .string "and they be found;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_22_29::
    .string "Then the man that lay with her\n"
    .string "shall give unto the damsel’s\l"
    .string "father fifty shekels of silver, and\l"
