    .string "hath humbled her, he may not put her\l"
    .string "away all his days$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_22_30::
    .string "A man shall not take his father’s\n"
    .string "wife, nor discover his father’s\l"
    .string "skirt.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_23_1::
    .string "He that is wounded in the stones, or\n"
    .string "hath his privy member cut off,\l"
    .string "shall not enter into the\l"
    .string "congregation of the LORD.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_23_2::
    .string "A bastard shall not enter into the\n"
    .string "congregation of the LORD; even to his\l"
    .string "tenth generation shall he not enter\l"
    .string "into the congregation of the LORD.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_23_3::
    .string "An Ammonite or Moabite shall not\n"
    .string "enter into the congregation of the\l"
    .string "LORD; even to their tenth generation\l"
    .string "shall they not enter into the\l"
    .string "congregation of the LORD for ever:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_23_4::
    .string "Because they met you not with bread\n"
    .string "and with water in the way, when ye\l"
    .string "came forth out of Egypt; and because\l"
    .string "they hired against thee Balaam the\l"
    .string "son of Beor of Pethor of\l"
    .string "Mesopotamia, to curse thee$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_23_5::
    .string "Nevertheless the LORD thy God\n"
    .string "would not hearken unto Balaam; but\l"
