    .string "of the camp, he shall not come\l"
    .string "within the camp:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_23_11::
    .string "But it shall be, when evening\n"
    .string "cometh on, he shall wash himself\l"
    .string "with water: and when the sun is down,\l"
