    .string "abomination unto the LORD thy God.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_23_19::
    .string "Thou shalt not lend upon usury to\n"
    .string "thy brother; usury of money, usury of\l"
    .string "victuals, usury of any thing that is\l"
