    .string "according to his fault, by a certain\l"
    .string "number.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_25_3::
    .string "Forty stripes he may give him, and\n"
    .string "not exceed: lest, if he should\l"
    .string "exceed, and beat him above these with\l"
