Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_31_18::
    .string "And I will surely hide my face in\n"
    .string "that day for all the evils which\l"
    .string "they shall have wrought, in that\l"
    .string "they are turned unto other gods$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_31_19::
    .string "Now therefore write ye this song for\n"
    .string "you, and teach it the children of\l"
    .string "Israel: put it in their mouths, that\l"
    .string "this song may be a witness for me\l"
    .string "against the children of Israel.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_31_20::
    .string "For when I shall have brought them\n"
    .string "into the land which I sware unto\l"
    .string "their fathers, that floweth with\l"
    .string "milk and honey; and they shall have\l"
    .string "eaten and filled themselves, and\l"
    .string "waxen fat; then will they turn unto\l"
    .string "other gods, and serve them, and\l"
    .string "provoke me, and break my covenant.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_31_21::
    .string "And it shall come to pass, when\n"
    .string "many evils and troubles are\l"
    .string "befallen them, that this song\l"
    .string "shall testify against them as a\l"
    .string "witness; for it shall not be\l"
    .string "forgotten out of the mouths of their\l"
    .string "seed: for I know their imagination\l"
    .string "which they go about, even now, before\l"
    .string "I have brought them into the land\l"
    .string "which I sware.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_31_22::
    .string "Moses therefore wrote this song the\n"
    .string "same day, and taught it the children\l"
    .string "of Israel.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_31_23::
    .string "And he gave Joshua the son of Nun a\n"
    .string "charge, and said, Be strong and of a\l"
    .string "good courage: for thou shalt bring\l"
    .string "the children of Israel into the\l"
    .string "land which I sware unto them: and I\l"
    .string "will be with thee.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_31_24::
    .string "And it came to pass, when Moses had\n"
    .string "made an end of writing the words of\l"
    .string "this law in a book, until they were\l"
    .string "finished,"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_31_25::
    .string "That Moses commanded the Levites,\n"
    .string "which bare the ark of the covenant of\l"
    .string "the LORD, saying,"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_31_26::
    .string "Take this book of the law, and put\n"
    .string "it in the side of the ark of the\l"
    .string "covenant of the LORD your God, that\l"
    .string "it may be there for a witness against\l"
    .string "thee$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_31_27::
    .string "For I know thy rebellion, and thy\n"
    .string "stiff neck: behold, while I am yet\l"
    .string "alive with you this day, ye have been\l"
    .string "rebellious against the LORD; and\l"
    .string "how much more after my death?"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_31_28::
    .string "Gather unto me all the elders of\n"
    .string "your tribes, and your officers, that\l"
    .string "I may speak these words in their\l"
    .string "ears, and call heaven and earth to\l"
    .string "record against them$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_31_29::
    .string "For I know that after my death ye\n"
    .string "will utterly corrupt yourselves,\l"
    .string "and turn aside from the way which I\l"
    .string "have commanded you; and evil will\l"
    .string "befall you in the latter days;\l"
    .string "because ye will do evil in the\l"
    .string "sight of the LORD, to provoke him to\l"
    .string "anger through the work of your hands.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_31_30::
    .string "And Moses spake in the ears of all\n"
    .string "the congregation of Israel the words\l"
    .string "of this song, until they were ended.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_1::
    .string "Give ear, O ye heavens, and I will\n"
    .string "speak; and hear, O earth, the words\l"
    .string "of my mouth.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_2::
    .string "My doctrine shall drop as the\n"
    .string "rain, my speech shall distil as\l"
    .string "the dew, as the small rain upon the\l"
    .string "tender herb, and as the showers upon\l"
    .string "the grass:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_3::
    .string "Because I will publish the name\n"
    .string "of the LORD: ascribe ye greatness\l"
    .string "unto our God$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_4::
    .string "He is the Rock, his work is perfect:\n"
    .string "for all his ways are judgment: a God\l"
    .string "of truth and without iniquity, just\l"
    .string "and right is he.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_5::
    .string "They have corrupted themselves,\n"
    .string "their spot is not the spot of his\l"
    .string "children: they are a perverse and\l"
    .string "crooked generation.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_6::
    .string "Do ye thus requite the LORD, O\n"
    .string "foolish people and unwise? is not\l"
    .string "he thy father that hath bought thee?\l"
    .string "hath he not made thee, and\l"
    .string "established thee?"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_7::
    .string "Remember the days of old, consider\n"
    .string "the years of many generations: ask\l"
    .string "thy father, and he will shew thee;\l"
    .string "thy elders, and they will tell\l"
    .string "thee$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_8::
    .string "When the Most High divided to the\n"
    .string "nations their inheritance, when he\l"
    .string "separated the sons of Adam, he set\l"
    .string "the bounds of the people according\l"
    .string "to the number of the children of\l"
    .string "Israel.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_9::
    .string "For the LORD’s portion is his\n"
    .string "people; Jacob is the lot of his\l"
    .string "inheritance.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_10::
    .string "He found him in a desert land, and\n"
    .string "in the waste howling wilderness; he\l"
    .string "led him about, he instructed him, he\l"
    .string "kept him as the apple of his eye.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_11::
    .string "As an eagle stirreth up her nest,\n"
    .string "fluttereth over her young,\l"
    .string "spreadeth abroad her wings, taketh\l"
    .string "them, beareth them on her wings:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_12::
    .string "So the LORD alone did lead him, and\n"
    .string "there was no strange god with him$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_13::
    .string "He made him ride on the high places\n"
    .string "of the earth, that he might eat the\l"
    .string "increase of the fields; and he made\l"
    .string "him to suck honey out of the rock, and\l"
    .string "oil out of the flinty rock;"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_14::
    .string "Butter of kine, and milk of sheep,\n"
    .string "with fat of lambs, and rams of the\l"
    .string "breed of Bashan, and goats, with the\l"
    .string "fat of kidneys of wheat; and thou\l"
    .string "didst drink the pure blood of the\l"
    .string "grape$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_15::
    .string "But Jeshurun waxed fat, and kicked:\n"
    .string "thou art waxen fat, thou art grown\l"
    .string "thick, thou art covered with fatness;\l"
