    .string "and lightly esteemed the Rock of\l"
    .string "his salvation.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_16::
    .string "They provoked him to jealousy with\n"
    .string "strange gods, with abominations\l"
    .string "provoked they him to anger.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_17::
    .string "They sacrificed unto devils, not to\n"
    .string "God; to gods whom they knew not, to\l"
    .string "new gods that came newly up, whom\l"
    .string "your fathers feared not.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_18::
    .string "Of the Rock that begat thee thou art\n"
    .string "unmindful, and hast forgotten God\l"
    .string "that formed thee.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_19::
    .string "And when the LORD saw it, he\n"
    .string "abhorred them, because of the\l"
    .string "provoking of his sons, and of his\l"
    .string "daughters.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_20::
    .string "And he said, I will hide my face\n"
    .string "from them, I will see what their end\l"
    .string "shall be: for they are a very\l"
    .string "froward generation, children in whom\l"
    .string "is no faith.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_21::
    .string "They have moved me to jealousy with\n"
    .string "that which is not God; they have\l"
    .string "provoked me to anger with their\l"
    .string "vanities: and I will move them to\l"
    .string "jealousy with those which are not a\l"
    .string "people; I will provoke them to\l"
    .string "anger with a foolish nation.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_22::
    .string "For a fire is kindled in mine anger,\n"
    .string "and shall burn unto the lowest\l"
    .string "hell, and shall consume the earth\l"
    .string "with her increase, and set on fire\l"
