Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_23::
    .string "I will heap mischiefs upon them;\n"
    .string "I will spend mine arrows upon them.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_24::
    .string "They shall be burnt with hunger,\n"
    .string "and devoured with burning heat, and\l"
    .string "with bitter destruction: I will\l"
    .string "also send the teeth of beasts upon\l"
    .string "them, with the poison of serpents of\l"
    .string "the dust.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_25::
    .string "The sword without, and terror\n"
    .string "within, shall destroy both the\l"
    .string "young man and the virgin, the\l"
    .string "suckling also with the man of gray\l"
    .string "hairs.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_26::
    .string "I said, I would scatter them into\n"
    .string "corners, I would make the\l"
    .string "remembrance of them to cease from\l"
    .string "among men:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_27::
    .string "Were it not that I feared the wrath\n"
    .string "of the enemy, lest their adversaries\l"
    .string "should behave themselves\l"
    .string "strangely, and lest they should\l"
    .string "say, Our hand is high, and the LORD\l"
    .string "hath not done all this$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_28::
    .string "For they are a nation void of\n"
    .string "counsel, neither is there any\l"
    .string "understanding in them.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_29::
    .string "O that they were wise, that they\n"
    .string "understood this, that they would\l"
    .string "consider their latter end!"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_30::
    .string "How should one chase a thousand,\n"
    .string "and two put ten thousand to flight,\l"
    .string "except their Rock had sold them, and\l"
    .string "the LORD had shut them up?"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_31::
    .string "For their rock is not as our Rock,\n"
    .string "even our enemies themselves being\l"
    .string "judges$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_32::
    .string "For their vine is of the vine of\n"
    .string "Sodom, and of the fields of\l"
    .string "Gomorrah: their grapes are grapes\l"
    .string "of gall, their clusters are bitter:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_33::
    .string "Their wine is the poison of\n"
    .string "dragons, and the cruel venom of asps$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_34::
    .string "Is not this laid up in store with\n"
    .string "me, and sealed up among my\l"
    .string "treasures?"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_35::
    .string "To me belongeth vengeance and\n"
    .string "recompence; their foot shall slide\l"
    .string "in due time: for the day of their\l"
    .string "calamity is at hand, and the things\l"
    .string "that shall come upon them make\l"
    .string "haste$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_36::
    .string "For the LORD shall judge his\n"
    .string "people, and repent himself for his\l"
    .string "servants, when he seeth that their\l"
    .string "power is gone, and there is none shut\l"
    .string "up, or left.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_37::
    .string "And he shall say, Where are their\n"
    .string "gods, their rock in whom they\l"
    .string "trusted,"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_38::
    .string "Which did eat the fat of their\n"
    .string "sacrifices, and drank the wine of\l"
    .string "their drink offerings? let them rise\l"
    .string "up and help you, and be your\l"
    .string "protection$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_39::
    .string "See now that I, even I, am he, and\n"
