    .string "children of Israel for a\l"
    .string "possession:"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_32_50::
    .string "And die in the mount whither thou\n"
    .string "goest up, and be gathered unto thy\l"
    .string "people; as Aaron thy brother died in\l"
