    .string "of saints: from his right hand went a\l"
    .string "fiery law for them.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_33_3::
    .string "Yea, he loved the people; all\n"
    .string "his saints are in thy hand: and they\l"
    .string "sat down at thy feet; every one\l"
    .string "shall receive of thy words.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_33_4::
