    .string "to the ends of the earth: and they are\l"
    .string "the ten thousands of Ephraim, and\l"
    .string "they are the thousands of Manasseh.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_33_18::
    .string "And of Zebulun he said, Rejoice,\n"
