    .string "abundance of the seas, and of\l"
    .string "treasures hid in the sand.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_33_20::
    .string "And of Gad he said, Blessed be he\n"
    .string "that enlargeth Gad: he dwelleth as\l"
    .string "a lion, and teareth the arm with the\l"
    .string "crown of the head.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_33_21::
    .string "And he provided the first part for\n"
    .string "himself, because there, in a\l"
    .string "portion of the lawgiver, was he\l"
