    .string "the people, he executed the justice\l"
    .string "of the LORD, and his judgments with\l"
    .string "Israel.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_33_22::
    .string "And of Dan he said, Dan is a lion’s\n"
    .string "whelp: he shall leap from Bashan.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_33_23::
    .string "And of Naphtali he said, O\n"
    .string "Naphtali, satisfied with favour,\l"
    .string "and full with the blessing of the\l"
    .string "LORD: possess thou the west and the\l"
    .string "south.$"
Bible_Text_Deuteronomy_33_24::
    .string "And of Asher he said, Let Asher be\n"
    .string "blessed with children; let him be\l"
    .string "acceptable to his brethren, and let\l"
