    .string "take up his cross, and follow me.$"
Bible_Text_Matthew_16_25::
    .string "For whosoever will save his life\n"
    .string "shall lose it: and whosoever will\l"
    .string "lose his life for my sake shall\l"
    .string "find it.$"
Bible_Text_Matthew_16_26::
    .string "For what is a man profited, if he\n"
    .string "shall gain the whole world, and\l"
