    .string "angels; and then he shall reward\l"
    .string "every man according to his works$"
Bible_Text_Matthew_16_28::
    .string "Verily I say unto you, There be some\n"
    .string "standing here, which shall not\l"
    .string "taste of death, till they see the\l"
    .string "Son of man coming in his kingdom.$"
Bible_Text_Matthew_17_1::
    .string "And after six days Jesus taketh\n"
    .string "Peter, James, and John his brother,\l"
    .string "and bringeth them up into an high\l"
    .string "mountain apart,"
Bible_Text_Matthew_17_2::
