Bible_Text_Matthew_17_16::
    .string "And I brought him to thy disciples,\n"
    .string "and they could not cure him.$"
Bible_Text_Matthew_17_17::
    .string "Then Jesus answered and said, O\n"
    .string "faithless and perverse generation,\l"
