Bible_Text_Matthew_17_21::
    .string "Howbeit this kind goeth not out but\n"
    .string "by prayer and fasting.$"
Bible_Text_Matthew_17_22::
    .string "And while they abode in Galilee,\n"
    .string "Jesus said unto them, The Son of man\l"
    .string "shall be betrayed into the hands of\l"
