    .string "children, or of strangers?"
Bible_Text_Matthew_17_26::
    .string "Peter saith unto him, Of strangers.\n"
    .string "Jesus saith unto him, Then are the\l"
    .string "children free$"
Bible_Text_Matthew_17_27::
    .string "Notwithstanding, lest we should\n"
    .string "offend them, go thou to the sea, and\l"
