    .string "come unto me: for of such is the\l"
    .string "kingdom of heaven.$"
Bible_Text_Matthew_19_15::
    .string "And he laid his hands on them, and\n"
    .string "departed thence.$"
Bible_Text_Matthew_19_16::
    .string "And, behold, one came and said unto\n"
